msgstr "Same rules as Ranked"

msgid "登场一段时间后进入的强化状态：最大生命值与攻击力大幅提升，体型变大。"
msgstr "An empowered state entered some time after spawning: greatly increased max health and attack damage, and a bigger body."

msgid "【涨潮】结束后移除全部加成。此效果不会致死，生命值降至新的上限。"
msgstr "Removes all [High Tide] bonuses when it ends. This can't kill; health drops to the new maximum."

msgid "灵火"
msgstr "Spirit Flame"

msgid "攻击对敌人施加的层数。达到最大层数时引爆，造成基于该敌人最大生命值的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Stacks applied to enemies by attacks. At max stacks it detonates, dealing true damage based on the enemy's max health."

msgid "破损"
msgstr "Fracture"

msgid "叠加在同一名敌人身上的层数，不会随时间衰减。达到最大层数后，此装备造成的伤害转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Stacks on a single enemy that don't decay. At max stacks, this item's damage becomes true damage."

msgid "弓箭系叠加在敌人身上的层数，与弓箭羁绊共用同一份层数。"
msgstr "Stacks Bow items apply to enemies. Shared with the Bow synergy."

msgid "持续伤害的负面状态：每秒造成基于目标最大生命值百分比的真实伤害，无视护甲与魔抗。不可叠加，重复施加时累加剩余持续时间。"
msgstr "A damage-over-time debuff: deals true damage each second equal to a percentage of the target's max health, ignoring armor and magic resist. Doesn't stack; reapplying adds to the remaining duration."

msgid "幽灵护盾"
msgstr "Ghost Shield"

msgid "生命值低于阈值时获得的一次性护盾，在数秒内线性衰减。"
msgstr "A one-time shield gained when health drops below a threshold. Decays steadily over a few seconds."

msgid "奶油护盾"
msgstr "Cream Shield"

msgid "每个战场开始时为全队提供的护盾，永久不衰减。护盾被击破时对周围的敌人造成伤害。"
msgstr "A shield given to the whole team at the start of each battle. Never decays. Damages nearby enemies when broken."

msgid "终极护盾"
msgstr "Ultimate Shield"

msgid "永久不衰减的护盾。护盾存在期间，自身变为蛋糕礼盒：射程变为近战，攻击与技能也替换为礼盒专属版本。"
msgstr "A shield that never decays. While it holds, the holder becomes a Cake Box: range becomes melee, and attacks and abilities are replaced with Cake Box versions."

msgid "护心反伤"
msgstr "Heartguard Thorns"

msgid "每次受到一段攻击时，对攻击者反弹一次魔法伤害。持续伤害不会触发此效果，多段攻击的每一段单独触发。"
msgstr "Each hit taken reflects magic damage to the attacker. Damage over time doesn't trigger it; each hit of a multi-hit attack triggers separately."

msgid "金弹"
msgstr "Golden Bullet"

msgid "枪羁绊：每发射若干发普通子弹后发射一发金弹，金弹继承该发子弹的全部效果并额外造成真实伤害。"
msgstr "Gun synergy: after a number of normal shots, fires a Golden Bullet that keeps all of that shot's effects and deals bonus true damage."

msgid "剑士"
msgstr "Swordsman"

msgid "剑羁绊：连续命中同一个目标时触发追打。"
msgstr "Sword synergy: hitting the same target triggers follow-up strikes."

msgid "地毯轰炸"
msgstr "Carpet Bombing"

msgid "直升机龟的龟能充满时施放的大招：沿覆盖敌人最多的航线飞行，沿途投弹。"
msgstr "The Gyrocopter Turtle's ultimate at full Energy: flies the route covering the most enemies, bombing along the way."

msgid "十字斩"
msgstr "Cross Slash"

msgid "手半剑替换原技能的招式：先横斩并释放一道横波，随后竖斩。"
msgstr "The Bastard Sword's replacement move: a horizontal slash that sends out a horizontal wave, then a vertical slash."

msgid "登场时给予敌人的枪。持枪者属性提升，但每次攻击会损失生命值。"
msgstr "A gun handed to enemies at spawn. The holder gains stats but loses health on every attack."

msgid "小木斧召唤的近战随从。生命值与攻击力随砍伐经验提升。"
msgstr "A melee follower summoned by the Little Wooden Axe. Its health and attack damage grow with Chopping XP."

msgid "蓄力猛砸"
msgstr "Charged Slam"

msgid "钻石斧的技能：蓄力后砸下，对前方区域内的敌人造成物理伤害，并将其击飞和眩晕。"
msgstr "The Diamond Axe's ability: charges up and slams down, dealing physical damage to enemies in front, knocking them up and stunning them."

msgid "效率"
msgstr "Efficiency"

msgid "金斧攻击命中时叠加的层数，提供攻击速度与移动速度，叠加时刷新持续时间。"
msgstr "Stacks gained when the Gold Axe hits. Grants attack speed and move speed; stacking refreshes the duration."

msgid "余烬种子"
msgstr "Ember Seed"

msgid "余烬攻击命中时叠加在目标身上的层数，每层提高该目标的斩杀线。"
msgstr "Stacks Ember applies to targets on hit. Each stack raises that target's execute threshold."

msgid "法力"
msgstr "Mana"

msgid "每件法器各自的法力条：每 2.5 秒回复 15 点，携带者用技能造成伤害或受到伤害时也会回复。充满时释放该法器的主动效果，随后重新回复。法器效果自身造成的伤害不回复法力。激活法器羁绊可减少充满所需的法力。"
msgstr "Each Artifact has its own mana bar: regenerates 15 every 2.5 seconds, and also when the holder deals ability damage or takes damage. When full, it casts that Artifact's active effect, then refills. Damage from Artifact effects doesn't restore mana. An active Artifact synergy reduces the mana needed to fill."

msgid "迷你水晶"
msgstr "Mini Crystal"

msgid "迷你水晶球施加在敌人身上的层数。达到最大层数时引爆，造成基于该敌人最大生命值的魔法伤害，并重置层数。"
msgstr "Stacks the Mini Crystal Ball applies to enemies. At max stacks it detonates, dealing magic damage based on the enemy's max health, and resets."

msgid "符纸"
msgstr "Talisman"

msgid "符咒贴在敌人身上的持续伤害效果，期间每秒降低其魔抗。可叠加，目标死亡时以剩余持续时间转移给最近的敌人。"
msgstr "A damage-over-time effect from the Talisman that also lowers magic resist each second. Stacks. When the target dies, it moves to the nearest enemy with its remaining duration."

msgid "星际龟的技能：以自身为中心释放一圈向外扩散的环形波。"
msgstr "Space Turtle's ability: releases a ring wave that expands outward from itself."

msgid "星际龟的技能：扭曲一片区域的空间。"
msgstr "Space Turtle's ability: warps space in an area."

msgid "寒冰龟在地面留下的减速领域。冰柱层数会同时提升其范围与持续时间。"
msgstr "A slowing zone Ice Turtle leaves on the ground. Ice Pillar stacks increase both its size and duration."

msgid "海胆护盾"
msgstr "Urchin Shield"

msgid "海胆每次受到伤害时叠加一层硬化，层数达到上限时为自身提供的护盾，随后在数秒内逐渐衰减。"
msgstr "The urchin gains a Harden stack each time it takes damage. At max stacks it shields itself, and the shield decays over a few seconds."

msgid "余烬施加的状态：期间该敌人受到的灼烧伤害全部转为真实伤害（不受魔抗减免）。对龟蛋的灼烧伤害会降低，数值见燃烧瓶。"
msgstr "A status from Ember: Burn damage this enemy takes becomes true damage (not reduced by magic resist). Reduced against Turtle Eggs; see Molotov for values."

msgid "靶子"
msgstr "Target"

msgid "敌人被己方击飞时获得的标记，不会自然消失。飞镖每个周期向所有带有标记的敌人各发射一枚，命中后移除标记。"
msgstr "A mark enemies get when your team knocks them up. It doesn't expire on its own. Each cycle, Darts fires one dart at every marked enemy; a hit removes the mark."

msgid "时间停止"
msgstr "Time Stop"

msgid "沙漏释放的全场定格：除持有全场最高星级沙漏的龟之外，所有单位、弹道与特效全部静止。"
msgstr "The Hourglass freezes the whole field: every unit, projectile and effect stops, except the turtle holding the highest-star Hourglass."

msgid "四强"
msgstr "Top 4"

msgid "进入决赛日"
msgstr "Enter Finals Day"

msgid "满配额"
msgstr "Full quota"

msgid "双方同时开赛，结果于本轮开播时公布。\n可在对阵图查看。"
msgstr "Both sides start at the same time. Results are revealed when this round goes live.\nSee them in the bracket."

msgid "换一个"
msgstr "Shuffle"

msgid "云端同步已暂停，请处理存档冲突"
msgstr "Cloud sync paused. Please resolve the save conflict."

msgid "绑定账号，保存进度"
msgstr "Link an account to save your progress"

msgid "绑定邮箱，跨设备同步进度"
msgstr "Link an email to sync progress across devices"

msgid "绑定邮箱后，更换设备或重新安装可恢复进度。"
msgstr "With a linked email, you can restore your progress on a new device or after reinstalling."

msgid "\n未绑定时进度仅保存在本设备。邮箱与昵称可随时修改。"
msgstr "\nWithout a linked account, progress is saved on this device only. You can change your email and nickname anytime."

msgid "\n未收到验证码？请检查垃圾邮件，或返回更换邮箱。"
msgstr "\nNo code? Check your spam folder, or go back and change the email."

msgid "已晋级周日决赛日。"
msgstr "Qualified for Sunday's Finals Day."

msgid "本周闯关赛已结束。"
msgstr "This week's Gauntlet has ended."

msgid "下一场胜利即晋级决赛日，失败即淘汰。"
msgstr "Win the next match to reach Finals Day. Lose and you're out."

msgid "再胜 1 场即可晋级决赛日。"
msgstr "1 more win to reach Finals Day."

msgid "再负 1 场即淘汰。"
msgstr "1 more loss and you're out."

msgid "小组赛"
msgstr "Group Stage"

msgid "休赛日不开放对战"
msgstr "No matches on off days"

msgid "今日决赛日，比赛在对阵图中进行。"
msgstr "It's Finals Day. Matches are played in the bracket."

msgid "今日决赛日。本周止步闯关赛，可观战。下一轮积分赛：下周二开始。"
msgstr "It's Finals Day. You went out in the Gauntlet this week and can spectate. Next Ranked: starts next Tuesday."

msgid "今日决赛日。本周未晋级闯关赛，可观战。下一轮积分赛：下周二开始。"
msgstr "It's Finals Day. You didn't qualify for the Gauntlet this week and can spectate. Next Ranked: starts next Tuesday."

