msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.RUST_IV} 秒甩出一道剑气，造成（60/75/100% 攻击力+40/60/100×暴击率）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.RUST_IV} seconds, flings a sword wave that deals (60/75/100% Attack + 40/60/100 × Crit Chance) physical damage."

msgid "【法力】充满时连斩随机敌人 5/6/8 次。溢出的治疗转化为血护盾。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, slashes random enemies 5/6/8 times. Overflow healing becomes a Blood Shield."

msgid "登场时获得携带者最大生命值 {C:MagicShield.SEAWEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的魔法护盾。每 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_IV} 秒获得 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_SHIELD}+携带者最大生命值 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "On spawn, gains a Magic Shield equal to {C:MagicShield.SEAWEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% of max health. Every {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_IV} seconds, gains a {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_SHIELD} + {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每次被攻击或技能命中时叠加 1 层硬化，每层提供 1/1.5/2 护甲和魔抗（上限 {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_CAP} 层），层数达到上限时获得护盾。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Harden stack whenever hit by an attack or ability. Each stack grants 1/1.5/2 Armor and Magic Resist (max {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_CAP} stacks). At max stacks, gains a shield."

msgid "每次被攻击或技能命中时叠加 1 层硬化，每层提供 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HARDEN_INC} 护甲和魔抗。达到 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_CAP} 层后，每 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_IV} 秒对全体敌人汲取生命。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Harden stack whenever hit by an attack or ability, each granting {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HARDEN_INC} Armor and Magic Resist. At {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_CAP} stacks, drains health from all enemies every {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_IV} seconds."

msgid "每反伤 300/270/230 点获得护盾，并使下次攻击施加 30/50/90 层流血。反伤命中时，对目标施加 {C:ThornCut.AMP_CUT%}% 治疗削减和护盾削减，持续 {C:ThornCut.CUT_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "For every 300/270/230 damage reflected, gains a shield and the next attack applies 30/50/90 Bleed. Reflected hits apply {C:ThornCut.AMP_CUT%}% Grievous Wounds and shield reduction for {C:ThornCut.CUT_SEC} seconds."

msgid "受到的非真实伤害每段减少 3/6/10 点。每 {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_IV} 秒生成一份护盾，由全队分摊。"
msgstr "Reduces each instance of non-true damage taken by 3/6/10. Every {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_IV} seconds, creates a shield split across the team."

msgid "免疫击飞与斩杀。治疗友军积累充能，攻击消耗充能，击飞并眩晕最近的敌人。"
msgstr "Immune to knock-ups and executes. Healing allies builds charge; attacks spend it to knock up and stun the nearest enemy."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.SHELL_IV} 秒回复 30/45/60+携带者最大生命值 5/9/15% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.SHELL_IV} seconds, heals 30/45/60 + 5/9/15% of max health."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.ANEMONE_IV} 秒治疗携带者与生命百分比最低的友军。每累计提供 200/180/150 点治疗获得 1 层海葵。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.ANEMONE_IV} seconds, heals itself and the ally with the lowest health percentage. Gains 1 Anemone stack for every 200/180/150 healing provided."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.DUMBBELL_IV} 秒获得 1 层锻炼，使最大生命值+40/75/110，并投掷哑铃击飞最近的敌人。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.DUMBBELL_IV} seconds, gains 1 Workout stack for +40/75/110 Max Health and throws a dumbbell that knocks up the nearest enemy."

msgid "攻击命中后，施加 7.5/10/15% 攻击力的流血层数。"
msgstr "On hit, applies Bleed stacks equal to 7.5/10/15% of Attack."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_IV} 秒连接攻击力最高的友军，为其承受 25/40/60% 的攻击与技能伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_IV} seconds, tethers to the ally with the highest Attack and takes 25/40/60% of the attack and ability damage dealt to it."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_IV} 秒抛出火瓶，造成 40/60/100 真实伤害并施加真火，持续 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_IV} seconds, throws a fire flask that deals 40/60/100 true damage and applies True Flame for {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "攻击额外施加灼烧。【法力】充满时挥出火焰波，施加灼烧。"
msgstr "Attacks also apply Burn. [Mana] When full, sweeps out a fire wave that applies Burn."

msgid "每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒积累 1 层吐息，达到 3 层时召唤喷火龙贯穿全场，对沿途敌人造成（45/80/120+100% 攻击力）魔法伤害并施加灼烧，为沿途友军与携带者回复（45/80/120+100% 攻击力）生命值。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Breath stack every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds. At 3 stacks, summons a fire dragon that sweeps across the field, dealing (45/80/120 + 100% Attack) magic damage and applying Burn to enemies in its path, and healing allies in its path and itself for (45/80/120 + 100% Attack)."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.THUNDER_IV} 秒降下 1/2/3 道雷，每道造成 100% 攻击力真实伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.THUNDER_IV} seconds, calls down 1/2/3 lightning bolts, each dealing 100% Attack as true damage."

msgid "【法力】充满时发射连锁闪电，共命中 7/10/15 次。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, fires chain lightning that hits 7/10/15 times in total."

msgid "每 3 秒充能一次，下一次攻击追加 30/40/50 魔法伤害并眩晕目标。"
msgstr "Charges every 3 seconds. The next attack deals 30/40/50 bonus magic damage and stuns the target."

msgid "每 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_IV} 秒抛出冰瓶，造成（{C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_BASE}+{C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_ATK%}% 攻击力 + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_MAXHP%}% 目标最大生命值）魔法伤害并施加冰寒 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_CHILL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:IceSystem.VIAL_IV} seconds, throws an ice flask that deals ({C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_BASE} + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_ATK%}% Attack + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health) magic damage and applies Chill for {C:IceSystem.VIAL_CHILL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "【法力】充满时获得护盾并推出冰道，冰封命中的敌人 1/1.8/2.5 秒。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, gains a shield and sends out an ice path that freezes enemies hit for 1/1.8/2.5 seconds."

msgid "【法力】充满时发射贯穿光束。【迷你水晶】达到 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, fires a piercing beam. [Mini Crystal] Detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} stacks."

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中后，向目标周围溅射 15/28/50% 本段伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit splashes 15/28/50% of its damage around the target."

msgid "【法力】充满时进行 {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° 水晶射线扫射并偷取魔抗。【迷你水晶】达到 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, sweeps a crystal ray across {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° and steals Magic Resist. [Mini Crystal] Detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} stacks."

msgid "登场时召唤一只【亡灵骷髅】，其受到的任何攻击均只造成 1 点伤害。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an [Undead Skeleton] that takes only 1 damage from any attack."

msgid "彻底阵亡时在原位变为一只【海螺虫】继续战斗，并随机携带 3 件装备。"
msgstr "When the holder dies for good, it turns into a [Conch Bug] that fights on, carrying 3 random items."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_IV} 秒派出小熊撞击最近的敌人。派出 {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_BEARS_TO_SUMMON} 只小熊后召唤一只【大熊】。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_IV} seconds, sends a little bear to ram the nearest enemy. After sending {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_BEARS_TO_SUMMON} little bears, summons a [Big Bear]."

msgid "每秒回复 2/5/10+携带者最大生命值 0.3/0.8/1.2% 的生命值。孵化进度满 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_FULL} 时获得 1 点临时等级，上限 3/4/5 级。"
msgstr "Heals 2/5/10 + 0.3/0.8/1.2% of max health per second. Gains 1 temporary level each time hatching reaches {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_FULL}, up to 3/4/5 levels."

msgid "蜡烛每 {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} 秒切换阶段：微弱阶段持续治疗，燃烧阶段爆燃并施加灼烧。"
msgstr "The candle switches phase every {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} seconds: the Flicker phase heals over time; the Blaze phase flares up and applies Burn."

msgid "攻击叠加放大层数，每层提供 1/2/5% 增伤。每 {C:SignalWaveSystem.EVERY} 层爆发一道弧形电磁波。"
msgstr "Attacks build Amplify stacks, each granting 1/2/5% Damage Amp. Every {C:SignalWaveSystem.EVERY} stacks, releases an arcing electromagnetic wave."

msgid "每 3 次攻击射出竹箭，命中后永久提升最大生命值 50/70/90。"
msgstr "Every 3 attacks, fires a bamboo arrow. On hit, permanently gains 50/70/90 Max Health."

msgid "登场时给予 1/2/3 名敌人各一把古灵精怪枪。之后每 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_IV} 秒随机抽取 1/2/4 个状态。"
msgstr "On spawn, gives 1/2/3 enemies a Trickster Gun each. Then draws 1/2/4 random statuses every {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_IV} seconds."

msgid "攻击和技能可处决生命值低于最大生命值 4/6/12% 的敌人。每 {C:EquipSystem.FANG_IV} 秒射出一颗毒牙并回复生命值。"
msgstr "Attacks and abilities execute enemies below 4/6/12% of their max health. Every {C:EquipSystem.FANG_IV} seconds, fires a venom fang and heals."

msgid "登场 {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_DELAY} 秒后进入【涨潮】，期间提升最大生命值、攻击力、体型与射程，结束后进入【退潮】。"
msgstr "{C:EquipSystem.TIDE_DELAY} seconds after spawning, enters [High Tide], gaining max health, attack damage, size and range. Enters [Low Tide] when it ends."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.RIPPLE_IV} 秒为全队各回复其已损失生命值的 3/6/10%。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.RIPPLE_IV} seconds, heals each ally for 3/6/10% of its missing health."

msgid "【法力】充满时掀起横贯全场的浪墙：友军获得护盾与双抗，敌人被击飞并失去双抗。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, raises a wave wall across the whole field: allies gain a shield, Armor and Magic Resist; enemies are knocked up and lose Armor and Magic Resist."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}% 时，{C:EquipSystem.NECKLACE_HOT_SEC} 秒内回复携带者最大生命值 40/85/130%。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}%, heals 40/85/130% of max health over {C:EquipSystem.NECKLACE_HOT_SEC} seconds."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}% 时回复 30/60/100% 最大生命值，并发射火球点燃敌人。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}%, heals 30/60/100% of max health and launches fireballs that ignite enemies."

msgid "每闪避一次攻击，获得 30/50/120 点护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Each dodged attack grants a 30/50/120 shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.HANDGUN_IV} 秒射出 4/5/6 发子弹，每发造成 50/90/150% 攻击力物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.HANDGUN_IV} seconds, fires 4/5/6 bullets, each dealing 50/90/150% Attack as physical damage."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_IV} 秒朝最远的敌人连射 1/2/3 发，伤害随目标已损失生命值提升。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_IV} seconds, fires 1/2/3 bolts at the farthest enemy. Damage increases with the target's missing health."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.GATLING_IV} 秒打出 20/30/60 发子弹，命中的目标永久失去 1/2/3 护甲。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.GATLING_IV} seconds, fires 20/30/60 bullets. Targets hit permanently lose 1/2/3 Armor."

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中有 50/75/100% 概率追加一次 70/80/100% 攻击力刺击。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit has a 50/75/100% chance to add a stab dealing 70/80/100% Attack."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_IV} 秒打出一道贯穿激光，对首个敌人造成 150/200/280% 攻击力的伤害并施加流血。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_IV} seconds, fires a piercing laser that deals 150/200/280% Attack to the first enemy and applies Bleed."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_IV} 秒射出 1 发子弹，造成 150/310/1200 点物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_IV} seconds, fires 1 bullet that deals 150/310/1200 physical damage."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_IV} 秒打出 12/14/18 颗弹珠。被 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_STUN_HITS} 颗及以上弹珠命中的敌人眩晕 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_IV} seconds, fires 12/14/18 pellets. Enemies hit by {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_STUN_HITS} or more pellets are stunned for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "累计造成 {C:HookBombSystem.TRIGGER_DMG} 点伤害后投出钩索炸弹，持续造成伤害，直到目标死亡。"
msgstr "After dealing {C:HookBombSystem.TRIGGER_DMG} total damage, throws a hook bomb that keeps dealing damage until the target dies."

msgid "被击飞的敌人获得靶子标记。每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒向所有带有靶子的敌人各射出一枚飞镖。"
msgstr "Enemies that get knocked up are marked as Targets. Every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds, throws a dart at each marked enemy."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_IV} 秒狙击生命值百分比最低的敌人。若这一枪造成击杀，则重新蓄力再开一枪。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_IV} seconds, snipes the enemy with the lowest health percentage. If the shot kills, reloads and fires again."

msgid "登场时召唤一座不可移动的炮台，炮台的攻击永久累积暴击率。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an immobile turret whose attacks permanently build Crit Chance."

msgid "登场第 {C:TimestopSystem.TS_START_T} 秒发动时间停止，全场定格 4/7/20 秒，每个战场各一次。"
msgstr "At {C:TimestopSystem.TS_START_T} seconds after spawning, casts Time Stop, freezing the whole field for 4/7/20 seconds. Once per battle."

msgid "伞收起 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} 秒后撑开 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_OPEN} 秒，期间携带者与附近的队友获得 11/22/35% 减伤。"
msgstr "The umbrella opens for {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_OPEN} seconds after being closed for {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} seconds. While open, it and nearby allies gain 11/22/35% Damage Reduction."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.SWORD_STORM_IV} 秒召出一排剑穿过全体敌人，各造成（70/100/400+80/130/400% 攻击力）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.SWORD_STORM_IV} seconds, summons a row of swords that pass through all enemies, each dealing (70/100/400 + 80/130/400% Attack) physical damage."

msgid "攻击额外造成目标 2/2.5/3% 最大生命值的魔法伤害并施加破损，在 {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} 层时转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Attacks deal bonus magic damage equal to 2/2.5/3% of the target's max health and apply Fracture. At {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} stacks, this becomes true damage."

msgid "释放技能后，下次攻击额外造成物理伤害并回复其中 {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_LEECH%}% 的生命值，伤害随技能消耗的龟能提高。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, the next attack deals bonus physical damage and heals for {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_LEECH%}% of it. Damage scales with the Energy the ability cost."

msgid "释放技能后获得攻击速度。攻击对敌人施加一层【灵火】，可叠加 3 层，满层时引爆，造成基于该敌人最大生命值的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Gains attack speed after casting an ability. Attacks apply a [Spirit Flame] stack to enemies, up to 3. At max stacks it detonates, dealing true damage based on the enemy's max health."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_HP_LINE%}% 时获得 50/80/160% 最大生命值的幽灵护盾，破碎时诅咒敌人。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_HP_LINE%}%, gains a Ghost Shield equal to 50/80/160% of max health. When it breaks, it curses enemies."

msgid "每次攻击获得 {C:EqPotionBatch.LIVER_ENERGY} 点龟能与 3/5/7% 攻击速度，可无限叠加。"
msgstr "Each attack grants {C:EqPotionBatch.LIVER_ENERGY} Energy and 3/5/7% attack speed, stacking infinitely."

msgid "登场第 {C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_AT} 秒饮用药水：免疫控制效果直到本战场结束，并提升多项属性。"
msgstr "At {C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_AT} seconds after spawning, drinks the potion: immune to crowd control until the battle ends, and gains several stats."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.VIAL_IV} 秒向敌人最密集处投掷毒瓶，施加 40/70/110 层中毒并施加治疗削减。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.VIAL_IV} seconds, throws a poison vial at the densest group of enemies, applying 40/70/110 Poison and Grievous Wounds."

msgid "将受到的伤害储存为充能。每 {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} 秒消耗全部充能，转化为法力护盾并发射激光。"
msgstr "Stores damage taken as charge. Every {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} seconds, spends all charge to gain a mana shield and fire a laser."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_1%}%、{C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_2%}%、{C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_3%}% 时各吃下一块蛋糕，依次获得最大生命值、攻击力与护盾。"
msgstr "Eats a slice of cake the first time health drops below {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_1%}%, {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_2%}% and {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_3%}%, gaining max health, attack damage and a shield in turn."

msgid "攻击附带携带者 3/4.5/7% 最大生命值的伤害并溅射。受到的伤害存入灰色血条并转化为生命回复。"
msgstr "Attacks deal bonus damage equal to 3/4.5/7% of own max health and splash. Damage taken is stored in a gray health bar and turned into healing."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.BROADSWORD_IV} 秒挥出一道贯穿直线的剑气墙，并获得总伤害 50/75/100% 的护盾。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.BROADSWORD_IV} seconds, swings out a piercing wall of sword energy and gains a shield equal to 50/75/100% of the total damage."

msgid "每个战场开始时为全队提供各自最大生命值 10/18/25% 的奶油护盾，护盾破碎时对周围敌人造成伤害。"
msgstr "At the start of each battle, gives each ally a Cream Shield equal to 10/18/25% of its max health. When broken, it damages nearby enemies."

msgid "获得携带者最大生命值 50/80/120% 的终极护盾，护盾存在期间化身蛋糕礼盒并嘲讽敌人。"
msgstr "Gains an Ultimate Shield equal to 50/80/120% of max health. While it holds, becomes a Cake Box and taunts enemies."

msgid "每次攻击时，藤蔓小球射出一支藤蔓箭。藤蔓箭暴击时转为真实伤害并提升攻击速度。"
msgstr "Each attack, a vine orb fires a vine arrow. Critical vine arrows deal true damage and grant attack speed."

msgid "每次攻击获得可无限叠加的护盾，并附带魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack grants an infinitely stacking shield and deals bonus magic damage."

msgid "每 {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_IV} 秒在敌人最密集处降下一轮箭雨。目标每远离 {C:EqBowBatch.AMP_PER_PX} 码，攻击、技能与箭雨对其造成的伤害提升 3/4/5%。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_IV} seconds, rains arrows on the densest group of enemies. For every {C:EqBowBatch.AMP_PER_PX} units of distance, attacks, abilities and arrow rain deal 3/4/5% more damage to the target."

msgid "释放技能后连续射出竹箭贯穿敌人，每穿过一个敌人偷取 0.5/0.5/1 点龟能。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, fires a burst of bamboo arrows that pierce enemies, stealing 0.5/0.5/1 Energy per enemy pierced."

msgid "生成一把【小手枪】协同攻击，其受到的所有伤害降为 {C:EqGunBatch.PISTOL_DMG_CAP} 点。"
msgstr "Creates a [Little Pistol] that attacks alongside. All damage it takes is reduced to {C:EqGunBatch.PISTOL_DMG_CAP}."

msgid "附近有敌人时，每 {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_IV} 秒左右两管交替开火：左管发射锥形霰弹，右管发射可连锁全场的电击弹。"
msgstr "With enemies nearby, the two barrels fire in turn every {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_IV} seconds: the left fires a cone of buckshot, the right fires a shock round that can chain across the field."

msgid "在身后生成一座【急救塔】，攻击对敌人造成伤害，并为生命百分比最低的友军回复生命值。"
msgstr "Creates an [Aid Tower] behind it. Its attacks damage enemies and heal the ally with the lowest health percentage."

msgid "登场时召唤一架直升机进行扫射。直升机龟能满时沿航线发动地毯轰炸。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a gyrocopter that strafes enemies. At full Energy, it carpet-bombs along its route."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.CORAL_IV} 秒向最远的敌人射出珊瑚刺，造成 100/120/150% 攻击力物理伤害，外加 8/12/18% 目标最大生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.CORAL_IV} seconds, fires a coral spike at the farthest enemy, dealing 100/120/150% Attack as physical damage plus 8/12/18% of the target's max health as magic damage."

msgid "每受到携带者最大生命值 40/35/30% 的伤害，举盾 2.5/3/3.5 秒，期间获得护盾与双抗。"
msgstr "For every 40/35/30% of max health taken as damage, raises its shield for 2.5/3/3.5 seconds, gaining a shield, Armor and Magic Resist."

msgid "每受到一段攻击反伤 3/5/8 点。每反伤 {C:EqBladeBatch.CLAM_PER_CHARGE} 次获得一层充能，攻击消耗充能并回复生命值。"
msgstr "Reflects 3/5/8 damage per hit taken. Every {C:EqBladeBatch.CLAM_PER_CHARGE} reflects grants a charge; attacks spend charges to heal."

msgid "每损失 1% 生命值获得 0.2/0.3/0.4% 攻击速度。连续命中同一目标时叠加增伤。"
msgstr "Gains 0.2/0.3/0.4% attack speed for every 1% health lost. Hitting the same target repeatedly builds Damage Amp."

msgid "近战携带：技能替换为十字斩，射程变为 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_RANGE}，并获得增伤。远程携带：射程转化为生命值、攻击力与生命偷取，并获得减伤。"
msgstr "Melee holder: ability becomes Cross Slash, range becomes {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_RANGE}, and gains Damage Amp. Ranged holder: range converts into health, attack damage and Lifesteal, and gains Damage Reduction."

msgid "将受到伤害的 5/9/15% 转化为龟能，每秒上限 20/40/60 点。"
msgstr "Converts 5/9/15% of damage taken into Energy, up to 20/40/60 per second."

msgid "每 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_GEN_IV} 秒生成一个浮游炮（最多 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_CAP} 个），累计攻击次数达到后齐射终极射线。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_GEN_IV} seconds, creates a drone cannon (up to {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_CAP}). After enough attacks, they fire an ultimate ray together."

msgid "每 15/10/4 秒偷取并释放一个训龟大师的技能。受到的伤害先存入压载舱。"
msgstr "Every 15/10/4 seconds, steals and casts one of the Turtle Trainer's abilities. Damage taken is stored in the ballast tank first."

msgid "【法力】充满时立起潮汐碑，持续 {C:EqArcaneBatch.STELE_SEC} 秒：碑内敌人持续受到伤害，友军获得护盾与攻击速度。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, raises a Tide Stele for {C:EqArcaneBatch.STELE_SEC} seconds: enemies inside take damage over time; allies gain a shield and attack speed."

msgid "【法力】充满时对最近的敌人贴上【符纸】：{C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_SEC} 秒内造成 400/700/1000 魔法伤害并降低魔抗。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, sticks a [Talisman] on the nearest enemy, dealing 400/700/1000 magic damage over {C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_SEC} seconds and lowering its Magic Resist."

msgid "【法力】充满时跃起猛砸地面，造成伤害并眩晕 2/3/8 秒。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, leaps up and slams the ground, dealing damage and stunning for 2/3/8 seconds."

msgid "攻击和技能命中时积累充能，达到 {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_FULL} 点时朝敌群斩出一道弧形刀光。只命中 1 名敌人时伤害提高 100/150/200%。"
msgstr "Attack and ability hits build charge. At {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_FULL}, slashes an arc of light at the enemy group. Deals 100/150/200% more damage if it hits only 1 enemy."

msgid "每 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_IV} 秒回复 1/2/3 点+携带者最大生命值 0.1/0.15/0.2% 的生命值，生命值低于 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_GATE%}% 时回复效果提升至 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_MULT} 倍。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_IV} seconds, heals 1/2/3 + 0.1/0.15/0.2% of max health. Below {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_GATE%}% health, healing is multiplied by {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_MULT}."

msgid "召唤一只剧毒飞行物，沿途留下毒雾，对敌人叠加中毒与缓速。"
msgstr "Summons a venomous flyer that leaves a poison fog along its path, stacking Poison and Slow on enemies."

msgid "每 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_IV} 秒强化接下来的 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} 次攻击：+{C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_ASPD%}% 攻击速度，并附带额外伤害，回复该伤害 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_LS%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_IV} seconds, empowers the next {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} attacks: +{C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_ASPD%}% attack speed and bonus damage, healing for {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_LS%}% of that damage."

msgid "阵亡时立起墓碑：全队获得 12/22/35% 增伤，并每 {C:EqRelicBatch.STELE_BOLT_IV} 秒砸下石雷。"
msgstr "On death, raises an Tombstone: the team gains 12/22/35% Damage Amp, and it drops a stone bolt every {C:EqRelicBatch.STELE_BOLT_IV} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} 秒获得 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} 点圣光护盾。护盾存在时，每次被攻击或技能命中时反击 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} 点真实伤害。"
msgstr "Gains {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} Holy Shield every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} seconds. While it holds, each attack or ability hit taken strikes back for {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} true damage."

msgid "登场时召唤【斧头】，【斧头】会定期回复生命值并获得护盾，攻击会窃取目标的护盾。小木斧会随【砍伐经验】进化。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons [Axe]. [Axe] periodically heals and gains a shield, and its attacks steal the target's shield. The Little Wooden Axe evolves with [Chopping XP]."

msgid "每隔一个攻击间隔朝最近的敌人斩出扇形激光。仅命中 1 名敌人时追加一道直线斩击。"
msgstr "Every attack interval, slashes a fan of laser at the nearest enemy. If it hits only 1 enemy, adds a straight slash."

msgid "每秒受到魔法伤害：每层 1 点 + 自身最大生命值的 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DOT_MAXHP_PCT%}%。每秒造成伤害后层数变为 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}%（向下取整），降到 0 层时消失。"
msgstr "Takes magic damage each second: 1 per stack + {C:CombatMath.STACK_DOT_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health. After each tick, stacks drop to {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}% (rounded down) and the effect ends at 0."

msgid "按闪避率完全躲开一次攻击或技能，闪避率上限 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DODGE_CAP%}%。持续伤害与必中攻击无法闪避。"
msgstr "Completely avoids an attack or ability based on Dodge chance, capped at {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DODGE_CAP%}%. Damage over time and sure-hit attacks can't be dodged."

msgid "攻击和技能造成的物理伤害降低 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}%。流血、魔法伤害和真实伤害不受影响。"
msgstr "Physical damage from attacks and abilities is reduced by {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}%. Bleed, magic damage and true damage are unaffected."

msgid "无法被敌方攻击和指向型技能选为目标，范围伤害仍可命中。"
msgstr "Can't be targeted by enemy attacks or targeted abilities. Area damage still hits."

msgid "受到伤害时，按反伤比例对攻击者造成等量的真实伤害。比例见下方来源。"
msgstr "When taking damage, deals true damage to the attacker based on the Thorns ratio. See sources below for ratios."

msgid "赛博龟的充能层：登场 {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE} 层，每次释放技能 +1 层。敌人贴近时消耗 1 层自动冲刺躲避。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle's charges: starts with {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE}, +1 per ability cast. When an enemy gets close, spends 1 to dash away automatically."

msgid "降低移动速度、攻击速度、龟能充能速度中的一项或多项，降幅见下方来源。"
msgstr "Reduces one or more of move speed, attack speed and Energy charge rate. See sources below for amounts."

msgid "移动速度降低，降幅见下方来源。多个减速不叠加。"
msgstr "Move speed is reduced. See sources below for amounts. Multiple slows don't stack."

msgid "受到的治疗降低，降幅见下方来源。多个来源不叠加，取最高值。"
msgstr "Healing received is reduced. See sources below for amounts. Multiple sources don't stack; the highest applies."

msgid "龟能不增长，解除后继续充能。"
msgstr "Energy doesn't increase. Charging resumes when it ends."

msgid "持续 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} 秒：受到的灼烧伤害转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "For {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} seconds: Burn damage taken becomes true damage."

msgid "每秒受到魔法伤害：每层 1 点。每秒造成伤害后层数变为 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}%（向下取整），降到 0 层时消失。"
msgstr "Takes magic damage each second: 1 per stack. After each tick, stacks drop to {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}% (rounded down) and the effect ends at 0."

msgid "每层使受到的伤害 +{C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK%}%（随弓箭羁绊件数），上限 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX} 层。满层时受到的伤害中 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT%}% 转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Each stack increases damage taken by {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK%}% (scales with Bow count), up to {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX} stacks. At max stacks, {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT%}% of damage taken becomes true damage."

msgid "每层使每次受到的伤害额外附带 {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% 的真实伤害，这部分无视减伤与护盾。上限 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 层（墨水炸弹：{C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} 层）。"
msgstr "Each stack adds {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% of every hit taken as true damage, ignoring Damage Reduction and shields. Up to {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} stacks ({C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} with Ink Bomb)."

msgid "叠满 {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} 层时引爆：受到自身最大生命值 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的魔法伤害，魔抗降低 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒，层数清零。"
msgstr "Detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} stacks: takes magic damage equal to {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health and loses {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}% Magic Resist for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds. Stacks reset."

msgid "叠满 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆：受到闪电龟 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}% 攻击力的真实伤害，层数清零。"
msgstr "Detonates at {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} stacks: takes true damage equal to {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}% of Lightning Turtle's Attack. Stacks reset."

msgid "持续 {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} 秒：斩杀线从 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% 提高到 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%。"
msgstr "For {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} seconds: the execute threshold rises from {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% to {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%."

msgid "每秒受到物理伤害：每层 1 点。每秒造成伤害后层数变为 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}%（向下取整），降到 0 层时消失。"
msgstr "Takes physical damage each second: 1 per stack. After each tick, stacks drop to {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}% (rounded down) and the effect ends at 0."

msgid "每秒受到自身最大生命值 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 的真实伤害。重复施加只延长持续时间，不叠加伤害。"
msgstr "Takes true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of own max health each second. Reapplying only extends the duration; damage doesn't stack."

msgid "无法移动、攻击和释放技能，期间龟能不增长。"
msgstr "Can't move, attack or cast abilities, and Energy doesn't increase."

msgid "被击飞到空中：无法移动、攻击和释放技能，期间龟能不增长，落地后恢复。"
msgstr "Knocked into the air: can't move, attack or cast abilities, and Energy doesn't increase until landing."

msgid "无头龟的恐吓施加的眩晕，效果与眩晕相同：无法移动、攻击和释放技能，期间龟能不增长。蛋类单位免疫。"
msgstr "A stun from Headless Turtle's Intimidate, same as Stun: can't move, attack or cast abilities, and Energy doesn't increase. Egg units are immune."

msgid "只能攻击施加嘲讽的单位。"
msgstr "Can only attack the unit that applied the Taunt."

msgid "先于生命值承受伤害，可吸收所有类型的伤害，包括真实伤害。"
msgstr "Absorbs damage before health. Blocks all damage types, including true damage."

msgid "只吸收魔法伤害，先于护盾承受。物理伤害与真实伤害不受影响。不随时间消失。"
msgstr "Absorbs only magic damage, before regular shields. Physical and true damage are unaffected. Doesn't decay over time."

msgid "好友数量已达上限 100 人"
msgstr "Friend list full (100)"

msgid "海盗龟登场时轰击 1 名随机敌人，造成其 {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。\n海盗龟阵亡时甩出钩索抓住击杀它的单位，将其拉到身旁并眩晕 {C:PirateSystem.HOOK_STUN} 秒，造成其 {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。"
msgstr "On spawn, Pirate Turtle bombards 1 random enemy for true damage equal to {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its max health.\nOn death, Pirate Turtle hooks its killer, pulling it close, stunning it for {C:PirateSystem.HOOK_STUN} seconds and dealing true damage equal to {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its max health."

msgid "糖果龟在战斗第 {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_AT} 秒吸取最大生命值最高的敌人 {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值，并回复等量生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">该吸取不会杀死目标。</span>"
msgstr "At {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_AT} seconds into battle, Candy Turtle drains {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health from the enemy with the highest max health and heals for the same amount.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">This drain can't kill.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟将受到伤害的 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_STORE_PCT%}% 储存为泡泡值，上限为自身最大生命值。\n每 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_IV} 秒，泡泡龟消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_DMG_PCT%}% 泡泡值对最近的敌人造成等量魔法伤害，并消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_HEAL_PCT%}% 泡泡值回复等量生命值。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle stores {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_STORE_PCT%}% of damage taken as Bubbles, up to its max health.\nEvery {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_IV} seconds, it spends {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_DMG_PCT%}% of its Bubbles to deal that much magic damage to the nearest enemy, and spends {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_HEAL_PCT%}% to heal for that much."

msgid "泡泡龟用泡泡束缚目标，使其眩晕 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SEC} 秒。期间目标每受到一段伤害，护甲与魔抗各永久减少 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_LOW} 点（泡泡龟 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_LV_GATE} 级以上时为 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_HIGH} 点）。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每次束缚最多各减少 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_CAP} 点。</span>"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle binds the target in a bubble, stunning it for {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SEC} seconds. Each hit it takes meanwhile permanently removes {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_LOW} Armor and Magic Resist ({C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_HIGH} at level {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_LV_GATE}+).\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Up to {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_CAP} of each per bind.</span>"

msgid "线条龟的攻击与技能会为目标叠加墨迹。\n目标每受到一次伤害，每层墨迹使其额外受到相当于该伤害 {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% 的真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">墨迹上限为 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 层，选择【墨水炸弹】时提升至 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} 层，满层时为 {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_FULL_BOMB%}%。</span>\n线条龟获得（{C:LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK*100}%）攻击速度。"
msgstr "Line Turtle's attacks and abilities apply Ink to targets.\nEach time the target takes damage, every Ink stack adds true damage equal to {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% of that damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Ink caps at {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} stacks, or {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} with [Ink Bomb] ({C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_FULL_BOMB%}% at max).</span>\nLine Turtle gains ({C:LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK*100}%) attack speed."

msgid "火山形态：火山龟获得 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值、{C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度与 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Volcano Form: gains {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% of max health, {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% attack speed and {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% move speed for {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "无头龟获得 {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n无头龟每损失 1% 生命值，便获得 {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST}% 攻击力，至多 {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST%}%。\n无头龟首次受到致命伤害时进入亡灵状态，{C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_DEATHFLOOR} 秒内生命值不会低于 1。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle gains {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal.\nFor every 1% health lost, it gains {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST}% attack damage, up to {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST%}%.\nThe first time it takes lethal damage, it becomes Undead and can't drop below 1 health for {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_DEATHFLOOR} seconds."

msgid "被动：天使龟的攻击每次命中获得 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ENERGY_PER_HIT} 龟能与 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ATK_PER_HIT%}% 攻击力，持续到本战场结束。\n\n主动：天使龟获得 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ASPD%}% 攻击速度、{C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_MOVE%}% 移动速度和 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_RANGE} 码射程，持续到本战场结束，可无限叠加。"
msgstr "Passive: each of Angel Turtle's attack hits grants {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ENERGY_PER_HIT} Energy and {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ATK_PER_HIT%}% attack damage until the battle ends.\n\nActive: Angel Turtle gains {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ASPD%}% attack speed, {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_MOVE%}% move speed and {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_RANGE} range until the battle ends, stacking infinitely."

msgid "寒冰龟登场时使全场敌人的攻击速度、龟能充能速度和移动速度降低 {C:IceSystem.AURA_SLOW%}%，持续 {C:IceSystem.AURA_SEC} 秒。\n寒冰龟的攻击和技能对熔岩龟和凤凰龟造成的伤害提升 {C:IceSystem.AURA_VS_FIRE%}%，并免疫灼烧。"
msgstr "On spawn, Ice Turtle reduces all enemies' attack speed, Energy charge rate and move speed by {C:IceSystem.AURA_SLOW%}% for {C:IceSystem.AURA_SEC} seconds.\nIce Turtle's attacks and abilities deal {C:IceSystem.AURA_VS_FIRE%}% more damage to Lava Turtle and Phoenix Turtle, and it is immune to Burn."

msgid "幽灵龟登场时对全体敌人施加 {C:GhostSystem.SPAWN_CURSE_SEC} 秒诅咒，阵亡时对随机 1 名敌人施加 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒诅咒。\n诅咒每秒造成 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">重复施加诅咒时累加持续时间。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, Ghost Turtle curses all enemies for {C:GhostSystem.SPAWN_CURSE_SEC} seconds. On death, it curses 1 random enemy for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nCurse deals true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of the target's max health each second.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Reapplying Curse adds to its duration.</span>"

msgid "钻石龟登场时使包括自身在内的全队护甲和魔抗提升 {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_RESIST_UP%}%，钻石龟自身获得 {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_FLAT_DR%}% 减伤。"
msgstr "On spawn, Diamond Turtle increases the whole team's (including its own) Armor and Magic Resist by {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_RESIST_UP%}%, and gains {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_FLAT_DR%}% Damage Reduction itself."

msgid "钻石龟蜷成钻石球滚向最近的敌人，撞击时对附近的敌人造成物理伤害，将其击飞并眩晕 {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MIN}~{C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MAX} 秒。\n伤害与眩晕时长随滚动时间提升，{C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_ACCEL_SEC} 秒后达到最大：伤害从 {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% 护甲 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% 魔抗 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MIN%}% 目标最大生命值，提升至 {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% 护甲 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% 魔抗 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MAX%}% 目标最大生命值。\n滚动期间不受眩晕与恐惧影响。\n附近没有敌人时，钻石龟自动开始滚动，不消耗龟能。"
msgstr "Diamond Turtle curls into a diamond ball and rolls at the nearest enemy. On impact, it deals physical damage to nearby enemies, knocking them up and stunning them for {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MIN}–{C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MAX} seconds.\nDamage and stun duration grow the longer it rolls, peaking after {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_ACCEL_SEC} seconds: damage rises from {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% Armor + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% Magic Resist + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MIN%}% of the target's max health to {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% Armor + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% Magic Resist + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MAX%}% of the target's max health.\nImmune to Stun and Fear while rolling.\nWith no enemies nearby, Diamond Turtle starts rolling on its own at no Energy cost."

msgid "财神龟每 {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_IV} 秒获得 {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MIN}~{C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MAX} 枚金币，场上任意单位阵亡时额外获得 {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_ON_DEATH} 枚。每枚金币使财神龟的攻击额外造成 {C:FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF%}% 攻击力的物理伤害。\n财神龟首次生命值降至 {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_PCT%}% 以下时，立即获得 {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_ENERGY} 点龟能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">金币只在本战场内有效。</span>"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle gains {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MIN}–{C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MAX} Gold every {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_IV} seconds, plus {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_ON_DEATH} whenever any unit dies. Each Gold makes its attacks deal an extra {C:FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF%}% attack damage as physical damage.\nThe first time its health drops below {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_PCT%}%, it instantly gains {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_ENERGY} Energy.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Gold only lasts for the current battle.</span>"

msgid "小龟对敌人造成的所有伤害按目标的稀有度提升：C +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_C%}% 至 SSS +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SSS%}%。\n每 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_CD} 秒，小龟的下一次攻击额外造成 {N:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_LOST_PCT%}% 目标已损失生命值的物理伤害，将目标击飞，并获得相当于该伤害 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_GAIN_PCT%}% 的护盾。"
msgstr "Little Turtle deals more damage to enemies based on their rarity: C +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_C%}% up to SSS +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SSS%}%.\nEvery {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_CD} seconds, its next attack deals {N:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_LOST_PCT%}% of the target's missing health as bonus physical damage, knocks the target up, and grants a shield equal to {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_GAIN_PCT%}% of that damage."

msgid "小龟攻击当前目标，造成 {N:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Little Turtle attacks the current target, dealing {N:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage."

msgid "小龟在 {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_ROOT_SEC} 秒内连续发射 {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_WAVES} 道气波，每道朝随机一名敌人飞出，对命中的第一个敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。施法期间小龟无法移动和攻击。"
msgstr "Little Turtle fires {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_WAVES} waves over {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_ROOT_SEC} seconds, each flying at a random enemy and dealing {N:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF*ATK} physical damage to the first enemy hit. It can't move or attack while casting."

msgid "小龟打出一道贯穿气波，对沿途所有敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并将其击飞 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n施法期间小龟获得 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_CRIT%}% 暴击率、{C:BasicConsts.CHI_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取和 {E:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF*ATK} 护甲穿透，持续 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Little Turtle fires a piercing wave that deals {N:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage to all enemies in its path and knocks them up for {C:BasicConsts.CHI_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\nWhile casting, it gains {C:BasicConsts.CHI_CRIT%}% Crit Chance, {C:BasicConsts.CHI_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal and {E:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF*ATK} Armor Pen for {C:BasicConsts.CHI_BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "小龟冲上前抱起目标摔至身后，眩晕 {C:BasicConsts.SLAM_STUN_SEC} 秒，对其造成 {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK*ATK} 外加 {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK*100}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害，并对落点周围其他敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK*ATK} 外加 {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK*100}% 主目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋以及免疫控制或击飞的目标不会被抱起，只在原地受到伤害。龟蛋免疫此控制。</span>"
msgstr "Little Turtle charges in, grabs the target and slams it down behind, stunning it for {C:BasicConsts.SLAM_STUN_SEC} seconds and dealing {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK*ATK} + {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK*100}% of its max health as physical damage. Other enemies near the landing spot take {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK*ATK} + {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK*100}% of the main target's max health as physical damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs and targets immune to crowd control or knock-ups aren't lifted; they just take the damage in place. Turtle Eggs are immune to this control.</span>"

msgid "骰子龟根据已损失的生命值获得额外暴击率，自身损失 {C:DiceSystem.BLOOD_LOST_GATE%}% 生命值时达到最大值 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DICE_BLOOD_CRIT%}% 暴击率。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle gains bonus Crit Chance based on missing health, up to {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DICE_BLOOD_CRIT%}% at {C:DiceSystem.BLOOD_LOST_GATE%}% health lost."

msgid "骰子龟攻击目标，造成 {N:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK+crit*DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK+crit*DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT} physical damage."

msgid "骰子龟朝最近的敌人劈砍，对前方 {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_ARC_DEG}° 扇形内的敌人造成 {N:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG*ATK} 物理伤害，并附带 {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle slashes at the nearest enemy, dealing {N:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG*ATK} physical damage to enemies in a {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_ARC_DEG}° cone in front, with {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "骰子龟掷出命运骰子，获得随机 {C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MIN%}%~{C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MAX%}% 暴击率提升，持续到下次释放本技能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">再次释放会撤销旧增益并重新掷骰。\n</span>\n释放后的首次攻击额外附带 {C:DiceSystem.FATE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle rolls the Dice of Fate, gaining a random {C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MIN%}%–{C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MAX%}% Crit Chance until it casts this again.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Recasting removes the old bonus and rolls again.\n</span>\nThe first attack after casting has {C:DiceSystem.FATE_LIFESTEAL%}% bonus Lifesteal."

msgid "被动：骰子龟登场时将全部护甲与魔抗转化为等量护甲穿透，自身护甲与魔抗降为 0。\n\n主动：骰子龟对随机敌人突刺 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MIN}~{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MAX} 次，首段造成 {N:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，此后每段伤害为上一段的 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_KEEP%}%。\n每穿刺一次获得 {E:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Dice Turtle converts all its Armor and Magic Resist into the same amount of Armor Pen, and its Armor and Magic Resist become 0.\n\nActive: Dice Turtle dashes through random enemies {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MIN}–{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MAX} times. The first hit deals {N:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF*ATK} physical damage; each later hit deals {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_KEEP%}% of the previous one.\nEach pierce grants a {E:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT*ATK} shield for {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "彩虹龟的棱镜每 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_COLOR_SEC} 秒随机切换为红、蓝、绿中的一种颜色，彩虹龟的攻击会附带当前颜色的效果：红色附加真实伤害，蓝色获得护盾，绿色回复生命值。彩虹龟获得基于最大生命值的攻击力，以及基于攻击力的攻击速度。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle's prism switches to red, blue or green at random every {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_COLOR_SEC} seconds, and its attacks carry that color's effect: red adds true damage, blue grants a shield, green heals. Rainbow Turtle gains attack damage based on max health, and attack speed based on attack damage."

msgid "彩虹龟射出一道七彩光束，单段造成 {N:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并根据当前棱镜颜色附加对应效果。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle fires a rainbow beam that deals {N:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applies the current prism color's effect."

msgid "彩虹龟以棱镜之光为全体友军施加 {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle grants all allies a {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE*ATK} shield of prism light for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "彩虹龟在自身周围掀起七彩风暴，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SEC} 秒。风暴每 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} 秒对范围内的敌人造成 {M:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害与 {T:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF*ATK} 真实伤害，并使其护甲与魔抗各降低 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SHRED%}%，同时为范围内的友军回复 {E:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL*ATK} 生命值。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle whips up a rainbow storm around itself for {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SEC} seconds. Every {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} seconds, it deals {M:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF*ATK} magic damage and {T:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF*ATK} true damage to enemies inside, reduces their Armor and Magic Resist by {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SHRED%}%, and heals allies inside for {E:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL*ATK}."

msgid "被动：彩虹龟每 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_PROC_SEC} 秒随机触发以下一种效果：\n橙色：全体友军获得 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n黄色：对一名随机敌人施加 {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n青色：使一名随机敌人的攻击速度降低 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_CHILL_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n紫色：对一名随机敌人施加诅咒，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒，每秒造成目标 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。\n\n主动：彩虹龟射出一道彩虹光，从自身开始在友军与敌人之间交替弹射 {C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_BOUNCES} 次，命中友军时回复 {E:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK} 生命值，命中敌人时造成 {M:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Passive: every {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_PROC_SEC} seconds, Rainbow Turtle triggers one of these at random:\nOrange: all allies gain {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nYellow: applies {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn to a random enemy.\nCyan: reduces a random enemy's attack speed by {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_CHILL_DOWN%}% for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nPurple: curses a random enemy for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds, dealing true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health each second.\n\nActive: Rainbow Turtle fires a rainbow ray that bounces {C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_BOUNCES} times, alternating between allies and enemies starting from itself. Allies hit heal for {E:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK}; enemies hit take {M:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK} magic damage."

msgid "赌神龟每次攻击后有 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% 概率很快再攻击一次。连续触发时，每次触发概率乘以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_DECAY%}%（{C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN2%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN3%}%，以此类推），未触发时重置。"
msgstr "After each attack, Gambler Turtle has a {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% chance to quickly attack again. On consecutive triggers, the chance is multiplied by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_DECAY%}% each time ({C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN2%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN3%}%, and so on), resetting when it fails."

msgid "赌神龟甩出一张扑克牌，造成 {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle flicks a playing card, dealing {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage."

msgid "赌神龟丢出一张万能牌，造成 {N:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG*ATK} 物理伤害，并使目标攻击力降低 {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_ATK_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n赌神龟获得 {E:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD*ATK} 护盾，直到被打破，并回复自身 {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_HEAL%}% 最大生命值的生命值。"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle throws a Wild Card, dealing {N:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG*ATK} physical damage and reducing the target's attack damage by {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_ATK_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nGambler Turtle gains a {E:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD*ATK} shield until broken and heals {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_HEAL%}% of its max health."

msgid "赌神龟消耗自身 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% 当前生命值，化作 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_SEGMENTS} 张牌打向目标，共造成约等于所消耗生命值的物理伤害（受护甲减免）。\n每张牌命中时也会判定多重打击，每次触发回复 {E:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL*ATK} 生命值并追加一张牌，造成 {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n每张牌都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时的装备效果，其中多重打击追加的牌以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% 效果触发。\n释放后 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} 秒内多重打击概率提升 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">当前生命值低于 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% 最大生命值时，不消耗生命值也不出牌，转而回复自身 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_LOWHP_HEAL%}% 最大生命值的生命值，同样获得概率提升。</span>"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle spends {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% of its current health and turns it into {C:GamblerSystem.BET_SEGMENTS} cards thrown at the target, dealing physical damage roughly equal to the health spent (reduced by armor).\nEach card hit can also trigger Multi-Strike; each trigger heals {E:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL*ATK} and adds a card dealing {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nEach card counts as an attack and triggers on-attack item effects; extra Multi-Strike cards trigger them at {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% effect.\nFor {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} seconds after casting, Multi-Strike chance is increased by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Below {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% max health, it spends no health and throws no cards; instead it heals {C:GamblerSystem.BET_LOWHP_HEAL%}% of its max health and still gets the chance bonus.</span>"

msgid "被动：赌神龟登场时损失自身 {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HP_COST%}% 最大生命值，基础多重打击概率由 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% 提升至 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%。\n\n主动：赌神龟随机抽取一个花色，永久提升对应属性：\n♠ 黑桃：攻击力 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_ATK}，最大生命值 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_HP}\n♥ 红心：护甲 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}，魔抗 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}\n♦ 方块：暴击率 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_CRIT%}%，护甲穿透 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_PEN}\n♣ 梅花：生命偷取 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_LIFESTEAL%}%，攻击速度 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_ASPD%}%"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Gambler Turtle loses {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HP_COST%}% of its max health, and its base Multi-Strike chance rises from {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% to {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%.\n\nActive: Gambler Turtle draws a random suit and permanently gains its stats:\n♠ Spades: Attack +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_ATK}, Max Health +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_HP}\n♥ Hearts: Armor +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}, Magic Resist +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}\n♦ Diamonds: Crit Chance +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_CRIT%}%, Armor Pen +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_PEN}\n♣ Clubs: Lifesteal +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_LIFESTEAL%}%, Attack Speed +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_ASPD%}%"

msgid "场上有敌人生命值低于 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% 时，猎人龟自动射出一支强化箭，命中时将其处决。\n猎人龟处决或击杀敌人时，窃取该敌人 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_STEAL%}% 基础属性并获得 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取，持续到本战场结束。"
msgstr "When any enemy drops below {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% health, Hunter Turtle automatically fires an empowered arrow that executes it on hit.\nWhen Hunter Turtle executes or kills an enemy, it steals {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_STEAL%}% of that enemy's base stats and gains {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal until the battle ends."

msgid "猎人龟射出一箭，造成 {N:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n当前目标生命值低于 {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HP_GATE%}% 时，猎人龟获得 {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle shoots an arrow, dealing {N:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nWhile its current target is below {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HP_GATE%}% health, Hunter Turtle gains {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HASTE%}% attack speed."

msgid "猎人龟瞄准目标射击，造成 {N:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并施加 {E:HunterSystem.SHOT_POISON_COEF*ATK} 层中毒、持续 {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒的 {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减与猎杀印记。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">猎杀印记持续 {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} 秒，期间被动的处决线提升至 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%。</span>"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle takes aim and shoots, dealing {N:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applying {E:HunterSystem.SHOT_POISON_COEF*ATK} Poison, {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds, and a Hunt Mark.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Hunt Mark lasts {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} seconds, raising the passive's execute threshold to {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%.</span>"

msgid "猎人龟翻滚：被近战敌人贴近时斜着拉开距离，残血时撤到队友身后，目标残血时朝它翻滚，否则翻滚到与目标保持射程的位置。\n下次攻击命中时额外造成 {N:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并获得 {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE%}% 闪避，持续 {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE_SEC} 秒，同时获得 {E:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle rolls: diagonally away when a melee enemy closes in, behind allies when low on health, toward the target when the target is low, and otherwise to a spot at range from the target.\nIts next attack hit deals {N:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF*ATK} bonus physical damage, and it gains {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE%}% Dodge for {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE_SEC} seconds plus a {E:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield."

msgid "猎人龟每 {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_GAP} 秒射出 1 支追踪箭，共 {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} 支，每支随机锁定一名敌人，造成 {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle fires 1 homing arrow every {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_GAP} seconds, {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} in total. Each locks onto a random enemy and deals {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK} true damage."

msgid "海盗龟挥舞弯刀劈砍目标，造成 {N:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并回复 {E:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL*ATK} 生命值。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle slashes the target with its cutlass, dealing {N:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF*ATK} physical damage and healing {E:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL*ATK}."

msgid "海盗龟命令海盗船朝随机敌人发射 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} 发炮弹，每发对落点附近的敌人造成 {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_MAXHP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle orders the pirate ship to fire {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} cannonballs at random enemies. Each deals {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage to enemies near where it lands."

msgid "海盗龟命令海盗船扔来一瓶朗姆酒，每秒回复 {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT} 生命值，持续 {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} 秒，合计 {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_TOTAL}，同时获得 {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF} 护甲和 {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF} 魔抗，持续 {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle has the pirate ship toss it a bottle of rum, healing {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT} per second for {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} seconds ({E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_TOTAL} total) and gaining {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF} Armor and {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF} Magic Resist for {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} seconds."

msgid "海盗龟首次龟能充满时召唤一艘海盗船。海盗船冲锋撞击目标，对其附近的敌人造成 {M:ATK} 魔法伤害并击飞 {C:PirateSystem.SHIP_CHARGE_STUN} 秒，之后留在场上攻击最近的敌人，每次造成 {N:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE} 物理伤害。\n此后海盗龟每次龟能充满时朝目标扇形射出 {C:PirateSystem.SHOT_PELLETS} 颗霰弹，每颗对命中的第一个敌人造成 {N:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并击退。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">海盗船的生命值为 {E:HP*PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE}，攻击力为 {E:ATK}，没有护甲与魔抗。</span>"
msgstr "The first time Pirate Turtle's Energy is full, it summons a pirate ship. The ship rams the target, dealing {M:ATK} magic damage to nearby enemies and knocking them up for {C:PirateSystem.SHIP_CHARGE_STUN} seconds, then stays on the field attacking the nearest enemy for {N:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE} physical damage per hit.\nAfter that, each time its Energy is full, Pirate Turtle fires {C:PirateSystem.SHOT_PELLETS} pellets in a cone at the target, each dealing {N:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF*ATK} physical damage to the first enemy hit and knocking it back.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The pirate ship has {E:HP*PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE} health and {E:ATK} Attack, with no Armor or Magic Resist.</span>"

msgid "糖果龟挥锤砸向目标，造成 {N:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {N:HP*CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP} 物理伤害，并使其攻击力降低 {C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle smashes the target with its mallet, dealing {N:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {N:HP*CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP} physical damage and reducing its attack damage by {C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "糖果龟蓄力后猛砸前方直线上的敌人，总计 {N:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT} 物理伤害由命中的敌人均分，并回复造成伤害 {C:CandySystem.HAMMER_LIFESTEAL%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle charges up and slams enemies in a line in front. {N:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT} total physical damage is split among enemies hit, and it heals for {C:CandySystem.HAMMER_LIFESTEAL%}% of damage dealt."

msgid "糖果龟在敌方中心区域降下糖衣炮弹雨，共 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICKS} 跳，每 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICK_SEC} 秒一跳，每跳落下 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHELLS} 颗糖弹。\n每颗糖弹使落点附近的友军获得 {E:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT} 护盾，持续 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并对落点附近的敌人造成 {M:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT} 魔法伤害，减速 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_PCT%}%，持续 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle rains sugarcoated shells on the center of the enemy side: {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICKS} waves, one every {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICK_SEC} seconds, each dropping {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHELLS} shells.\nEach shell gives nearby allies a {E:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT} shield for {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and deals {M:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT} magic damage to nearby enemies, slowing them by {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_PCT%}% for {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "糖果龟登场时召唤一颗糖果炸弹，其生命值为自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值。\n每当龟能充满，若炸弹存活，糖果龟使其生命上限提升自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值，并为其回复自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_HEAL_PCT%}% 最大生命值的生命值。\n若炸弹已阵亡，则召唤一颗生命值为自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的新炸弹。\n炸弹死亡时爆炸，对全体敌人均摊其 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DEATH_AOE%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">炸弹每秒损失自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DECAY_PCT%}% 最大生命值，不攻击也不移动。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, Candy Turtle summons a Candy Bomb with health equal to {C:CandySystem.BOMB_HP_PCT%}% of its own max health.\nEach time its Energy is full, if the bomb is alive, Candy Turtle raises the bomb's max health by {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its own max health and heals the bomb for {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_HEAL_PCT%}% of its own max health.\nIf the bomb is dead, it summons a new one with {C:CandySystem.BOMB_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of its own max health.\nWhen the bomb dies, it explodes, splitting magic damage equal to {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DEATH_AOE%}% of its max health among all enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The bomb loses {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DECAY_PCT%}% of its max health per second and doesn't attack or move.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟对目标连击 3 段，共造成 {N:BubbleSystem.HIT_SEG_COEF*ATK*BubbleSystem.HIT_SEGMENTS} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle hits the target 3 times, dealing {N:BubbleSystem.HIT_SEG_COEF*ATK*BubbleSystem.HIT_SEGMENTS} total physical damage."

msgid "泡泡龟使生命值最低的己方单位获得 {E:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期、被打破或持盾者阵亡时爆裂，对全体敌人造成 {M:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">护盾存在期间，泡泡龟的龟能停止充能。即使泡泡龟已阵亡，护盾仍会爆裂。</span>"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle gives the lowest-health ally a {E:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield for {C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield expires, breaks or its holder dies, it bursts, dealing {M:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF*ATK} magic damage to all enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Bubble Turtle's Energy stops charging while the shield exists. The shield still bursts even if Bubble Turtle has died.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_CONSUME%}% 当前泡泡值，对目标周围的每个敌人造成相当于所消耗泡泡值 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_MAGIC_MULT%}% 的魔法伤害，外加 {N:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle spends {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_CONSUME%}% of its current Bubbles to deal magic damage equal to {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_MAGIC_MULT%}% of the Bubbles spent, plus {N:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage, to each enemy around the target."

msgid "线条龟攻击目标，造成 {M:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC*ATK} 魔法伤害并为其叠加 1 层墨迹。"
msgstr "Line Turtle attacks the target, dealing {M:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC*ATK} magic damage and applying 1 Ink stack."

msgid "线条龟画线连接最近的 {C:LineSystem.LINK_TARGETS} 个敌人，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_SEC} 秒，对两个目标各造成 {N:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并各叠加 1 层墨迹。\n连接期间，一方所受伤害的 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_TRANSFER%}% 会以真实伤害传导给另一方，且一方获得墨迹时另一方同步获得。"
msgstr "Line Turtle draws a line linking the {C:LineSystem.LINK_TARGETS} nearest enemies for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_SEC} seconds, dealing {N:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applying 1 Ink stack to each.\nWhile linked, {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_TRANSFER%}% of damage one takes is passed to the other as true damage, and Ink applied to one is applied to the other too."

msgid "线条龟对墨迹层数最多的敌人点下终笔，造成 {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK} 外加每层墨迹 {N:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK*ATK} 物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">该伤害不消耗墨迹。</span>"
msgstr "Line Turtle adds the finishing stroke to the enemy with the most Ink, dealing {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK} + {N:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK*ATK} per Ink stack as physical damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">This doesn't consume Ink.</span>"

msgid "被动：墨迹的层数上限由 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 提升至 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB}。\n\n主动：线条龟向敌人最密集处投掷墨水炸弹，对落点附近的敌人造成 {C:LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} 段共 {M:LineSystem.BOMB_SEG_COEF*ATK*LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} 魔法伤害，每段为目标叠加 1 层墨迹。"
msgstr "Passive: Ink's stack cap rises from {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} to {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB}.\n\nActive: Line Turtle throws an Ink Bomb at the densest group of enemies, dealing {M:LineSystem.BOMB_SEG_COEF*ATK*LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} magic damage over {C:LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} hits to enemies near where it lands. Each hit applies 1 Ink stack."

msgid "闪电龟每 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_IV} 秒自动电击一名随机敌人，造成 {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} 真实伤害。\n敌人身上的电击达到 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成 {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} 真实伤害并重置层数。"
msgstr "Every {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_IV} seconds, Lightning Turtle automatically shocks a random enemy for {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} true damage.\nWhen an enemy reaches {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} Shock stacks, they detonate for {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} true damage and reset."

msgid "闪电龟射出一道闪电，造成 {M:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，随后弹跳 {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOPS} 次，每段命中叠加 1 层电击。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每跳伤害为前一跳的 {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_DECAY%}%。</span>"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle fires a bolt dealing {M:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage that then bounces {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOPS} times. Each hit applies 1 Shock stack.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Each bounce deals {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_DECAY%}% of the previous one.</span>"

msgid "闪电龟在接下来的 {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_SEC} 秒内使被动电击及满层引爆的真实伤害提升 {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_BOOST%}%，并立即对目标造成 {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "For the next {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_SEC} seconds, Lightning Turtle's passive shocks and max-stack detonations deal {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_BOOST%}% more true damage, and it immediately deals {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF} true damage to the target."

msgid "闪电龟释放 {C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_BOLTS} 道闪电随机轰击敌方，共造成 {M:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL*ATK} 魔法伤害，每道命中各叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle unleashes {C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_BOLTS} bolts that strike random enemies, dealing {M:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL*ATK} total magic damage. Each hit applies 1 Shock stack."

msgid "闪电龟以雷电包裹自身，获得 {E:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加自身最大生命值 {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾存在时，闪电龟每受到一段攻击便反击 {M:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE*ATK} 魔法伤害，并为攻击者叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle wraps itself in thunder, gaining a {E:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhile the shield holds, each hit it takes strikes back for {M:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE*ATK} magic damage and applies 1 Shock stack to the attacker."

msgid "凤凰龟首次阵亡时以 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值复活，并对全体敌人施加 {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧与 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">复活过程持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_SHOW_SEC} 秒，期间凤凰龟无法行动、不可选中且不受伤害。</span>"
msgstr "The first time Phoenix Turtle dies, it revives with {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}% of its max health and applies {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds to all enemies for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Reviving takes {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_SHOW_SEC} seconds, during which Phoenix Turtle can't act, is untargetable and takes no damage.</span>"

msgid "凤凰龟持续喷射火焰，每 {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_TICK_SEC} 秒对身前扇形内的敌人造成（{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_MAG_COEF%}%×攻击力×(1+攻击速度)）魔法伤害，并施加 {E:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">喷火不受攻击间隔限制，凤凰龟可以边喷边移动。每次喷火视为一次攻击，只有扇形内离凤凰龟最近的敌人会触发攻击命中时的效果。</span>"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle breathes fire continuously, dealing ({C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_MAG_COEF%}% × Attack × (1 + Attack Speed)) magic damage to enemies in a cone in front every {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_TICK_SEC} seconds and applying {E:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The flames ignore the attack interval, and Phoenix Turtle can move while breathing fire. Each tick counts as an attack; only the enemy in the cone closest to Phoenix Turtle triggers on-hit effects.</span>"

msgid "凤凰龟获得 {E:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾存在时，凤凰龟每受到一段攻击便反击攻击者，造成 {M:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE*ATK} 魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle gains a {E:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield for {C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhile the shield holds, each hit it takes strikes back at the attacker for {M:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE*ATK} magic damage."

msgid "凤凰龟投出火球，先破坏目标 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_SHIELD_BREAK%}% 护盾，再造成 {M:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害并施加 {E:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n使目标的攻击力、护甲、魔抗各降低 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_STAT_DOWN%}%，并施加 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle hurls a fireball that first destroys {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_SHIELD_BREAK%}% of the target's shield, then deals {M:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage and applies {E:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn.\nReduces the target's attack damage, Armor and Magic Resist by {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_STAT_DOWN%}% each and applies {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "被动：涅槃复活时的生命值提升至 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值，复活后凤凰龟永久获得 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ATK%}% 攻击力。\n\n主动：凤凰龟获得 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ASPD%}% 攻击速度与 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: Rebirth revives with {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_HP_PCT%}% of max health instead, and Phoenix Turtle permanently gains {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ATK%}% attack damage after reviving.\n\nActive: Phoenix Turtle gains {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ASPD%}% attack speed and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SPD%}% move speed for {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SEC} seconds."

msgid "石头龟每 {C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_IV} 秒获得 {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT} 护甲，至多 {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT}。\n石头龟受到攻击或技能伤害时，将 {E:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE*100+DEF*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF*100+MR*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR*100}% 的伤害反弹给攻击者。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle gains {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT} Armor every {C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_IV} seconds, up to {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT}.\nWhen hit by attacks or abilities, Stone Turtle reflects {E:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE*100+DEF*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF*100+MR*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR*100}% of the damage to the attacker."

msgid "石头龟重击当前目标，造成 {N:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF*ATK+StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF*MR} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle bashes the current target, dealing {N:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF*ATK+StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF*MR} physical damage."

msgid "石头龟为全体友军施加 {E:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT} 护盾，持续 {C:StoneSystem.RS_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并使自身护甲与魔抗各提升 {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_UP%}%，持续 {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">持有此护盾期间石头龟的龟能不再充能。</span>"
msgstr "Stone Turtle grants all allies a {E:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT} shield for {C:StoneSystem.RS_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and increases its own Armor and Magic Resist by {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_UP%}% for {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Stone Turtle's Energy doesn't charge while it holds this shield.</span>"

msgid "被动：石头龟每次受到攻击或技能伤害获得 1 层岩层，至多 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_LAYER_CAP} 层。每层岩层提供 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_DR_PER_LAYER%}% 减伤与 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_SIZE_PER_LAYER%}% 体型。\n\n主动：石头龟向前释放岩石冲击波，对前方一排敌人造成 {N:(StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF*MR)*(1+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_PER_LAYER*rockLayers)} 物理伤害，将其击退并眩晕 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_STUN} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: each time Stone Turtle takes attack or ability damage, it gains 1 Rock Layer, up to {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_LAYER_CAP}. Each layer grants {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_DR_PER_LAYER%}% Damage Reduction and {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_SIZE_PER_LAYER%}% size.\n\nActive: Stone Turtle sends out a rock shockwave that deals {N:(StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF*MR)*(1+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_PER_LAYER*rockLayers)} physical damage to the row of enemies in front, knocking them back and stunning them for {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_STUN} seconds."

msgid "石头龟嘲讽附近的所有敌人 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} 秒，并获得 {E:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾与 {E:minf(DEF*StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF,StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP*100)}% 减伤，持续 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} 秒。\n{C:StoneSystem.SLAM_DELAY} 秒后，石头龟猛砸地面，对附近的敌人造成 {M:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害并将其击飞 {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle taunts all nearby enemies for {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} seconds and gains a {E:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield and {E:minf(DEF*StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF,StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP*100)}% Damage Reduction for {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} seconds.\nAfter {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_DELAY} seconds, it slams the ground, dealing {M:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage to nearby enemies and knocking them up for {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} seconds."

msgid "熔岩龟将造成伤害的 {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% 与承受伤害的 {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% 转化为怒气。\n怒气满 {rageMax} 时变身为火山龟，持续 {transformDuration} 秒：转为近战，属性提升，技能替换为火山技能，并在变身时砸地击飞敌人。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle converts {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% of damage dealt and {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% of damage taken into Rage.\nAt {rageMax} Rage, it transforms into Volcano Turtle for {transformDuration} seconds: it becomes melee, gains stats, its abilities are replaced with Volcano abilities, and it slams the ground on transforming to knock up enemies."

msgid "熔岩龟投出熔岩弹，造成 {M:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.BOLT_TGT_HP%}%目标最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% 攻击力）层灼烧。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle hurls a lava ball that deals {M:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.BOLT_TGT_HP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage and applies ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% Attack) Burn."

msgid "熔岩龟在敌人最密集处生成一片岩浆池，持续 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SEC} 秒。\n岩浆池每 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TICK_SEC} 秒对池内的敌人造成 {M:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加目标 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TGT_HP%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并使其减速 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SLOW_PCT%}%、魔抗降低 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_MR_DOWN%}%。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle creates a magma pool at the densest group of enemies for {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SEC} seconds.\nEvery {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TICK_SEC} seconds, the pool deals {M:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TGT_HP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage to enemies inside, slows them by {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SLOW_PCT%}% and reduces their Magic Resist by {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_MR_DOWN%}%."

msgid "熔岩龟蓄力后使目标脚下喷出岩浆柱，击飞附近的敌人并对目标造成 {M:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，熔岩龟获得 {E:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">护盾直到被打破。</span>"
msgstr "Lava Turtle charges up and erupts a magma pillar under the target, knocking up nearby enemies and dealing {M:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage to the target. Lava Turtle gains a {E:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The shield lasts until broken.</span>"

msgid "普通形态：熔岩龟冲刺，残血或被敌人贴身时向后撤离，否则贴近目标。随后立即进行下一次攻击，这发熔岩弹贯穿全场，对沿途每名敌人造成 {M:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加目标 {C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加 {E:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n\n火山形态：火山龟获得 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值、{C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度与 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Normal Form: Lava Turtle dashes, backing off when low on health or when an enemy is close, otherwise closing in on the target. It immediately attacks again, and this lava ball pierces across the whole field, dealing {M:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as magic damage to every enemy in its path and applying {E:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn.\n\nVolcano Form: gains {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% of max health, {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% attack speed and {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% move speed for {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "火山形态下攻击变为烈焰重击：造成 {M:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.MELEE_SELF_HP%}%自身最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% 攻击力）层灼烧。\n射程缩短为 {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} 码，转为近战。"
msgstr "In Volcano Form, attacks become Blazing Strikes: they deal {M:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.MELEE_SELF_HP%}% of own max health as magic damage and apply ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% Attack) Burn.\nRange drops to {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} and it becomes melee."

msgid "火山龟召来一道熔岩浪，从敌人那一侧横扫过整个场地。熔岩浪每扫过一名敌人，便将其击飞，造成 {M:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害并施加 {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧，火山龟回复 {C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值。"
msgstr "Volcano Turtle calls a lava wave that sweeps across the whole field from the enemy side. Each enemy it passes is knocked up, takes {M:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage and gets {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn, and Volcano Turtle heals {C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}% of its max health."

msgid "火山龟蓄力猛砸目标，将其击飞，造成 {N:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}%自身最大生命值的物理伤害，并附带 {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Volcano Turtle charges up and slams the target, knocking it up and dealing {N:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health as physical damage, with {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "赛博龟每 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SPAWN_SEC} 秒生成 1 个浮游炮，每个浮游炮每 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_FIRE_SEC} 秒攻击一名随机敌人，造成 {N:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n赛博龟阵亡时，所有浮游炮各发射一道贯穿激光，造成 {M:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，随后组装为一台近战机甲继续战斗。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">浮游炮至多 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_CAP} 个，不可被选中。赛博龟被控制时浮游炮停火。</span>"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle creates 1 drone every {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SPAWN_SEC} seconds. Each drone attacks a random enemy every {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_FIRE_SEC} seconds for {N:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nWhen Cyber Turtle dies, every drone fires a piercing laser dealing {M:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF*ATK} magic damage, then they assemble into a melee mech that keeps fighting.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Up to {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_CAP} drones, which are untargetable. Drones stop firing while Cyber Turtle is crowd-controlled.</span>"

msgid "赛博龟射出一道贯穿激光，对第一个命中的敌人造成 {N:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，之后命中的每个敌人受到 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CYBER_LASER_FALLOFF%}% 的伤害。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle fires a piercing laser that deals {N:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF*ATK} physical damage to the first enemy hit; each enemy after that takes {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CYBER_LASER_FALLOFF%}% of the damage."

msgid "赛博龟蓄力后朝一条直线发射能量射线，对直线上的所有敌人造成 {N:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS*ATK} 物理伤害，每个浮游炮额外附加 {T:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE*ATK} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle charges up and fires an energy ray in a line, dealing {N:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS*ATK} physical damage to all enemies on it, plus {T:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE*ATK} true damage per drone."

msgid "赛博龟侵入一名随机敌人，使其倒戈为赛博龟一方作战，持续 {C:CyberSystem.HIJACK_SEC} 秒。侵入期间赛博龟的龟能锁定，不再充能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋与免疫控制的单位不会被侵入。</span>"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle hacks a random enemy, making it fight for Cyber Turtle's side for {C:CyberSystem.HIJACK_SEC} seconds. Cyber Turtle's Energy is locked and doesn't charge during the hack.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs and units immune to crowd control can't be hacked.</span>"

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.GEAR_IV} 秒获得 1 枚深海币，每局至多 {C:EquipTickSystem.GEAR_CAP} 枚。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Abyss Coin every {C:EquipTickSystem.GEAR_IV} seconds, up to {C:EquipTickSystem.GEAR_CAP} per match."

msgid "获得（1/2/3% 携带者最大生命值）额外攻击力。"
msgstr "Gains (1/2/3% of own max health) bonus attack damage."

msgid "造成的伤害无视闪避。"
msgstr "Damage dealt can't be dodged."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.RUST_IV} 秒朝最近的敌人甩出一道飞斩剑气，命中时造成（60/75/100% 攻击力+40/60/100×暴击率）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.RUST_IV} seconds, flings a flying sword wave at the nearest enemy that deals (60/75/100% Attack + 40/60/100 × Crit Chance) physical damage on hit."

msgid "【法力】充满时，连斩随机敌人 5/6/8 次，每次造成（40/50/70 + 50/70/100% 攻击力）物理伤害，并附带 {C:EqBloodCombo.BLOOD_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。每刀伤害衰减为上一刀的 {C:EqBloodCombo.BLOOD_DECAY%}%。\n被动：溢出的治疗转化为血护盾，至多 200/350/500。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, slashes random enemies 5/6/8 times, each dealing (40/50/70 + 50/70/100% Attack) physical damage with {C:EqBloodCombo.BLOOD_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal. Each slash deals {C:EqBloodCombo.BLOOD_DECAY%}% of the previous one.\nPassive: overflow healing becomes a Blood Shield, up to 200/350/500."

msgid "登场时获得携带者最大生命值 {C:MagicShield.SEAWEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的魔法护盾，该护盾只吸收魔法伤害。\n每 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_IV} 秒获得护盾，护盾值为 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_SHIELD}+携带者最大生命值的 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_MAXHP_PCT%}%，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "On spawn, gains a Magic Shield equal to {C:MagicShield.SEAWEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% of max health that absorbs only magic damage.\nEvery {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_IV} seconds, gains a shield of {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_SHIELD} + {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_MAXHP_PCT%}% of max health for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每次被攻击或技能命中时获得 1 层硬化，每层提供 1/1.5/2 护甲和魔抗（上限 {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_CAP} 层）。\n层数达到上限时获得【海胆护盾】，护盾值为 100/170/250+携带者最大生命值的 5/12/20%，该护盾在 {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_DECAY} 秒内逐渐衰减。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Harden stack whenever hit by an attack or ability. Each stack grants 1/1.5/2 Armor and Magic Resist (max {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_CAP} stacks).\nAt max stacks, gains an [Urchin Shield] of 100/170/250 + 5/12/20% of max health that decays over {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_DECAY} seconds."

msgid "每次被攻击或技能命中时获得 1 层硬化，每层提供 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HARDEN_INC} 护甲和魔抗（上限 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_CAP} 层）。\n硬化层数达到上限时立即汲取一次，此后每 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_IV} 秒对全体敌人汲取生命，每名敌人受到相当于 80/100/250% 护甲与魔抗之和的魔法伤害。每汲取 1 名敌人，回复 50/100/250 点生命值，外加相当于携带者已损失生命值 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HEAL_LOST%}% 的生命值。\n汲取对训龟大师与屏障中的龟蛋无效。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Harden stack whenever hit by an attack or ability, each granting {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HARDEN_INC} Armor and Magic Resist (max {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_CAP} stacks).\nAt max stacks, drains immediately, then drains health from all enemies every {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_IV} seconds. Each enemy takes magic damage equal to 80/100/250% of the holder's combined Armor and Magic Resist. For each enemy drained, heals 50/100/250 plus {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HEAL_LOST%}% of own missing health.\nThe drain doesn't affect the Turtle Trainer or shielded Turtle Eggs."

msgid "每累计反伤 300/270/230 点伤害，便获得 50/70/200 点护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并使下次攻击命中时对目标施加 30/50/90 层流血。\n反伤命中时，对目标施加 {C:ThornCut.AMP_CUT%}% 治疗削减和护盾削减，持续 {C:ThornCut.CUT_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "For every 300/270/230 damage reflected, gains a 50/70/200 shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds, and the next attack hit applies 30/50/90 Bleed.\nReflected hits apply {C:ThornCut.AMP_CUT%}% Grievous Wounds and shield reduction for {C:ThornCut.CUT_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每段受到的非真实伤害减少 3/6/10 点。\n每 {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_IV} 秒生成总量为 100/250/400+携带者最大生命值 {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，由包括携带者在内的全队平均分摊，龟蛋与训龟大师除外。"
msgstr "Reduces each instance of non-true damage taken by 3/6/10.\nEvery {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_IV} seconds, creates a shield totaling 100/250/400 + {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_MAXHP_PCT%}% of max health for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds, split evenly across the whole team including the holder (Turtle Eggs and the Turtle Trainer excluded)."

msgid "免疫击飞与斩杀。\n每 {C:EquipTickSystem.ANCHOR_IV} 秒为生命百分比最低的友军回复相当于携带者最大生命值 0.1/0.2/3% 的生命值，累计治疗达到 {C:EquipTickSystem.ANCHOR_ACC_PER_CHARGE} 点时获得 1 点沉锚充能。\n持有沉锚充能时，攻击速度提升 {C:EquipTickSystem.ANCHOR_ASPD%}%。\n攻击时消耗 1 点充能，击飞最近的敌人，造成（40/60/300% 护甲与魔抗之和 + 6/15/70% 目标最大生命值）物理伤害，并使其眩晕 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Immune to knock-ups and executes.\nEvery {C:EquipTickSystem.ANCHOR_IV} seconds, heals the lowest-health ally for 0.1/0.2/3% of the holder's max health. Gains 1 Anchor charge for every {C:EquipTickSystem.ANCHOR_ACC_PER_CHARGE} healing done.\nWhile holding Anchor charges, gains {C:EquipTickSystem.ANCHOR_ASPD%}% attack speed.\nAttacks spend 1 charge to knock up the nearest enemy, dealing (40/60/300% of combined Armor and Magic Resist + 6/15/70% of the target's max health) physical damage and stunning it for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.SHELL_IV} 秒回复 30/45/60+携带者最大生命值 5/9/15% 的生命值，受治疗增幅影响。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.SHELL_IV} seconds, heals 30/45/60 + 5/9/15% of max health. Affected by healing amplification."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.ANEMONE_IV} 秒为携带者和生命百分比最低的友军回复 30/45/60+目标已损失生命值 12/14/18% 的生命值。\n每累计提供 200/180/150 点实际治疗获得 1 层海葵，每层使治疗与护盾强度+8/9/10%。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.ANEMONE_IV} seconds, heals itself and the ally with the lowest health percentage for 30/45/60 + 12/14/18% of the target's missing health.\nGains 1 Anemone stack for every 200/180/150 actual healing provided; each stack grants +8/9/10% Heal Power and Shield Power."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.DUMBBELL_IV} 秒获得 1 层锻炼，每层使最大生命值与当前生命值+40/75/110。锻炼层数在本局对局中保留到下路与终极战场，开始新对局时重置。获得锻炼时立即投掷哑铃砸向最近的敌人，造成相当于携带者最大生命值 5/7/10% 的物理伤害，并将其击飞。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.DUMBBELL_IV} seconds, gains 1 Workout stack for +40/75/110 max and current health. Workout stacks carry into the Bottom Lane and Final Battle of the same match and reset in a new match. Each time it gains a stack, it throws a dumbbell at the nearest enemy, dealing physical damage equal to 5/7/10% of own max health and knocking it up."

msgid "攻击命中后，对目标施加相当于 7.5/10/15% 攻击力的流血层数。"
msgstr "On hit, applies Bleed stacks equal to 7.5/10/15% of Attack to the target."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_IV} 秒连接全队攻击力最高的友军，为该友军提供 60/110/180 点护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。该友军受到攻击或技能伤害时，实际伤害的 25/40/60% 转由携带者承受，不受其护甲与魔抗影响，可被其护盾吸收。\n同时为携带者和该友军提供 {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_ENERGY} 龟能与 {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_ASPD%}% 攻击速度，此效果可叠加，持续到本战场结束。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_IV} seconds, tethers to the ally with the highest Attack and gives it a 60/110/180 shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds. When that ally takes attack or ability damage, the holder takes 25/40/60% of the actual damage instead, unaffected by the holder's Armor and Magic Resist but absorbable by its shields.\nAlso gives itself and that ally {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_ENERGY} Energy and {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_ASPD%}% attack speed, stacking until the battle ends."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_IV} 秒向最近的敌人抛出一个火瓶，命中时造成 40/60/100 真实伤害，施加（20/35/60 + 10/15/20% 攻击力）层灼烧，并施加【真火】，持续 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} 秒。【真火】使目标受到的灼烧伤害转为真实伤害，对龟蛋的灼烧伤害降低 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_EGG_REDUCE}%。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_IV} seconds, throws a fire flask at the nearest enemy. On hit, deals 40/60/100 true damage, applies (20/35/60 + 10/15/20% Attack) Burn, and applies [True Flame] for {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} seconds. [True Flame] makes Burn damage the target takes true damage; Burn damage to Turtle Eggs is reduced by {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_EGG_REDUCE}%."

msgid "被动：攻击命中时额外施加（2/5/8 + 7/11/15% 攻击力）层灼烧。\n【法力】充满时，蓄力后朝敌方挥出一道火焰波，在 {C:EquipSystem.CORAL_ARC_DEG} 度扇形内推进，对扫过的敌人施加 40/60/90 层灼烧。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">攻击命中时回复 {C:EquipSystem.CORAL_MANA_PER_HIT} 点法力，火焰波施加的灼烧不回复法力。</span>"
msgstr "Passive: attack hits apply (2/5/8 + 7/11/15% Attack) bonus Burn.\n[Mana] When full, charges up and sweeps a fire wave toward the enemy across a {C:EquipSystem.CORAL_ARC_DEG}° cone, applying 40/60/90 Burn to enemies it passes.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Attack hits restore {C:EquipSystem.CORAL_MANA_PER_HIT} mana; Burn from the fire wave doesn't restore mana.</span>"

msgid "装备时即拥有 3 层吐息，之后每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒获得 1 层。\n达到 3 层时重置层数，召唤喷火龙从携带者位置飞向最靠近敌群中心的敌人，直至飞过最远的敌人。龙经过的直线上，敌人受到（45/80/120+100% 攻击力）魔法伤害并被施加 20/35/50 层灼烧，友军与携带者回复（45/80/120+100% 攻击力）生命值。"
msgstr "Starts with 3 Breath stacks when equipped, then gains 1 every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds.\nAt 3 stacks, resets and summons a fire dragon that flies from the holder toward the enemy nearest the center of the enemy group, until it passes the farthest enemy. Enemies along its line take (45/80/120 + 100% Attack) magic damage and 20/35/50 Burn; allies and the holder heal for (45/80/120 + 100% Attack)."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.THUNDER_IV} 秒降下 1/2/3 道雷，每道雷电击 1 名随机敌人，造成 100% 攻击力的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.THUNDER_IV} seconds, calls down 1/2/3 lightning bolts, each striking 1 random enemy for 100% Attack as true damage."

msgid "【法力】充满时，朝随机敌人发射连锁闪电，造成（25/40/70 + {C:EquipSystem.CHAIN_ATK_COEF%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害，在敌人之间跳跃，共命中 7/10/15 次，优先跳向未命中的敌人，可重复命中同一目标。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">攻击命中时回复 {C:EquipSystem.THUNDER_MANA_PER_HIT} 点法力。</span>"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, fires chain lightning at a random enemy, dealing (25/40/70 + {C:EquipSystem.CHAIN_ATK_COEF%}% Attack) magic damage and bouncing between enemies for 7/10/15 hits in total. It prefers enemies not yet hit and can hit the same target again.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Attack hits restore {C:EquipSystem.THUNDER_MANA_PER_HIT} mana.</span>"

msgid "每 3 秒充能就绪，下一次攻击命中时对目标追加 30/40/50 魔法伤害并使其眩晕 2.5/2.5/3 秒，消耗 1 层电击。装备时拥有 3/4/5 层电击，层数每个战场重置。层数为 0 时效果停止，装备保留。"
msgstr "Charges up every 3 seconds. The next attack hit deals 30/40/50 bonus magic damage and stuns the target for 2.5/2.5/3 seconds, spending 1 Shock charge. Starts with 3/4/5 charges, reset each battle. At 0 charges the effect stops, but the item stays."

msgid "每 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_IV} 秒向最近的敌人抛出一个冰瓶，命中时造成（{C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_BASE}+{C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_ATK%}% 攻击力 + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_MAXHP%}% 目标最大生命值）魔法伤害并将其击退，同时施加冰寒，使其移动速度降低 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_MOVE_DOWN%}%、攻击速度降低 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_ASPD_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_CHILL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:IceSystem.VIAL_IV} seconds, throws an ice flask at the nearest enemy. On hit, deals ({C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_BASE} + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_ATK%}% Attack + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health) magic damage, knocks it back, and applies Chill, reducing its move speed by {C:IceSystem.VIAL_MOVE_DOWN%}% and attack speed by {C:IceSystem.VIAL_ASPD_DOWN%}% for {C:IceSystem.VIAL_CHILL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "【法力】充满时，获得 100/160/250 护盾，直到被打破，并朝最近的敌人推出一条冰道。冰道经过的敌人受到 25/40/60 魔法伤害，被击飞 {C:IceSystem.FISSURE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒并冰封 1/1.8/2.5 秒。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, gains a 100/160/250 shield until broken and sends an ice path toward the nearest enemy. Enemies it passes take 25/40/60 magic damage, are knocked up for {C:IceSystem.FISSURE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds, and are frozen for 1/1.8/2.5 seconds."

msgid "【法力】充满时，朝最近的敌人发射 2/2/3 道贯穿光束，每道对直线上的敌人造成 30/35/40 魔法伤害，并施加 1 层【迷你水晶】。\n【迷你水晶】达到 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成 14/17/20% 目标最大生命值的魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每道间隔 {C:CrystalSystem.LINE_SEG_GAP} 秒。</span>"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, fires 2/2/3 piercing beams at the nearest enemy. Each deals 30/35/40 magic damage to enemies in a line and applies 1 [Mini Crystal] stack.\n[Mini Crystal] detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} stacks, dealing magic damage equal to 14/17/20% of the target's max health.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Beams fire {C:CrystalSystem.LINE_SEG_GAP} seconds apart.</span>"

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中后，向目标周围的敌人各溅射 15/28/50% 本段伤害的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit splashes physical damage equal to 15/28/50% of that hit to each enemy around the target."

msgid "【法力】充满时，以携带者为中心进行 {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° 水晶射线扫射，对扫中的敌人造成 60/130/250 魔法伤害，施加 1 层【迷你水晶】，并偷取其 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_MR_STEAL%}% 魔抗，持续到本战场结束。\n【迷你水晶】达到 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成 14/17/20% 目标最大生命值的魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">扫射持续 {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_SEC} 秒，跟随携带者移动。</span>"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, sweeps a crystal ray across {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° around itself, dealing 60/130/250 magic damage to enemies hit, applying 1 [Mini Crystal] stack, and stealing {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_MR_STEAL%}% of their Magic Resist until the battle ends.\n[Mini Crystal] detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} stacks, dealing magic damage equal to 14/17/20% of the target's max health.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The sweep lasts {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_SEC} seconds and follows the holder.</span>"

msgid "登场时召唤一只【亡灵骷髅】。亡灵骷髅受到的任何伤害都只有 1 点，真实伤害也一样，阵亡或存在一段时间后爆炸，对周围的敌人造成真实伤害。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an [Undead Skeleton]. It takes only 1 damage from anything, true damage included, and explodes when it dies or after a while, dealing true damage to nearby enemies."

msgid "所有复活机会用尽、彻底阵亡时，在原位变形为一只【海螺虫】。海螺虫诞生时随机携带 3 件 1/2/3 星的 {C:EquipSystem.CONCH_COST_MIN} 费或 {C:EquipSystem.CONCH_COST_MAX} 费装备。"
msgstr "When all revives are used up and the holder dies for good, it turns into a [Conch Bug] in place. The bug is born carrying 3 random 1/2/3-star {C:EquipSystem.CONCH_COST_MIN}- or {C:EquipSystem.CONCH_COST_MAX}-cost items."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_IV} 秒向最近敌人派出小熊，造成（100/200/500% 攻击力+100/210/1000）物理伤害并将其击飞。派出 {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_BEARS_TO_SUMMON} 只小熊后装备销毁，携带者蓄力 {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_CHARGE_SEC} 秒后在空位召唤一只【大熊】。若无空位，继续派出小熊直至有空位。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_IV} seconds, sends a little bear at the nearest enemy, dealing (100/200/500% Attack + 100/210/1000) physical damage and knocking it up. After {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_BEARS_TO_SUMMON} little bears have been sent, the item is destroyed and after channeling for {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_CHARGE_SEC} seconds the holder summons a [Big Bear] in an empty spot. If there's no empty spot, it keeps sending little bears until there is."

msgid "每秒回复 2/5/10+携带者最大生命值 0.3/0.8/1.2% 的生命值。\n持续获得孵化进度：每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒获得 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_PER_CYCLE}，敌方单位阵亡时获得 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_ON_FOE_DEATH}，己方单位阵亡时获得 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_ON_ALLY_DEATH}，造成的伤害×{C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_DMG_RATIO} 与承受的伤害×{C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_DMG_RATIO} 计入进度。进度满 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_FULL} 时获得 1 点临时等级，每级提升 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_LV_GROWTH%}% 基础属性（上限 3/4/5 级）。临时等级在本局对局中保留到下路与终极战场，开始新对局时重置。\n孵满后为全队均摊 300/400/600 点护盾，直到被打破，仅触发一次，龟蛋与训龟大师不参与分摊。"
msgstr "Heals 2/5/10 + 0.3/0.8/1.2% of max health per second.\nBuilds hatching progress: {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_PER_CYCLE} every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds, {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_ON_FOE_DEATH} when an enemy unit dies, {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_ON_ALLY_DEATH} when an allied unit dies, plus damage dealt × {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_DMG_RATIO} and damage taken × {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_DMG_RATIO}. Each time progress reaches {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_FULL}, gains 1 temporary level, each raising base stats by {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_LV_GROWTH%}% (up to 3/4/5 levels). Temporary levels carry into the Bottom Lane and Final Battle of the same match and reset in a new match.\nWhen fully hatched, splits a 300/400/600 shield across the team until broken. Triggers once; Turtle Eggs and the Turtle Trainer don't share it."

msgid "蜡烛在 {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_PHASES} 个阶段间循环，每 {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} 秒切换并触发对应效果。熄灭阶段无效果。\n微弱阶段：携带者在 {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} 秒内持续回复共（20/30/44+50/70/100% 攻击力）生命值，附近的友军各持续回复其一半。\n燃烧阶段：蜡烛爆燃，对携带者附近的所有敌人造成（20/30/44+50/70/100% 攻击力）魔法伤害并施加 20/30/40 层灼烧。"
msgstr "The candle cycles through {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_PHASES} phases, switching every {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} seconds and triggering that phase's effect. The Out phase has no effect.\nFlicker phase: heals the holder for a total of (20/30/44 + 50/70/100% Attack) over {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} seconds; nearby allies each heal half that.\nBlaze phase: the candle flares, dealing (20/30/44 + 50/70/100% Attack) magic damage and applying 20/30/40 Burn to all enemies near the holder."

msgid "提供 {C:SignalWaveSystem.ASPD_FLAT%}% 攻击速度。\n每次攻击获得 1 层放大，每层使携带者获得 1/2/5% 增伤和 {C:SignalWaveSystem.ASPD_PER_STACK%}% 攻击速度，最多叠加 {C:SignalWaveSystem.MAX_STACKS} 层。\n每获得 {C:SignalWaveSystem.EVERY} 层，由携带者中心朝目标爆发一道张角 {C:SignalWaveSystem.ARC_STEP_DEG} 度、缓慢移动的弧形电磁波，对命中的敌人造成 125/250/500 魔法伤害并眩晕 {C:SignalWaveSystem.WAVE_STUN} 秒。\n每释放一次，电磁波张角增加 {C:SignalWaveSystem.ARC_STEP_DEG} 度（最多 {C:SignalWaveSystem.ARC_MAX_DEG} 度），并使携带者永久获得 5/7/10 点魔法穿透。"
msgstr "Grants {C:SignalWaveSystem.ASPD_FLAT%}% attack speed.\nEach attack grants 1 Amplify stack, each giving 1/2/5% Damage Amp and {C:SignalWaveSystem.ASPD_PER_STACK%}% attack speed, up to {C:SignalWaveSystem.MAX_STACKS} stacks.\nEvery {C:SignalWaveSystem.EVERY} stacks, releases a slow-moving electromagnetic arc of {C:SignalWaveSystem.ARC_STEP_DEG}° from itself toward the target, dealing 125/250/500 magic damage to enemies hit and stunning them for {C:SignalWaveSystem.WAVE_STUN} seconds.\nEach release widens the arc by {C:SignalWaveSystem.ARC_STEP_DEG}° (up to {C:SignalWaveSystem.ARC_MAX_DEG}°) and permanently grants 5/7/10 Magic Pen."

msgid "获得 6/10/15 次生长充能，在本局对局中保留到下路与终极战场，开始新对局时重置。\n每 3 次攻击消耗 1 次充能，向最近的敌人射出一支强化竹箭，造成 25/30/35+{C:EquipSystem.BAMBOO_ARROW_MAXHP_PCT%}% 携带者最大生命值的魔法伤害。命中后回复携带者 {C:EquipSystem.BAMBOO_ARROW_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值，并使其最大生命值永久提升 50/70/90，此效果持续到本局对局结束。"
msgstr "Gains 6/10/15 Growth charges, which carry into the Bottom Lane and Final Battle of the same match and reset in a new match.\nEvery 3 attacks, spends 1 charge to fire an empowered bamboo arrow at the nearest enemy, dealing 25/30/35 + {C:EquipSystem.BAMBOO_ARROW_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health as magic damage. On hit, heals {C:EquipSystem.BAMBOO_ARROW_MAXHP_PCT%}% of max health and permanently gains 50/70/90 Max Health until the match ends."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_IV} 秒随机抽取 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_PICKS} 个可重复的 2-bit 状态：00=回复携带者最大生命值 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_00_HEAL_PCT%}%，累计提升 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_00_RESIST} 双抗。\n01=累计提升 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_01_ATK} 攻击力与 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_01_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n10={C:EquipSystem.FPGA_BUFF_SEC} 秒内增伤 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_10_AMP%}%。11={C:EquipSystem.FPGA_BUFF_SEC} 秒内减伤 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_11_DR%}%（真实伤害除外）。\n00、01 的加成持续到本战场结束。\n登场时给随机 1/2/3 名敌人各一把【古灵精怪枪】：持枪者获得 {C:GremlinGun.ATK_PER_GUN} 攻击力、{C:GremlinGun.HP_PER_GUN} 最大生命值和 {C:GremlinGun.ASPD_PCT_PER_GUN%}% 攻击速度，但每次攻击对自身造成最大生命值 {C:GremlinGun.SELF_TRUE_PCT%}% 的真实伤害，可致死。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_IV} seconds, draws {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_PICKS} random 2-bit states (repeats allowed): 00 = heal {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_00_HEAL_PCT%}% of max health and gain {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_00_RESIST} Armor and Magic Resist (cumulative).\n01 = gain {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_01_ATK} Attack and {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_01_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal (cumulative).\n10 = {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_10_AMP%}% Damage Amp for {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_BUFF_SEC} seconds. 11 = {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_11_DR%}% Damage Reduction for {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_BUFF_SEC} seconds (except true damage).\nBonuses from 00 and 01 last until the battle ends.\nOn spawn, gives 1/2/3 random enemies a [Trickster Gun] each: the holder gains {C:GremlinGun.ATK_PER_GUN} Attack, {C:GremlinGun.HP_PER_GUN} Max Health and {C:GremlinGun.ASPD_PCT_PER_GUN%}% attack speed, but every attack deals true damage to itself equal to {C:GremlinGun.SELF_TRUE_PCT%}% of its max health, which can kill."

msgid "攻击和技能可处决生命值低于斩杀线的敌人，斩杀线为目标最大生命值的 4/6/12%×（1+暴击率）。击杀敌人后回复 {C:EquipSystem.FANG_EXEC_ENERGY} 点龟能，无龟能的单位转而回复 {C:EquipSystem.FANG_EXEC_HEAL} 点生命值。\n此外，每 {C:EquipSystem.FANG_IV} 秒向最近的敌人射出一颗剧毒獠牙，造成 100/180/400% 攻击力的魔法伤害，并回复相当于该伤害 {C:EquipSystem.FANG_LIFESTEAL%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Attacks and abilities execute enemies below the execute threshold: 4/6/12% × (1 + Crit Chance) of the target's max health. Kills restore {C:EquipSystem.FANG_EXEC_ENERGY} Energy; units without Energy heal {C:EquipSystem.FANG_EXEC_HEAL} instead.\nAlso, every {C:EquipSystem.FANG_IV} seconds, fires a venom fang at the nearest enemy, dealing 100/180/400% Attack as magic damage and healing for {C:EquipSystem.FANG_LIFESTEAL%}% of that damage."

msgid "登场 {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_DELAY} 秒后进入【涨潮】：获得 500/1100/2000 最大生命值与 16/31/60 攻击力，体积增大 {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_SIZE_UP%}%，攻击射程提升 {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_RANGE_UP} 码，持续 12/16/22 秒。\n持续时间结束后进入【退潮】，上述加成全部还原。【退潮】不会致死，仅将生命值降至新的上限。"
msgstr "{C:EquipSystem.TIDE_DELAY} seconds after spawning, enters [High Tide] for 12/16/22 seconds: gains 500/1100/2000 Max Health and 16/31/60 Attack, grows {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_SIZE_UP%}% larger, and gains {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_RANGE_UP} attack range.\nWhen it ends, enters [Low Tide] and all bonuses are removed. [Low Tide] can't kill; health just drops to the new maximum."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.RIPPLE_IV} 秒为包括携带者在内的全队各回复其已损失生命值的 3/6/10%。3 星时，生命值百分比最低的友军获得双倍回复。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.RIPPLE_IV} seconds, heals each member of the team, including the holder, for 3/6/10% of its missing health. At 3 stars, the ally with the lowest health percentage heals double."

msgid "【法力】充满时，掀起一道横贯战场的浪墙。友军获得 65/150/400 护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并获得 2/3/5 护甲与魔抗。敌人受到 190/350/800 魔法伤害并被击飞，且失去 2/3/5 护甲与魔抗。护甲与魔抗的增减在本局对局中保留到下路与终极战场，开始新对局时重置。\n负面被动：充满所需的法力提高 50/25/0%。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, raises a wave wall across the battlefield. Allies gain a 65/150/400 shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and 2/3/5 Armor and Magic Resist. Enemies take 190/350/800 magic damage, are knocked up, and lose 2/3/5 Armor and Magic Resist. Armor and Magic Resist changes carry into the Bottom Lane and Final Battle of the same match and reset in a new match.\nDrawback: needs 50/25/0% more mana to fill."

msgid "生命值首次降至 {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}% 以下时，在 {C:EquipSystem.NECKLACE_HOT_SEC} 秒内逐渐回复携带者最大生命值 40/85/130%，每个战场一次。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}%, heals 40/85/130% of max health over {C:EquipSystem.NECKLACE_HOT_SEC} seconds. Once per battle."

msgid "生命值首次降至 {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}% 以下时，在 {C:EquipSystem.EARRING_HOT_SEC} 秒内逐渐回复携带者最大生命值 30/60/100%，并向 1/1/2 名随机敌人发射火球，造成 8/17/30% 目标最大生命值的魔法伤害并施加 30/70/100 层灼烧，每个战场一次。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}%, heals 30/60/100% of max health over {C:EquipSystem.EARRING_HOT_SEC} seconds and launches fireballs at 1/1/2 random enemies, dealing magic damage equal to 8/17/30% of the target's max health and applying 30/70/100 Burn. Once per battle."

msgid "每成功闪避一次攻击，立即获得 30/50/120 点护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Each successfully dodged attack instantly grants a 30/50/120 shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.HANDGUN_IV} 秒依次射出 4/5/6 发子弹，每发命中沿途第一个敌人，各造成 50/90/150% 攻击力的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.HANDGUN_IV} seconds, fires 4/5/6 bullets in sequence. Each hits the first enemy in its path for 50/90/150% Attack as physical damage."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_IV} 秒朝距离自己最远的敌人方向依次连射 1/2/3 发，每发命中沿途第一个敌人，按目标已损失生命值造成 {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_MIN_COEF%}~{C:EquipSystem.XBOW_MAX_COEF%}% 攻击力的物理伤害，目标已损失 {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_LOST_FULL%}% 生命时伤害达到最大。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_IV} seconds, fires 1/2/3 bolts in sequence toward the farthest enemy. Each hits the first enemy in its path for {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_MIN_COEF%}–{C:EquipSystem.XBOW_MAX_COEF%}% Attack as physical damage based on the target's missing health, maxing out at {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_LOST_FULL%}% health missing."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.GATLING_IV} 秒打出 20/30/60 发随机分布的子弹，每发对命中的敌人造成 10/12/14% 攻击力的物理伤害，并使其永久失去 1/2/3 护甲，对单一目标累计最多降低 15/25/40 护甲。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.GATLING_IV} seconds, sprays 20/30/60 bullets. Each deals 10/12/14% Attack as physical damage to the enemy hit and permanently removes 1/2/3 Armor, up to 15/25/40 per target."

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中后，有 50/75/100% 概率追加一次刺击，造成 70/80/100% 攻击力的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit has a 50/75/100% chance to add a stab dealing 70/80/100% Attack as physical damage."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_IV} 秒朝最近的敌人打出一道无限穿透的激光，命中这条直线上的所有敌人：第一个敌人受到 150/200/280% 攻击力物理伤害并被施加 50/50/60% 攻击力的流血层数，其身后的敌人各受到 {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_LASER_FALLOFF%}% 效果。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_IV} seconds, fires an infinitely piercing laser at the nearest enemy, hitting every enemy on the line: the first takes 150/200/280% Attack as physical damage and Bleed stacks equal to 50/50/60% of Attack; enemies behind it take {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_LASER_FALLOFF%}% of the effect."

msgid "装备时拥有 {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_AMMO} 发子弹。任何敌人阵亡时获得 1 发子弹，上限 {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_AMMO} 发，每个战场重置。\n每 {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_IV} 秒向 1 名随机敌人射出 1 发子弹，造成（150/310/1200+300/500/900% 攻击力）物理伤害。\n子弹为 0 时停止射击，装备不会消失。"
msgstr "Starts with {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_AMMO} bullets. Gains 1 bullet whenever any enemy dies, up to {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_AMMO}, reset each battle.\nEvery {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_IV} seconds, fires 1 bullet at a random enemy, dealing (150/310/1200 + 300/500/900% Attack) physical damage.\nStops firing at 0 bullets; the item stays."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_IV} 秒朝最近的敌人打出 12/14/18 颗弹珠，相邻两颗夹角 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHOTGUN_PELLET_DEG} 度，均匀分布在中线两侧。\n每颗弹珠沿各自的直线飞行，命中路径上的第一个敌人时造成 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_COEF%}% 攻击力的物理伤害并消失。\n同一次齐射中被 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_STUN_HITS} 颗及以上弹珠命中的敌人眩晕 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_IV} seconds, fires 12/14/18 pellets at the nearest enemy, {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHOTGUN_PELLET_DEG}° apart and spread evenly around the center line.\nEach pellet flies straight and deals {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_COEF%}% Attack as physical damage to the first enemy in its path, then disappears.\nEnemies hit by {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_STUN_HITS} or more pellets from the same volley are stunned for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "本战场累计造成 {C:HookBombSystem.TRIGGER_DMG} 点伤害后，向最近的 1/1/2 名敌人发射钩索炸弹：炸弹附着在敌人身上，每 {C:HookBombSystem.BOMB_TICK} 秒对其造成其最大生命值 3/6/6% 的物理伤害，直到该敌人死亡。\n若携带炸弹的敌人死亡，则朝所有敌方单位发射钩索，眩晕 {C:HookBombSystem.PULL_STUN} 秒后将其拉向该敌人倒下处，聚拢后产生一次爆炸，造成 120/250/400+{C:HookBombSystem.BLAST_MAXHP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。训龟大师、龟蛋与免控单位不受钩索影响。"
msgstr "After dealing {C:HookBombSystem.TRIGGER_DMG} total damage this battle, fires hook bombs at the 1/1/2 nearest enemies. A bomb sticks to the enemy and deals physical damage equal to 3/6/6% of its max health every {C:HookBombSystem.BOMB_TICK} seconds until it dies.\nWhen an enemy carrying a bomb dies, hooks fly at every enemy unit, stunning them for {C:HookBombSystem.PULL_STUN} seconds and pulling them to where it fell, then an explosion deals 120/250/400 + {C:HookBombSystem.BLAST_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage. The Turtle Trainer, Turtle Eggs and units immune to crowd control aren't hooked."

msgid "任何敌人被己方击飞时，为其施加【靶子】标记，该标记不会自行消失。\n携带者每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒向所有带有靶子的敌人各射出 1 枚飞镖，造成（130/190/600+150/300/900% 攻击力）物理伤害并施加 {C:EquipSystem.DART_BLEED_COEF%}% 攻击力的流血层数，命中后移除该敌人的靶子。\n此外提供 40/80/150% 攻击速度，且携带者每第 {C:EquipSystem.DART_EVERY} 次攻击命中时将目标击飞 {C:EquipSystem.DART_KNOCKUP_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Whenever your team knocks up an enemy, it gets a [Target] mark that doesn't expire on its own.\nEvery {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds, throws 1 dart at each marked enemy, dealing (130/190/600 + 150/300/900% Attack) physical damage and Bleed stacks equal to {C:EquipSystem.DART_BLEED_COEF%}% of Attack. A hit removes the mark.\nAlso grants 40/80/150% attack speed, and every {C:EquipSystem.DART_EVERY}th attack hit knocks the target up for {C:EquipSystem.DART_KNOCKUP_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_IV} 秒锁定生命值百分比最低的敌人并蓄力 {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_WINDUP} 秒，随后开枪，对这条直线上的敌人各造成 200/300/700% 攻击力的物理伤害。\n若这一枪造成击杀，则重新选择生命值最低的目标再开一枪，每一枪均需重新蓄力 {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_WINDUP} 秒（最多连续 {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_MAX_CHAIN} 次）。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_IV} seconds, locks onto the enemy with the lowest health percentage, aims for {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_WINDUP} seconds, then fires, dealing 200/300/700% Attack as physical damage to each enemy on the line.\nIf the shot kills, it picks the new lowest-health target and fires again, aiming for {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_WINDUP} seconds each time (up to {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_MAX_CHAIN} in a row)."

msgid "登场时召唤一座不可移动的炮台。炮台拥有 650/1400/2500 外加 {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_HP_PER_ATK}×自身攻击力 的最大生命值、70/120/180 外加 1×自身攻击力 的攻击力、每秒 {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_ASPD} 次的攻击速度与 {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_RANGE} 码射程。\n炮台的攻击造成 100% 攻击力物理伤害，并使炮台永久获得 {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_CRIT_PER_SHOT%}% 暴击率，持续到本战场结束。\n自身存活时炮台获得 70/85/100 护甲与魔抗。自身位于炮台附近时，自身获得 {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_BUFF_ASPD%}% 攻击速度。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an immobile turret with 650/1400/2500 + {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_HP_PER_ATK} × the holder's Attack max health, 70/120/180 + 1 × the holder's Attack attack damage, {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_ASPD} attacks per second and {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_RANGE} range.\nThe turret's attacks deal 100% Attack as physical damage and permanently grant it {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_CRIT_PER_SHOT%}% Crit Chance until the battle ends.\nWhile the holder is alive, the turret has 70/85/100 Armor and Magic Resist. While the holder is near the turret, the holder gains {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_BUFF_ASPD%}% attack speed."

msgid "登场第 {C:TimestopSystem.TS_START_T} 秒开始蓄力，{C:TimestopSystem.TS_CHARGE} 秒后释放【时间停止】：全场其他单位、弹道与特效全部定格，持续 4/7/20 秒。\n此期间只有携带全场最高星级沙漏的龟可以自由攻击、施法与移动，敌我均适用，同星级的沙漏可并存，伤害立即生效，龟能充能速度变为 1.5/2/3 倍，且在时间停止开始时立即获得 40/150/300 点龟能。\n若场上存在更高星级的沙漏，低星级的沙漏在本战场不会生效。\n上路战场、下路战场与终极战场各可触发一次。"
msgstr "At {C:TimestopSystem.TS_START_T} seconds after spawning, starts charging, and after {C:TimestopSystem.TS_CHARGE} seconds casts [Time Stop]: every other unit, projectile and effect on the field freezes for 4/7/20 seconds.\nMeanwhile, only turtles holding the highest-star Hourglass on the field can attack, cast and move freely (either side; Hourglasses of the same star level can coexist). Their damage applies instantly, their Energy charges 1.5/2/3× faster, and they gain 40/150/300 Energy when Time Stop begins.\nIf a higher-star Hourglass is on the field, lower-star ones don't activate this battle.\nTriggers once each in the Top Lane, Bottom Lane and Final Battle."

msgid "伞收起 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} 秒后撑开：携带者与附近的队友获得 11/22/35% 减伤与 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_DODGE%}% 闪避，持续 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_OPEN} 秒。\n效果结束时携带者回复 50/80/130 生命值，{C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} 秒后再次撑开。"
msgstr "The umbrella opens after being closed for {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} seconds: the holder and nearby allies gain 11/22/35% Damage Reduction and {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_DODGE%}% Dodge for {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_OPEN} seconds.\nWhen it ends, the holder heals 50/80/130, and it opens again after {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.SWORD_STORM_IV} 秒召出一排剑穿过全体敌人，对每名敌人造成（70/100/400+80/130/400% 攻击力）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.SWORD_STORM_IV} seconds, summons a row of swords that pass through all enemies, dealing (70/100/400 + 80/130/400% Attack) physical damage to each."

msgid "每次攻击命中时额外造成目标最大生命值 2/2.5/3% 的魔法伤害，并施加 1/1/2 层【破损】，单个目标最多叠加 {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} 层，破损永久保留。\n目标已有 {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} 层破损时，此伤害转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack hit deals bonus magic damage equal to 2/2.5/3% of the target's max health and applies 1/1/2 [Fracture] stacks, up to {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} per target. Fracture is permanent.\nOnce the target has {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} Fracture stacks, this damage becomes true damage."

msgid "释放技能后，下次攻击额外造成 60/90/140% 攻击力 + 3/5/9% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害，并回复此伤害 {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_LEECH%}% 的生命值。\n本次技能每消耗 1 点龟能，此伤害提高 {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_PER_ENERGY%}%。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, the next attack deals 60/90/140% Attack + 3/5/9% of the target's max health as bonus physical damage and heals for {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_LEECH%}% of it.\nThis damage increases by {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_PER_ENERGY%}% for each Energy that ability cost."

msgid "释放技能后获得 30/60/100% 攻击速度，持续时间为本次技能消耗的龟能×{C:EqSpiritBatch.RING_SEC_PER_ENERGY} 秒。\n携带者的攻击会对敌人施加一层【灵火】，在 3 层时引爆，对该敌人造成（15/30/50+{C:EqSpiritBatch.RING_ATK_COEF%}% 攻击力+2.5/4/6% 该敌人最大生命值）真实伤害。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, gains 30/60/100% attack speed for (Energy that ability cost × {C:EqSpiritBatch.RING_SEC_PER_ENERGY}) seconds.\nAttacks apply a [Spirit Flame] stack to enemies. At 3 stacks it detonates, dealing (15/30/50 + {C:EqSpiritBatch.RING_ATK_COEF%}% Attack + 2.5/4/6% of that enemy's max health) true damage."

msgid "生命值首次降至 {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_HP_LINE%}% 以下时，获得携带者最大生命值 50/80/160% 的【幽灵护盾】，此护盾会在 {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_DECAY} 秒内线性衰减。\n持有该护盾期间获得 {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_DODGE%}% 闪避与 30/60/120 点双抗。\n该护盾被击破或自然衰减耗尽时会爆炸，使附近的敌人陷入 {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_CURSE_SEC} 秒【诅咒】。\n每个战场一次。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_HP_LINE%}%, gains a [Ghost Shield] equal to 50/80/160% of max health that decays steadily over {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_DECAY} seconds.\nWhile it holds, gains {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_DODGE%}% Dodge and 30/60/120 Armor and Magic Resist.\nWhen the shield breaks or fully decays, it explodes, applying [Curse] to nearby enemies for {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_CURSE_SEC} seconds.\nOnce per battle."

msgid "每次攻击后获得 {C:EqPotionBatch.LIVER_ENERGY} 点龟能与 3/5/7% 攻击速度。攻击速度加成可无限叠加，换路时重置。"
msgstr "After each attack, gains {C:EqPotionBatch.LIVER_ENERGY} Energy and 3/5/7% attack speed. The attack speed bonus stacks infinitely and resets when switching lanes."

msgid "登场第 {C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_AT} 秒饮用药水：免疫控制效果直到本战场结束，并获得生命偷取 8/13/20%、最大生命值 100/200/400、护甲与魔抗 12/17/25、攻击速度 10/17/25%、暴击率 10/17/25%、暴击伤害 7/13/18%、龟能充能 5/7/10%、攻击力 13/18/25、护甲穿透与魔法穿透 4/7/10，体型额外+{C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_SIZE_UP%}%。\n每个战场仅生效一次。"
msgstr "At {C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_AT} seconds after spawning, drinks the potion: immune to crowd control until the battle ends, and gains 8/13/20% Lifesteal, 100/200/400 Max Health, 12/17/25 Armor and Magic Resist, 10/17/25% attack speed, 10/17/25% Crit Chance, 7/13/18% Crit Damage, 5/7/10% Energy Charge, 13/18/25 Attack, 4/7/10 Armor Pen and Magic Pen, and +{C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_SIZE_UP%}% size.\nOnce per battle."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.VIAL_IV} 秒向敌人最密集处投掷一个药瓶，对落点附近的敌人施加 40/70/110 层中毒。攻击额外施加 {C:VenomDroneSystem.POISON_STACKS} 层中毒。\n携带者存活时，对中毒的敌人施加 {C:EqPotionBatch.VIAL_CUT%}% 治疗削减和护盾削减。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.VIAL_IV} seconds, throws a vial at the densest group of enemies, applying 40/70/110 Poison to enemies near where it lands. Attacks also apply {C:VenomDroneSystem.POISON_STACKS} Poison.\nWhile the holder is alive, poisoned enemies have {C:EqPotionBatch.VIAL_CUT%}% Grievous Wounds and shield reduction."

msgid "受到伤害的 60/100/200% 存入专属充能条，充能条上限为最大生命值的 30/50/100%。\n登场第 {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} 秒起，每 {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} 秒消耗全部充能：获得充能值 100/120/300% 的法力护盾，该护盾在 {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_SHIELD_DECAY} 秒内衰减完毕，并朝最远的敌人发射一道法力激光，持续 {C:PotionEqVfx.BEAM_SEC} 秒。激光会转向追踪该敌人，目标死亡后转向当前最远的敌人，共造成充能值 100/120/600% 的魔法伤害，由被扫到的敌人按照射时长分摊。\n法力护盾存在期间，充能条锁定。\n攻击额外获得 {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_HIT_ENERGY} 龟能并回复 20/35/50 生命值。"
msgstr "Stores 60/100/200% of damage taken in a dedicated charge bar, capped at 30/50/100% of max health.\nFrom {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} seconds after spawning, every {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} seconds it spends all charge: gains a mana shield equal to 100/120/300% of the charge that fully decays over {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_SHIELD_DECAY} seconds, and fires a mana laser at the farthest enemy for {C:PotionEqVfx.BEAM_SEC} seconds. The laser turns to track that enemy, switching to the current farthest enemy if it dies, and deals magic damage totaling 100/120/600% of the charge, split among enemies swept by time in the beam.\nThe charge bar is locked while the mana shield holds.\nAttacks also grant {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_HIT_ENERGY} Energy and heal 20/35/50."

msgid "携带 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_COUNT} 块蛋糕，生命值首次低于 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_1%}%、{C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_2%}%、{C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_3%}% 时各吃下一块。\n第一块：获得 200/400/600 最大生命值，并在 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_HOT1_SEC} 秒内每秒回复携带者 0.6/0.8/1% 最大生命值。\n第二块：获得 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取与 10/21/40 攻击力。\n第三块：获得 150/250/400 护盾与 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_ENERGY} 龟能，攻击速度提高 40/60/80%，持续 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_ASPD_SEC} 秒，并在 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_HOT3_SEC} 秒内每秒回复携带者 1.3/1.6/2% 最大生命值。\n一次掉血跌过多条线时连续吃下多块。护盾直到被打破，其余加成持续到本战场结束。"
msgstr "Carries {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_COUNT} slices of cake, eating one the first time health drops below {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_1%}%, {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_2%}% and {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_3%}%.\nFirst slice: gains 200/400/600 Max Health and heals 0.6/0.8/1% of max health per second for {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_HOT1_SEC} seconds.\nSecond slice: gains {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal and 10/21/40 Attack.\nThird slice: gains a 150/250/400 shield and {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_ENERGY} Energy, +40/60/80% attack speed for {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_ASPD_SEC} seconds, and heals 1.3/1.6/2% of max health per second for {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_HOT3_SEC} seconds.\nIf one hit crosses several lines, it eats several slices in a row. The shield lasts until broken; other bonuses last until the battle ends."

msgid "每次攻击附带携带者 3/4.5/7% 最大生命值的物理伤害，并对目标周围的敌人造成携带者 1/1.5/2% 最大生命值的物理伤害。\n被动：受到伤害的 30/40/50% 存入灰色血条，每秒将灰色血条的 {C:EqFoodBatch.GREY_CONVERT%}% 转化为生命回复。携带者每有 100 最大生命值，获得 1% 攻击速度。"
msgstr "Each attack deals bonus physical damage equal to 3/4.5/7% of own max health, and physical damage equal to 1/1.5/2% of own max health to enemies around the target.\nPassive: 30/40/50% of damage taken is stored in a gray health bar, and {C:EqFoodBatch.GREY_CONVERT%}% of the gray bar turns into healing each second. Gains 1% attack speed per 100 max health."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.BROADSWORD_IV} 秒朝最近的敌人方向挥出一道剑气墙，贯穿直线上的所有敌人，对每名敌人造成（20/35/60+50/80/110% 攻击力）物理伤害。\n携带者获得相当于本次总伤害 50/75/100% 的护盾，直到被打破。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.BROADSWORD_IV} seconds, swings a wall of sword energy toward the nearest enemy that pierces every enemy on the line, dealing (20/35/60 + 50/80/110% Attack) physical damage to each.\nGains a shield equal to 50/75/100% of the total damage until broken."

msgid "每个战场开始时，为包括携带者在内的所有友军提供其最大生命值 10/18/25% 的【奶油护盾】，该护盾持续到被打破为止。\n奶油护盾被打破时，对附近的敌人造成 70/100/150 点魔法伤害，随后该友军获得 {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_RESIST} 双抗、20/30/40% 攻击速度和 {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_RANGE} 射程，持续到本战场结束。\n携带者每累计受到相当于其最大生命值 {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_LOSS_STEP%}% 的伤害，再次为全队提供一次奶油护盾，每个战场共 {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_TIMES} 次。"
msgstr "At the start of each battle, gives every ally, including the holder, a [Cream Shield] equal to 10/18/25% of its max health that lasts until broken.\nWhen a Cream Shield breaks, it deals 70/100/150 magic damage to nearby enemies, and that ally gains {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_RESIST} Armor and Magic Resist, 20/30/40% attack speed and {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_RANGE} range until the battle ends.\nEach time the holder has taken damage equal to {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_LOSS_STEP%}% of its max health, it gives the team Cream Shields again, {C:EqFoodBatch.CREAM_TIMES} times per battle."

msgid "获得最大生命值 50/80/120% 的永久【终极护盾】。\n护盾存在时，携带者化为蛋糕礼盒：属性不变，射程变为近战，攻击与技能替换为礼盒效果。\n礼盒嘲讽附近所有敌人，每有一个敌人以携带者为目标，获得 {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_RES_PER_LOCKER} 双抗。攻击造成 {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_HIT_COEF%}% 攻击力物理伤害。技能召唤蛋糕法阵，持续 {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_FIELD_SEC} 秒，每秒为其中友军回复 {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_FIELD_HEAL} 生命值与 {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_FIELD_ENERGY} 龟能。\n终极护盾破碎时，携带者脱离礼盒。\n携带者阵亡时分裂出两个【蛋糕礼盒】。"
msgstr "Gains a permanent [Ultimate Shield] equal to 50/80/120% of max health.\nWhile it holds, the holder becomes a Cake Box: stats unchanged, range becomes melee, and attacks and abilities are replaced by Cake Box effects.\nThe Cake Box taunts all nearby enemies and gains {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_RES_PER_LOCKER} Armor and Magic Resist for each enemy targeting it. Attacks deal {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_HIT_COEF%}% Attack as physical damage. Its ability summons a cake circle for {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_FIELD_SEC} seconds that heals allies inside for {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_FIELD_HEAL} and gives {C:EqFoodBatch.BOX_FIELD_ENERGY} Energy per second.\nWhen the Ultimate Shield breaks, the holder leaves the Cake Box.\nWhen the holder dies, it splits into two [Cake Box] summons."

msgid "身上悬浮一颗藤蔓小球。\n每次攻击时，小球向随机敌人射出一支藤蔓箭，造成（15/23/30 + 30/40/60% 攻击力）物理伤害。\n藤蔓箭独立判定暴击，暴击率与携带者相同。暴击时藤蔓箭转为真实伤害，并使携带者获得 35/45/60% 攻击速度，持续 {C:EqBowBatch.VINE_ASPD_SEC} 秒。再次暴击仅刷新持续时间，不可叠加。"
msgstr "A vine orb floats beside the holder.\nEach attack, the orb fires a vine arrow at a random enemy, dealing (15/23/30 + 30/40/60% Attack) physical damage.\nVine arrows roll crits separately, using the holder's Crit Chance. A critical vine arrow deals true damage and grants the holder 35/45/60% attack speed for {C:EqBowBatch.VINE_ASPD_SEC} seconds. Further crits only refresh the duration; it doesn't stack."

msgid "每次攻击使携带者获得 9/16/25 外加 2.5/3.5/4.5% 携带者最大生命值的护盾，可无限叠加。每次攻击还附带 15/30/50 魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack grants a shield of 9/16/25 + 2.5/3.5/4.5% of own max health, stacking infinitely. Each attack also deals 15/30/50 bonus magic damage."

msgid "每 {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_IV} 秒在敌人最密集处降下一轮箭雨，持续 {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_SEC} 秒，每 {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_HOP_IV} 秒造成 25/35/50% 攻击力的物理伤害并施加 3/4/5 层流血。\n被动：目标与携带者的距离每有 {C:EqBowBatch.AMP_PER_PX} 码，攻击和技能对其造成的伤害提升 3/4/5%，无上限。此效果同样作用于箭雨。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_IV} seconds, rains arrows on the densest group of enemies for {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_SEC} seconds, dealing 25/35/50% Attack as physical damage and applying 3/4/5 Bleed every {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_HOP_IV} seconds.\nPassive: for every {C:EqBowBatch.AMP_PER_PX} units between the holder and the target, attacks and abilities deal 3/4/5% more damage to it, with no cap. This also applies to the arrow rain."

msgid "被动：仅在弓箭羁绊激活时生效，每 {C:EqBowBatch.CORRODE_EVERY} 次攻击对目标施加 1 层【腐蚀】，与弓箭羁绊共用层数。\n主动：释放技能后，每 {C:EqBowBatch.VOLLEY_IV} 秒射出一支箭，箭数=本次技能消耗的龟能÷{C:EqBowBatch.ENERGY_PER_SHOT}。\n箭沿直线飞行，贯穿沿途敌人，每支造成 5/6/8% 攻击力的物理伤害加 9/13/16 点真实伤害。每穿过一个敌人，伤害降低 {C:BowEqVfx.PIERCE_DECAY_DOWN%}%（最低 {C:BowEqVfx.PIERCE_FLOOR%}%），并从该敌人身上为携带者偷取 0.5/0.5/1 点龟能。"
msgstr "Passive: only while the Bow synergy is active, every {C:EqBowBatch.CORRODE_EVERY} attacks apply 1 [Corrosion] stack to the target, shared with the Bow synergy.\nActive: after casting an ability, fires an arrow every {C:EqBowBatch.VOLLEY_IV} seconds; arrows = Energy that ability cost ÷ {C:EqBowBatch.ENERGY_PER_SHOT}.\nArrows fly straight and pierce enemies, each dealing 5/6/8% Attack as physical damage plus 9/13/16 true damage. Each enemy pierced reduces damage by {C:BowEqVfx.PIERCE_DECAY_DOWN%}% (minimum {C:BowEqVfx.PIERCE_FLOOR%}%) and steals 0.5/0.5/1 Energy from that enemy for the holder."

msgid "生成一把【小手枪】协同攻击，其受到的所有伤害降为 {C:EqGunBatch.PISTOL_DMG_CAP} 点。\n小手枪的攻击会触发枪羁绊【金弹】。"
msgstr "Creates a [Little Pistol] that attacks alongside. All damage it takes is reduced to {C:EqGunBatch.PISTOL_DMG_CAP}.\nThe pistol's attacks trigger the Gun synergy's [Golden Bullet]."

msgid "两管共享计数，每 {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_IV} 秒交替射击，仅在附近有敌人时开火。\n左管发射锥形霰弹，造成 15/25/40 + 30/60/100% 攻击力的物理伤害。\n右管发射电击弹，对首个目标造成 {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_BOLT_ATK%}% 攻击力的物理伤害+50/100/180 魔法伤害。魔法伤害依次连锁至所有未被击中的敌人，每次跳跃降低 20/15/10%。\n金弹从轮到的那管射出并继承其效果，额外造成本段伤害 60/80/100% 的真实伤害（随枪羁绊件数），对电击弹首个目标与每次跳跃均生效。"
msgstr "The two barrels share a counter and fire in turn every {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_IV} seconds, only when enemies are nearby.\nThe left barrel fires a cone of buckshot dealing 15/25/40 + 30/60/100% Attack as physical damage.\nThe right barrel fires a shock round dealing {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_BOLT_ATK%}% Attack as physical damage + 50/100/180 magic damage to the first target. The magic damage chains to every enemy not yet hit, dropping 20/15/10% per bounce.\nGolden Bullets come from whichever barrel is up and keep its effects, dealing bonus true damage equal to 60/80/100% of the hit (scales with Gun count), applied to the shock round's first target and every bounce."

msgid "在携带者后方生成一座【急救塔】，攻击敌人，并为生命百分比最低的友军回复生命值。\n急救塔单独计算枪羁绊的金弹。"
msgstr "Creates an [Aid Tower] behind the holder that attacks enemies and heals the ally with the lowest health percentage.\nThe tower counts the Gun synergy's Golden Bullets separately."

msgid "登场时召唤无法被选中且完全免疫的直升机，在战场上空盘旋，拥有独立龟能条。\n每 {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_FIRE_IV} 秒向正下方最近的敌人扫射 3/4/10 发机炮，每发造成 {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_SHOT_COEF%}% 攻击力的物理伤害，每发命中获得 {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_EN_PER_HIT} 点龟能（上限 {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_EN_MAX}）。\n龟能满时发动【地毯轰炸】：沿覆盖敌人最多的航线飞过，投下 8/10/14 枚炸弹，每枚对落点附近敌人造成 40/70/150% 攻击力的物理伤害+50/100/120 魔法伤害。\n机炮与炸弹均计入枪羁绊【金弹】计数。\n携带者阵亡后，直升机继续飞行 {C:EqGunBatch.DOOM_SEC} 秒，随后坠向随机敌人并爆炸，对附近敌人造成 200/300/500 物理伤害并施加 {C:EqGunBatch.CRASH_BURN} 层灼烧。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an untargetable, fully immune gyrocopter that circles over the battlefield with its own Energy bar.\nEvery {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_FIRE_IV} seconds, it strafes the nearest enemy below with 3/4/10 cannon rounds, each dealing {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_SHOT_COEF%}% Attack as physical damage and granting {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_EN_PER_HIT} Energy on hit (max {C:EqGunBatch.HELI_EN_MAX}).\nAt full Energy, it launches [Carpet Bombing]: flies the route covering the most enemies and drops 8/10/14 bombs, each dealing 40/70/150% Attack as physical damage + 50/100/120 magic damage to enemies near where it lands.\nCannon rounds and bombs both count toward the Gun synergy's [Golden Bullet].\nAfter the holder dies, the gyrocopter keeps flying for {C:EqGunBatch.DOOM_SEC} seconds, then crashes into a random enemy and explodes, dealing 200/300/500 physical damage and applying {C:EqGunBatch.CRASH_BURN} Burn to nearby enemies."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.CORAL_IV} 秒向距离携带者最远的敌人发射一根珊瑚尖刺，命中时造成（100/120/150% 攻击力）物理伤害，外加相当于目标最大生命值 8/12/18% 的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.CORAL_IV} seconds, fires a coral spike at the farthest enemy. On hit, deals (100/120/150% Attack) physical damage plus magic damage equal to 8/12/18% of the target's max health."

msgid "充能条：每累计受到携带者 40/35/30% 最大生命值的伤害后举盾 2.5/3/3.5 秒，期间获得 60/100/160 护盾值与 50/80/140 双抗，举盾期间受到的伤害不计入充能条。\n举盾结束后重新开始计数。"
msgstr "Charge bar: after taking damage equal to 40/35/30% of max health, raises the shield for 2.5/3/3.5 seconds, gaining a 60/100/160 shield and 50/80/140 Armor and Magic Resist. Damage taken while the shield is raised doesn't fill the bar.\nThe count restarts when the shield lowers."

msgid "【护心反伤】携带者每受到一段攻击，对攻击者造成 3/5/8 点魔法伤害。持续伤害不触发此效果，多段攻击每段独立计数，此反伤不会触发攻击者的反伤效果。\n每反伤 {C:EqBladeBatch.CLAM_PER_CHARGE} 次获得一层充能。携带者的攻击消耗一层充能，回复其最大生命值的 5/7/10%，并附带其 100% 魔抗的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "[Heartguard Thorns] Each attack hit taken deals 3/5/8 magic damage to the attacker. Damage over time doesn't trigger it; each hit of a multi-hit attack counts separately; this doesn't trigger the attacker's Thorns.\nEvery {C:EqBladeBatch.CLAM_PER_CHARGE} reflects grants a charge. The holder's attacks spend a charge to heal 5/7/10% of max health and deal bonus magic damage equal to 100% of the holder's Magic Resist."

msgid "每损失 1% 生命值，获得 0.2/0.3/0.4% 攻击速度。\n连续命中同一目标时，每次叠加一层（最多 {C:EqBladeBatch.RAPIER_CAP} 层），每层提供 1/1.5/2% 增伤与 {C:EqBladeBatch.RAPIER_LS_PER%}% 生命偷取。切换目标或目标死亡时重置层数。\n剑羁绊【剑士】的追击计入连续命中。"
msgstr "Gains 0.2/0.3/0.4% attack speed for every 1% health lost.\nEach consecutive hit on the same target adds a stack (max {C:EqBladeBatch.RAPIER_CAP}), each granting 1/1.5/2% Damage Amp and {C:EqBladeBatch.RAPIER_LS_PER%}% Lifesteal. Stacks reset when switching targets or when the target dies.\nSword synergy [Swordsman] follow-ups count as consecutive hits."

msgid "效果随携带者为近战或远程而改变。\n近战携带：射程变为 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_RANGE} 码，并获得 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_AMP%}% 增伤。技能替换为消耗 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_ENERGY} 龟能的【十字斩】：横斩扫过，造成 40/70/130+60/90/140% 攻击力的物理伤害，横波再造成 25/45/85+40/60/90% 攻击力的物理伤害。随后竖斩造成 50/85/160+70/110/170% 攻击力的物理伤害，竖波再造成 30/55/100+50/70/110% 攻击力的物理伤害。\n远程携带：射程固定为 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_RANGED_RANGE} 码，获得 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_RANGED_DR%}% 减伤。另获得 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_RANGED_HP} 最大生命值、登场时攻击力的 10/15/20% 作为额外攻击力与 10/12.5/15% 生命偷取，每转化 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_CONV_PER} 码射程，这三项属性提升 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_CONV_BONUS%}%。主动技能不替换。"
msgstr "The effect depends on whether the holder is melee or ranged.\nMelee holder: range becomes {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_RANGE} and gains {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_AMP%}% Damage Amp. Its ability becomes [Cross Slash] costing {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_ENERGY} Energy: a horizontal slash deals 40/70/130 + 60/90/140% Attack as physical damage, and its horizontal wave deals another 25/45/85 + 40/60/90% Attack. Then a vertical slash deals 50/85/160 + 70/110/170% Attack, and its vertical wave deals another 30/55/100 + 50/70/110% Attack, all as physical damage.\nRanged holder: range is fixed at {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_RANGED_RANGE} and gains {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_RANGED_DR%}% Damage Reduction. Also gains {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_RANGED_HP} Max Health, bonus Attack equal to 10/15/20% of its Attack on spawn, and 10/12.5/15% Lifesteal; these three increase by {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_CONV_BONUS%}% for every {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_CONV_PER} range converted. The ability isn't replaced."

msgid "将受到伤害的 5/9/15% 转化为龟能，每秒最多转化 20/40/60 龟能。被护盾抵挡的伤害与持续伤害同样计入。"
msgstr "Converts 5/9/15% of damage taken into Energy, up to 20/40/60 per second. Damage blocked by shields and damage over time also count."

msgid "登场后每 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_GEN_IV} 秒生成一个环绕携带者的浮游炮，最多 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_CAP} 个。\n浮游炮每 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_FIRE_IV} 秒攻击一次随机敌人，造成携带者 30/40/50% 攻击力的物理伤害。\n每个浮游炮为携带者提供 10/15/20 魔抗。\n所有浮游炮累计发射 40/30/20 次攻击后，全部散开至战场随机位置，并向随机目标齐射贯穿的终极射线，每条对直线上的敌人各造成（130/260/500 + {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_RAY_ATK_COEF%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害。"
msgstr "After spawning, creates a drone cannon orbiting the holder every {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_GEN_IV} seconds, up to {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_CAP}.\nEach drone attacks a random enemy every {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_FIRE_IV} seconds for 30/40/50% of the holder's Attack as physical damage.\nEach drone grants the holder 10/15/20 Magic Resist.\nAfter the drones have fired 40/30/20 attacks in total, they all scatter to random spots on the field and fire piercing ultimate rays at random targets together, each dealing (130/260/500 + {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_RAY_ATK_COEF%}% Attack) magic damage to every enemy on its line."

msgid "效果一：每 15/10/4 秒从训龟大师的主动技能中随机偷取一个并释放。每个战场内不会偷取重复的技能，全部偷取并释放过后不再偷取。\n效果二：压载舱容量为携带者最大生命值的 60/90/150%，受到的伤害先存入压载舱，压载舱满后才扣除生命值。\n每 {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_PUMP_IV} 秒将舱内 {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_PUMP_FRAC%}% 的储量抽出并转化为生命值，同时向最远的敌人喷出水柱，造成抽出量的魔法伤害。\n舱内每储存携带者最大生命值的 {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_STACK_FRAC%}%，携带者获得 {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_MOVE_PER%}% 移动速度与 {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_DEF_PER} 点护甲（最多 {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_STACK_CAP} 层）。"
msgstr "Effect 1: every 15/10/4 seconds, steals a random active ability from the Turtle Trainer and casts it. It won't steal the same ability twice in a battle, and stops once it has stolen and cast them all.\nEffect 2: has a ballast tank holding 60/90/150% of max health. Damage taken fills the tank first; health is only lost once the tank is full.\nEvery {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_PUMP_IV} seconds, pumps out {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_PUMP_FRAC%}% of the tank's contents as healing and sprays a water jet at the farthest enemy for that much magic damage.\nFor every {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_STACK_FRAC%}% of max health stored in the tank, gains {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_MOVE_PER%}% move speed and {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_DEF_PER} Armor (max {C:EqGadgetBatch.DIVE_STACK_CAP} stacks)."

msgid "【法力】充满时，在脚下立起一块潮汐碑，持续 {C:EqArcaneBatch.STELE_SEC} 秒。碑内敌人每秒受到 15/25/40 魔法伤害，碑内友军每秒获得 20/35/55 护盾，并获得 10/15/25% 攻击速度。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">护盾可叠加，攻击速度在离开范围后失效。潮汐碑存在期间不回复法力。</span>"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, raises a Tide Stele underfoot for {C:EqArcaneBatch.STELE_SEC} seconds. Enemies inside take 15/25/40 magic damage per second; allies inside gain a 20/35/55 shield per second and 10/15/25% attack speed.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Shields stack; the attack speed ends on leaving the area. Mana doesn't regenerate while the stele stands.</span>"

msgid "【法力】充满时，对最近的敌人贴上【符纸】，在 {C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_SEC} 秒内共造成 400/700/1000 魔法伤害，并每秒降低其 {C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_MR_PER_TICK} 点魔抗，本战场内不恢复。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">【符纸】可叠加。目标死亡时，符纸以剩余持续时间转移给最近的敌人。</span>"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, sticks a [Talisman] on the nearest enemy, dealing 400/700/1000 magic damage over {C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_SEC} seconds and removing {C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_MR_PER_TICK} Magic Resist per second, which doesn't return this battle.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">[Talisman] stacks. When the target dies, it moves to the nearest enemy with its remaining duration.</span>"

msgid "【法力】充满时，跃向空中后猛砸地面，对附近的敌人造成（150/300/4000 + 100% 攻击力）魔法伤害，并使其眩晕 2/3/8 秒、击飞 {C:EqArcaneBatch.PESTLE_KB_SEC} 秒。\n被动：每 {C:EqArcaneBatch.PESTLE_EVERY} 次攻击发射一道浪潮，在友军与敌军之间弹跳，至多 4/5/8 次，每个单位只命中一次。浪潮对敌人造成 40/70/140 魔法伤害，为友军回复 20/40/80 生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">猛砸造成伤害后才开始回复法力。</span>"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, leaps into the air and slams the ground, dealing (150/300/4000 + 100% Attack) magic damage to nearby enemies, stunning them for 2/3/8 seconds and knocking them up for {C:EqArcaneBatch.PESTLE_KB_SEC} seconds.\nPassive: every {C:EqArcaneBatch.PESTLE_EVERY} attacks, sends out a wave that bounces between allies and enemies up to 4/5/8 times, hitting each unit once. It deals 40/70/140 magic damage to enemies and heals allies for 20/40/80.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Mana starts regenerating only after the slam deals damage.</span>"

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中积累 20/20/25 点充能，同一时刻命中多名敌人时，第二名起只积累一半。\n充能达到 {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_FULL} 点时，朝敌群斩出一道 {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_ARC_DEG}° 的弧形刀光，对范围内的每名敌人造成 30/45/60 真实伤害与（50/70/90% 攻击力）物理伤害。\n只命中 1 名敌人时，伤害提高 100/150/200%。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit builds 20/20/25 charge; when hitting several enemies at once, the second onward build half.\nAt {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_FULL} charge, slashes a {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_ARC_DEG}° arc of light at the enemy group, dealing 30/45/60 true damage and (50/70/90% Attack) physical damage to each enemy in range.\nIf it hits only 1 enemy, damage is increased by 100/150/200%."

msgid "每 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_IV} 秒回复 1/2/3 点+携带者最大生命值 0.1/0.15/0.2% 的生命值。生命值低于 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_GATE%}% 时，该回复效果提升至 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_MULT} 倍。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_IV} seconds, heals 1/2/3 + 0.1/0.15/0.2% of max health. Below {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_GATE%}% health, this healing is multiplied by {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_MULT}."

msgid "召唤一只无法被选中的剧毒飞行物，携带者阵亡后飞行物随之阵亡。\n飞行物缓慢飞向随机目标，穿过目标并落至其另一侧后，再飞向下一个目标，如此往复。\n飞行物每 {C:VenomDroneSystem.BEAT} 秒在路径上留下一团持续 {C:VenomDroneSystem.FOG_LIFE} 秒的毒雾。毒雾每 {C:VenomDroneSystem.BEAT} 秒对接触的敌方单位施加 {C:VenomDroneSystem.POISON_STACKS} 层中毒与一层剧毒缓速。\n每个单位最多叠加 {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_CAP} 层剧毒缓速，每层降低目标 {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_MOVE_PER%}% 移动速度与 {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_MR_PER%}% 魔抗。若目标 {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_GRACE} 秒内未被施加剧毒缓速，则每 {C:VenomDroneSystem.BEAT} 秒失去一层。"
msgstr "Summons an untargetable venomous flyer that dies when the holder dies.\nThe flyer slowly flies at a random target, passes through it to land on the far side, then flies to the next target, over and over.\nEvery {C:VenomDroneSystem.BEAT} seconds, it leaves a poison fog on its path that lasts {C:VenomDroneSystem.FOG_LIFE} seconds. Every {C:VenomDroneSystem.BEAT} seconds, the fog applies {C:VenomDroneSystem.POISON_STACKS} Poison and 1 Venom Slow stack to enemy units touching it.\nEach unit can have up to {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_CAP} Venom Slow stacks, each reducing move speed by {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_MOVE_PER%}% and Magic Resist by {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_MR_PER%}%. If a target isn't hit by Venom Slow for {C:VenomDroneSystem.VSLOW_GRACE} seconds, it loses a stack every {C:VenomDroneSystem.BEAT} seconds."

msgid "主动：每 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_IV} 秒强化接下来的 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} 次攻击，这 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} 次攻击获得 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_ASPD%}% 攻击速度，并附带 30/50/80+目标最大生命值 1/1.5/2% 的物理伤害，回复相当于该附带伤害 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_LS%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Active: every {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_IV} seconds, empowers the next {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} attacks. Those {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} attacks gain {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_ASPD%}% attack speed and deal 30/50/80 + 1/1.5/2% of the target's max health as bonus physical damage, healing for {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_LS%}% of that bonus damage."

msgid "阵亡时在原地立起一座不可选中的墓碑，持续到本战场结束。\n墓碑为全体友军提供 12/22/35% 增伤与 18/32/50 双抗，并每 {C:EqRelicBatch.STELE_BOLT_IV} 秒向最近的敌人砸下一道石雷，造成 130/260/500 魔法伤害。"
msgstr "On death, raises an untargetable Tombstone in place that lasts until the battle ends.\nThe stele gives all allies 12/22/35% Damage Amp and 18/32/50 Armor and Magic Resist, and drops a stone bolt on the nearest enemy every {C:EqRelicBatch.STELE_BOLT_IV} seconds for 130/260/500 magic damage."

msgid "每 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} 秒为携带者提供 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} 点圣光护盾值。圣光护盾存在时，携带者每次被攻击或技能命中，对攻击者反击造成 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} 点真实伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} seconds, gains {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} Holy Shield. While the Holy Shield holds, each attack or ability hit taken strikes back at the attacker for {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} true damage."

msgid "每隔一个攻击间隔朝最近的敌人斩出一道 {C:EquipSystem.LASER_ARC_DEG}° 扇形激光，半径等于携带者攻击射程，3 星时翻倍。若携带者为近战单位，半径额外+{C:EquipSystem.LASER_MELEE_BONUS} 码。\n对扇形内每名敌人造成（15/32/100+55/100/300% 攻击力）物理伤害。\n若仅命中 1 名敌人，则朝该敌人追加一道直线斩击，对沿途每名敌人各造成一次全额伤害。\n携带者回复相当于本次总伤害 25/40/60% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Every attack interval, slashes a {C:EquipSystem.LASER_ARC_DEG}° fan of laser at the nearest enemy, with a radius equal to the holder's attack range (doubled at 3 stars). Melee holders get +{C:EquipSystem.LASER_MELEE_BONUS} radius.\nDeals (15/32/100 + 55/100/300% Attack) physical damage to each enemy in the fan.\nIf it hits only 1 enemy, adds a straight slash toward it that deals full damage once to each enemy in its path.\nThe holder heals for 25/40/60% of the total damage."

msgid "小龟对敌人造成的所有伤害按目标的稀有度提升：\n<span style=\"color:#06d6a0\">C</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_C%}%　<span style=\"color:#4cc9f0\">B</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_B%}%　<span style=\"color:#3a9abf\">A</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_A%}%　<span style=\"color:#c77dff\">S</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_S%}%　<span style=\"color:#ffd93d\">SS</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SS%}%　<span style=\"color:#ff6b6b\">SSS</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SSS%}%。\n每 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_CD} 秒，小龟的下一次攻击额外造成（{C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_LOST_PCT%}% 目标已损失生命值的物理伤害，将目标击飞 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_KNOCK_SEC} 秒，并获得相当于该伤害 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_GAIN_PCT%}% 的护盾。"
msgstr "Little Turtle deals more damage to enemies based on their rarity:\n<span style=\"color:#06d6a0\">C</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_C%}%　<span style=\"color:#4cc9f0\">B</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_B%}%　<span style=\"color:#3a9abf\">A</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_A%}%　<span style=\"color:#c77dff\">S</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_S%}%　<span style=\"color:#ffd93d\">SS</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SS%}%　<span style=\"color:#ff6b6b\">SSS</span> +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SSS%}%.\nEvery {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_CD} seconds, its next attack deals ({C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_LOST_PCT%}% of the target's missing health as bonus physical damage, knocks the target up for {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_KNOCK_SEC} seconds, and grants a shield equal to {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_GAIN_PCT%}% of that damage."

msgid "骰子龟根据已损失的生命值获得额外暴击率，自身损失 {C:DiceSystem.BLOOD_LOST_GATE%}% 生命值时达到最大值 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DICE_BLOOD_CRIT%}% 暴击率。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">当前暴击率：{crit*100}%</span>"
msgstr "Dice Turtle gains bonus Crit Chance based on missing health, up to {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DICE_BLOOD_CRIT%}% at {C:DiceSystem.BLOOD_LOST_GATE%}% health lost.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Current Crit Chance: {crit*100}%</span>"

msgid "彩虹龟的棱镜每 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_COLOR_SEC} 秒随机切换为红、蓝、绿中的一种颜色，彩虹龟的攻击会附带当前颜色的效果：\n红色：额外造成（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE*ATK}）真实伤害。\n蓝色：获得（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD*ATK}）护盾，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} 秒。\n绿色：回复自身 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_GREEN_HEAL%}% 已损失生命值。\n\n彩虹龟获得（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_ATK_FROM_HP%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*RainbowSystem.PRISM_ATK_FROM_HP}）攻击力和（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_ASPD_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*RainbowSystem.PRISM_ASPD_PER_ATK*100}%）攻击速度。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle's prism switches to red, blue or green at random every {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_COLOR_SEC} seconds, and its attacks carry that color's effect:\nRed: deals ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE*ATK}) bonus true damage.\nBlue: gains a ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD*ATK}) shield for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} seconds.\nGreen: heals {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_GREEN_HEAL%}% of its missing health.\n\nRainbow Turtle gains ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_ATK_FROM_HP%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*RainbowSystem.PRISM_ATK_FROM_HP}) attack damage and ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_ASPD_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*RainbowSystem.PRISM_ASPD_PER_ATK*100}%) attack speed."

msgid "赌神龟每次攻击后有 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% 概率很快再攻击一次。连续触发时，每次触发概率乘以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_DECAY%}%（{C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN2%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN3%}%，以此类推），未触发时重置。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">多重打击追加的攻击以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% 效果触发攻击时与命中时的装备效果（【剑士】除外）。\n若选择【命运之轮】，基础概率变为 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%。若选择【赌注】，释放后 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} 秒内概率额外提升 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%。</span>"
msgstr "After each attack, Gambler Turtle has a {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% chance to quickly attack again. On consecutive triggers, the chance is multiplied by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_DECAY%}% each time ({C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN2%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN3%}%, and so on), resetting when it fails.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Extra Multi-Strike attacks trigger on-attack and on-hit item effects at {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% effect ([Swordsman] excluded).\nWith [Wheel of Fate], the base chance becomes {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%. With [Wager], the chance is increased by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}% for {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} seconds after casting.</span>"

msgid "场上有敌人生命值低于 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% 时，猎人龟自动射出一支强化箭，命中时将其处决。\n猎人龟处决或击杀敌人时，窃取该敌人 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_STEAL%}% 基础属性并获得 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取，持续到本战场结束。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">目标被猎杀印记标记时，处决线提升至 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%。若箭矢飞行途中目标被治疗至处决线以上，则不处决。</span>"
msgstr "When any enemy drops below {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% health, Hunter Turtle automatically fires an empowered arrow that executes it on hit.\nWhen Hunter Turtle executes or kills an enemy, it steals {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_STEAL%}% of that enemy's base stats and gains {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal until the battle ends.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Against targets with a Hunt Mark, the execute threshold rises to {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%. If the target is healed above the threshold while the arrow is in flight, it isn't executed.</span>"

msgid "每 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_IV} 秒，泡泡龟消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_DMG_PCT%}% 泡泡值对最近的敌人造成等量魔法伤害，并消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_HEAL_PCT%}% 泡泡值回复等量生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_IV} seconds, Bubble Turtle spends {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_DMG_PCT%}% of its Bubbles to deal that much magic damage to the nearest enemy, and spends {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_HEAL_PCT%}% to heal for that much."

msgid "闪电龟每 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_IV} 秒自动电击一名随机敌人，造成（{C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF}）真实伤害。\n敌人身上的电击达到 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成（{C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF}）真实伤害并重置层数。"
msgstr "Every {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_IV} seconds, Lightning Turtle automatically shocks a random enemy for ({C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF}) true damage.\nWhen an enemy reaches {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} Shock stacks, they detonate for ({C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF}) true damage and reset."

msgid "凤凰龟首次阵亡时以（{C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT}）生命值复活，并对全体敌人施加（{C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧与 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">复活过程持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_SHOW_SEC} 秒，期间凤凰龟无法行动、不可选中且不受伤害。</span>"
msgstr "The first time Phoenix Turtle dies, it revives with ({C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT}) health and applies ({C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds to all enemies for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Reviving takes {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_SHOW_SEC} seconds, during which Phoenix Turtle can't act, is untargetable and takes no damage.</span>"

msgid "凤凰龟首次死亡时浴火重生，以（{C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT}）生命值复活，并对全体敌人施加（{C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧，以及持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒的 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减。"
msgstr "The first time Phoenix Turtle dies, it rises from the flames with ({C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT}) health, applying ({C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds to all enemies."

msgid "石头龟每 {C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_IV} 秒获得（{C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT%}%×开局护甲({DEF}) = {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT}）额外护甲，最多获得（{C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT%}%×开局护甲({DEF}) = {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT}）额外护甲。\n石头龟获得（{C:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE%}% + {C:StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF%}%×护甲({DEF}) + {C:StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR%}%×魔抗({MR}) = {E:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE*100+DEF*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF*100+MR*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR*100}%）反伤。"
msgstr "Every {C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_IV} seconds, Stone Turtle gains ({C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT%}% × starting Armor ({DEF}) = {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT}) bonus Armor, up to ({C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT%}% × starting Armor ({DEF}) = {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT}).\nStone Turtle gains ({C:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE%}% + {C:StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF%}% × Armor ({DEF}) + {C:StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR%}% × Magic Resist ({MR}) = {E:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE*100+DEF*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF*100+MR*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR*100}%) Thorns."

msgid "熔岩龟将造成伤害的 {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% 与承受伤害的 {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% 转化为怒气。\n怒气满 {rageMax} 时变身为火山龟，持续 {transformDuration} 秒，变身期间获得：\n最大生命值 +（{transformHpScale*100}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformHpScale}），攻击力 +（{transformAtkScale*100}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformAtkScale}），护甲 +（{transformDefScale*100}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformDefScale}），魔抗 +（{transformMrScale*100}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformMrScale}）。\n火山龟为近战，射程 {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE}，移动速度变为基础移动速度的 {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_SPD_MULT} 倍，技能替换为火山技能。\n变身时熔岩龟跃向敌人最密集处并砸地，将范围内的敌人击飞 {C:LavaSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} 秒，造成（{C:LavaSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害并施加（{C:LavaSystem.SLAM_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.SLAM_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧。每命中一名敌人，熔岩龟回复该敌人已损失生命值的 {C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}%。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">被控制时不会变身，控制结束后立即变身。</span>"
msgstr "Lava Turtle converts {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% of damage dealt and {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% of damage taken into Rage.\nAt {rageMax} Rage, it transforms into Volcano Turtle for {transformDuration} seconds, gaining:\nMax Health + ({transformHpScale*100}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformHpScale}), Attack + ({transformAtkScale*100}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformAtkScale}), Armor + ({transformDefScale*100}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformDefScale}), Magic Resist + ({transformMrScale*100}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*transformMrScale}).\nVolcano Turtle is melee with {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} range, moves at {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_SPD_MULT}× its base move speed, and its abilities are replaced with Volcano abilities.\nOn transforming, it leaps to the densest group of enemies and slams the ground, knocking up enemies in the area for {C:LavaSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} seconds, dealing ({C:LavaSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage and applying ({C:LavaSystem.SLAM_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.SLAM_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn. For each enemy hit, it heals {C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}% of that enemy's missing health.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">It won't transform while crowd-controlled; it transforms as soon as the control ends.</span>"

msgid "火山形态下攻击变为烈焰重击，即单段近战重锤：造成（{C:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC*ATK}）+ {C:LavaSystem.MELEE_SELF_HP%}%熔岩龟自身最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧。\n变身后转为近战形态，射程 {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} 码，移动速度为基础的 {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_SPD_MULT} 倍。"
msgstr "In Volcano Form, attacks become Blazing Strikes, a single melee hammer blow: deals ({C:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC*ATK}) + {C:LavaSystem.MELEE_SELF_HP%}% of Lava Turtle's own max health as magic damage and applies ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn.\nAfter transforming it becomes melee with {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} range and {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_SPD_MULT}× base move speed."

msgid "火山龟召来一道熔岩浪，从敌人那一侧横扫过整个场地。熔岩浪每扫过一名敌人，便将其击飞，造成（{C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害并施加（{C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧，火山龟回复（{C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT*HP}）生命值。"
msgstr "Volcano Turtle calls a lava wave that sweeps across the whole field from the enemy side. Each enemy it passes is knocked up, takes ({C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage and gets ({C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn, and Volcano Turtle heals ({C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT*HP})."

msgid "火山龟蓄力 {C:LavaSystem.CAST_WINDUP} 秒后猛砸目标，将其击飞 {C:LavaSystem.SURGE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒，造成（{C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {N:HP*LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT}）物理伤害，并附带 {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">蓄力期间被控制则技能取消。</span>"
msgstr "Volcano Turtle charges for {C:LavaSystem.CAST_WINDUP} seconds, then slams the target, knocking it up for {C:LavaSystem.SURGE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds and dealing ({C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {N:HP*LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT}) physical damage with {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crowd control during the charge cancels the ability.</span>"

msgid "赛博龟每 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SPAWN_SEC} 秒生成 1 个浮游炮，至多 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_CAP} 个，当前 {E:droneCount} 个。浮游炮环绕赛博龟飞行，不可被选中。\n每个浮游炮每 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_FIRE_SEC} 秒攻击一名随机敌人，造成（{C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。赛博龟被控制时浮游炮停火。\n赛博龟阵亡时，每个浮游炮朝最近的敌人发射一道贯穿激光，造成（{C:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n随后浮游炮组装为一台近战机甲，组装持续 {C:CyberSystem.MECH_ASSEMBLE_SEC} 秒，期间机甲属性逐渐提升至最终数值，无法行动、不可选中且不受伤害。\n机甲生命值 =（{C:CyberSystem.MECH_HP_BASE} + {C:CyberSystem.MECH_HP_PER_LV}×等级）×浮游炮数，攻击力 =（{C:CyberSystem.MECH_ATK_BASE} + {C:CyberSystem.MECH_ATK_PER_LV}×等级）×浮游炮数，护甲与魔抗 = {C:CyberSystem.MECH_DEF_BASE} + {C:CyberSystem.MECH_DEF_PER_LV}×等级。\n机甲每 {C:CyberSystem.MECH_BLAST_CD} 秒对生命值最低的敌人造成（{C:CyberSystem.MECH_BLAST_COEF%}%×机甲攻击力）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle creates 1 drone every {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SPAWN_SEC} seconds, up to {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_CAP} (currently {E:droneCount}). Drones orbit Cyber Turtle and are untargetable.\nEach drone attacks a random enemy every {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_FIRE_SEC} seconds for ({C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF*ATK}) physical damage. Drones stop firing while Cyber Turtle is crowd-controlled.\nWhen Cyber Turtle dies, each drone fires a piercing laser at the nearest enemy, dealing ({C:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF*ATK}) magic damage.\nThen the drones assemble into a melee mech over {C:CyberSystem.MECH_ASSEMBLE_SEC} seconds. During assembly, its stats rise to their final values, and it can't act, is untargetable and takes no damage.\nMech health = ({C:CyberSystem.MECH_HP_BASE} + {C:CyberSystem.MECH_HP_PER_LV} × level) × drones; Attack = ({C:CyberSystem.MECH_ATK_BASE} + {C:CyberSystem.MECH_ATK_PER_LV} × level) × drones; Armor and Magic Resist = {C:CyberSystem.MECH_DEF_BASE} + {C:CyberSystem.MECH_DEF_PER_LV} × level.\nEvery {C:CyberSystem.MECH_BLAST_CD} seconds, the mech deals ({C:CyberSystem.MECH_BLAST_COEF%}% × mech Attack) physical damage to the lowest-health enemy."

msgid "水晶龟受到的魔法伤害降低 {C:CrystalSystem.MAGIC_DR%}%。\n水晶龟的攻击为目标叠加结晶印记，满 {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成目标 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并使其魔抗降低 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">所有来源叠加的结晶印记共用层数。</span>"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle takes {C:CrystalSystem.MAGIC_DR%}% less magic damage.\nIts attacks apply Crystal Marks to targets. At {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} stacks, they detonate for magic damage equal to {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health and reduce its Magic Resist by {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crystal Marks from all sources share the same stacks.</span>"

msgid "宝箱龟造成的伤害转化为财宝值，并随一大轮持续累积。\n财宝值达到 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene._CHEST_THRESH} 时开箱：\n第 1-2 箱开出基础池装备，第 3-4 箱开出进阶池装备，第 {C:ChestSystem.CHEST_MAX_OPEN} 箱开出传说池装备。战利品共 {C:ChestSystem.TREASURE_TOTAL} 件，均为专属且不会重复，开箱时额外回复自身最大生命值的 {C:ChestSystem.CHEST_HEAL_PCT%}%。\n开出的战利品为一大轮常驻装备，在本轮的每局对局中自动生效，新的大轮开始时重置。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle turns damage dealt into Treasure, which keeps building over the Season.\nAt {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene._CHEST_THRESH} Treasure, it opens a chest:\nChests 1–2 give basic-pool items, chests 3–4 advanced-pool items, and chest {C:ChestSystem.CHEST_MAX_OPEN} a legendary-pool item. There are {C:ChestSystem.TREASURE_TOTAL} loot items in total, all exclusive with no repeats. Opening a chest also heals {C:ChestSystem.CHEST_HEAL_PCT%}% of max health.\nLoot stays for the whole Season, taking effect automatically in every match, and resets when a new Season starts."

msgid "星际龟将攻击与技能造成伤害的 {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_GAIN%}% 转化为星能，星能上限为（{C:StarSystem.ENERGY_CAP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*StarSystem.ENERGY_CAP_PCT}）。\n星际龟每次攻击或释放技能后，对目标额外造成相当于星能 {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_TRUE_PCT%}% 的真实伤害。\n若携带【星波】或【扭曲空间】，星能充满时释放强化版本并消耗全部星能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">持续伤害不产生星能。</span>"
msgstr "Space Turtle converts {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_GAIN%}% of attack and ability damage into Star Power, capped at ({C:StarSystem.ENERGY_CAP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*StarSystem.ENERGY_CAP_PCT}).\nAfter each attack or ability, it deals bonus true damage to the target equal to {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_TRUE_PCT%}% of its Star Power.\nWith [Star Wave] or [Warp Space], full Star Power casts the empowered version and spends it all.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Damage over time doesn't generate Star Power.</span>"

msgid "缩头乌龟登场时，从全部 A / B / C 稀有度的龟中随机召唤一只作为随从。随从拥有原龟 {C:HidingSystem.MINION_HP_SCALE%}% 的最大生命值与 {C:HidingSystem.MINION_ATK_SCALE%}% 的攻击力，带着原龟的被动与一个技能自主作战。\n随从的护甲、魔抗与暴击率与原龟相同，属性随等级成长。缩头乌龟阵亡时随从一同阵亡。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">若携带【强化随从】，随从先于缩头乌龟阵亡时，缩头乌龟永久获得该技能的增益。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, Hiding Turtle summons a random A / B / C rarity turtle as a follower. The follower has {C:HidingSystem.MINION_HP_SCALE%}% of the original's max health and {C:HidingSystem.MINION_ATK_SCALE%}% of its attack damage, and fights on its own with the original's passive and one ability.\nThe follower's Armor, Magic Resist and Crit Chance match the original, and its stats grow with level. The follower dies when Hiding Turtle dies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With [Empower Followers], if the follower dies before Hiding Turtle, Hiding Turtle permanently gains that ability's bonus.</span>"

msgid "龟壳蕴含远古气场之力：开战 {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_1} 秒与 {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_2} 秒各自动触发一次气场觉醒。\n每次觉醒提升：\n攻击力 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，护甲 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，魔抗 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，最大生命值 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，生命偷取 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，反伤 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，暴击率 +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_CRIT%}%。\n此外，龟壳循环进行储能：在<b>储能相位 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_STORE_SEC} 秒</b>内，将受到的伤害全额转化为储能值（上限为最大生命值的 {C:ShellSystem.STORE_CAP_PCT%}%）。\n相位结束时消耗全部储能，发出一道缓慢向外扩散的冲击波，对触碰到的敌人各造成储能×{C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_DMG_PCT%}% 的物理伤害，每名敌人只受到一次伤害，\n并获得储能×{C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_SHIELD_PCT%}% 的气场护盾，护盾在 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_SHIELD_SEC} 秒内线性衰减。\n随后进入 <b>{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_CD_SEC} 秒冷却相位</b>，期间不储能，之后回到储能相位。"
msgstr "Turtle Shell holds the power of an ancient aura: it automatically awakens the aura at {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_1} and {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_2} seconds into battle.\nEach awakening grants:\nAttack +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%, Armor +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%, Magic Resist +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%, Max Health +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%, Lifesteal +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%, Thorns +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%, Crit Chance +{C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_CRIT%}%.\nTurtle Shell also cycles through storing energy: during the <b>{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_STORE_SEC}-second Store phase</b>, all damage taken becomes Stored Energy (up to {C:ShellSystem.STORE_CAP_PCT%}% of max health).\nWhen the phase ends, it spends it all to release a slowly expanding shockwave that deals Stored Energy × {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_DMG_PCT%}% physical damage to each enemy it touches (once per enemy),\nand gains an aura shield of Stored Energy × {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_SHIELD_PCT%}% that decays over {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nThen it enters a <b>{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_CD_SEC}-second Cooldown phase</b> without storing, before returning to the Store phase."

msgid "龟壳受到伤害时将伤害转化为储能，储能 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_STORE_SEC} 秒后发出一道缓慢移动的冲击波，对触碰到的敌人造成相当于储能 {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_DMG_PCT%}% 的物理伤害，\n同时获得相当于储能 {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_SHIELD_PCT%}% 的护盾，随后进入 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_CD_SEC} 秒冷却，之后重新开始储能。"
msgstr "Turtle Shell turns damage taken into Stored Energy. After storing for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_STORE_SEC} seconds, it releases a slow-moving shockwave that deals physical damage equal to {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_DMG_PCT%}% of Stored Energy to enemies it touches,\nand gains a shield equal to {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_SHIELD_PCT%}% of Stored Energy, then cools down for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_CD_SEC} seconds before storing again."

msgid "竹叶龟每 {C:BambooSystem.GROW_CD} 秒蓄力一次，下次攻击额外造成（{C:BambooSystem.GROW_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) + {C:BambooSystem.GROW_HP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {M:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_ATK_COEF+HP*BambooSystem.GROW_HP_PCT}）魔法伤害，回复（{C:BambooSystem.GROW_HEAL_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:BambooSystem.GROW_HEAL_PCT*HP}）生命值，并永久提升（{C:BambooSystem.GROW_MAXHP_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_MAXHP_PER_ATK}）最大生命值。\n若携带【竹击】，强化效果提升为：造成（{C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) + {C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {M:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_ATK_COEF+HP*BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HP_PCT}）魔法伤害，回复（{C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HEAL_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HEAL_PCT*HP}）生命值，并永久提升（{C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_MAXHP_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_MAXHP_PER_ATK}）最大生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">蓄力完成后放出这次攻击，才开始计算下一次蓄力。\n永久提升的最大生命值会带进终极战场，并在本大轮内跨场累积，进入新大轮时重置。</span>"
msgstr "Every {C:BambooSystem.GROW_CD} seconds, Bamboo Turtle charges up. Its next attack deals ({C:BambooSystem.GROW_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) + {C:BambooSystem.GROW_HP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {M:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_ATK_COEF+HP*BambooSystem.GROW_HP_PCT}) bonus magic damage, heals ({C:BambooSystem.GROW_HEAL_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:BambooSystem.GROW_HEAL_PCT*HP}), and permanently grants ({C:BambooSystem.GROW_MAXHP_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_MAXHP_PER_ATK}) Max Health.\nWith [Bamboo Strike], the empowered attack instead deals ({C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) + {C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {M:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_ATK_COEF+HP*BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HP_PCT}) magic damage, heals ({C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HEAL_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_HEAL_PCT*HP}), and permanently grants ({C:BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_MAXHP_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_SMACK_MAXHP_PER_ATK}) Max Health.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The next charge only starts after the charged attack is released.\nPermanent Max Health carries into the Final Battle and keeps building across matches this Season, resetting in a new Season.</span>"

msgid "天使龟每段攻击命中敌人时，额外造成 {C:AngelSystem.JUDGE_CURHP%}% 目标当前生命值的魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">选择【平等】时，其每段伤害也会触发此效果。\n该伤害不会暴击，也不叠加命中层数，但会触发目标的反伤与自身的生命偷取。</span>"
msgstr "Each of Angel Turtle's attack hits deals bonus magic damage equal to {C:AngelSystem.JUDGE_CURHP%}% of the target's current health.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With [Equality], each of its hits also triggers this.\nThis damage can't crit and doesn't build on-hit stacks, but it triggers the target's Thorns and the holder's Lifesteal.</span>"

msgid "忍者龟获得 {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT%}% 暴击率、{C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT_DMG%}% 暴击伤害和 {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_ARMOR_PEN} 护甲穿透。\n附近有敌人时，忍者龟自动冲刺斩击最近的敌人，对其造成（{C:NinjaSystem.DASH_MAIN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_MAIN_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，对路径上的其他敌人造成（{C:NinjaSystem.DASH_SIDE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_SIDE_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并将命中的敌人击飞 {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">同一敌人 {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_TARGET_CD} 秒内只会被冲刺一次。</span>"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle gains {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT%}% Crit Chance, {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT_DMG%}% Crit Damage and {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_ARMOR_PEN} Armor Pen.\nWith enemies nearby, Ninja Turtle automatically dashes through the nearest one, dealing ({C:NinjaSystem.DASH_MAIN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_MAIN_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to it and ({C:NinjaSystem.DASH_SIDE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_SIDE_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to other enemies in the path, knocking those hit up for {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The same enemy can be dashed at most once every {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_TARGET_CD} seconds.</span>"

msgid "变脸龟有远程和近战两种形态，远程形态射程 {C:TwoHeadSystem.RANGED_RANGE}，近战形态射程 {C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_RANGE}。释放技能时自动切换形态，再施放该形态的技能。\n切换为近战形态时获得（{C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_HP_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_HP_COEF}）最大生命值、（{C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_DEF_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_DEF_COEF}）护甲、（{C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_MR_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_MR_COEF}）魔抗和（{C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_SHIELD_COEF}）护盾，攻击力降低（{C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY}）。\n切换为远程形态后的下一次攻击额外造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_RANGED_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_RANGED_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并使目标护甲降低 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_ARMOR_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SEC} 秒。\n切换为近战形态后的下一次攻击额外造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_MELEE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_MELEE_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害，并获得（{C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾，持续 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">切换为远程形态时会向后撤离目标。切换为近战形态时最大生命值与当前生命值同时增加，切回远程形态时只降低最大生命值。</span>"
msgstr "Two-Face Turtle has a ranged form ({C:TwoHeadSystem.RANGED_RANGE} range) and a melee form ({C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_RANGE} range). Casting an ability automatically switches forms, then casts that form's ability.\nSwitching to melee form grants ({C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_HP_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_HP_COEF}) Max Health, ({C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_DEF_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_DEF_COEF}) Armor, ({C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_MR_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_MR_COEF}) Magic Resist and a ({C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_SHIELD_COEF}) shield, and reduces attack damage by ({C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY}).\nAfter switching to ranged form, the next attack deals ({C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_RANGED_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_RANGED_COEF*ATK}) bonus physical damage and reduces the target's Armor by {C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_ARMOR_DOWN%}% for {C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SEC} seconds.\nAfter switching to melee form, the next attack deals ({C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_MELEE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_MELEE_COEF*ATK}) bonus magic damage and grants a ({C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield for {C:TwoHeadSystem.ENH_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Switching to ranged form backs away from the target. Switching to melee raises both max and current health; switching back to ranged only lowers max health.</span>"

msgid "变脸龟拥有远程和近战两种形态与技能组。\n切换远程时：最大生命值减少（250%×攻击力 = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_HP_COEF}），护甲减少（25%×攻击力 = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_DEF_COEF}），魔抗减少（25%×攻击力 = {M:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_MR_COEF}），攻击力提升（30%×攻击力 = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY}）。"
msgstr "Two-Face Turtle has ranged and melee forms, each with its own abilities.\nSwitching to ranged: Max Health − (250% × Attack = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_HP_COEF}), Armor − (25% × Attack = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_DEF_COEF}), Magic Resist − (25% × Attack = {M:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_MR_COEF}), Attack + (30% × Attack = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY})."

msgid "小龟攻击当前目标，造成（{C:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Little Turtle attacks the current target, dealing ({C:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

msgid "小龟在 {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_ROOT_SEC} 秒内连续发射 {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_WAVES} 道气波，每道朝随机一名敌人飞出，对命中的第一个敌人造成（{C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。施法期间小龟无法移动和攻击。"
msgstr "Little Turtle fires {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_WAVES} waves over {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_ROOT_SEC} seconds, each flying at a random enemy and dealing ({C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to the first enemy hit. It can't move or attack while casting."

msgid "小龟打出一道贯穿气波，对沿途所有敌人造成（{C:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并将其击飞 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n施法期间小龟获得 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_CRIT%}% 暴击率、{C:BasicConsts.CHI_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取和（{C:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF*ATK}）护甲穿透，持续 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Little Turtle fires a piercing wave that deals ({C:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to all enemies in its path and knocks them up for {C:BasicConsts.CHI_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\nWhile casting, it gains {C:BasicConsts.CHI_CRIT%}% Crit Chance, {C:BasicConsts.CHI_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal and ({C:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF*ATK}) Armor Pen for {C:BasicConsts.CHI_BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "小龟冲上前抱起目标摔至身后，眩晕 {C:BasicConsts.SLAM_STUN_SEC} 秒，对其造成（{C:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK*ATK}）外加（{C:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK*100}%）目标最大生命值的物理伤害，并对落点周围其他敌人造成（{C:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK*ATK}）外加（{C:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK*100}%）主目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋以及免疫控制或击飞的目标不会被抱起，只在原地受到伤害。龟蛋免疫此控制。</span>"
msgstr "Little Turtle charges in, grabs the target and slams it down behind, stunning it for {C:BasicConsts.SLAM_STUN_SEC} seconds and dealing ({C:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK*ATK}) + ({C:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK*100}%) of its max health as physical damage. Other enemies near the landing spot take ({C:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK*ATK}) + ({C:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK*100}%) of the main target's max health as physical damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs and targets immune to crowd control or knock-ups aren't lifted; they just take the damage in place. Turtle Eggs are immune to this control.</span>"

msgid "骰子龟攻击目标，造成（{C:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力 + {C:DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT}×暴击率 = {N:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK+crit*DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack + {C:DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT} × Crit Chance = {N:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK+crit*DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT}) physical damage."

msgid "骰子龟朝最近的敌人劈砍，对前方 {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_ARC_DEG}° 扇形内的敌人造成（{C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG*ATK}）物理伤害，并附带 {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle slashes at the nearest enemy, dealing ({C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG*ATK}) physical damage to enemies in a {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_ARC_DEG}° cone in front, with {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "骰子龟掷出命运骰子，获得随机 {C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MIN%}%~{C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MAX%}% 暴击率提升，持续到下次释放本技能。再次释放时会先撤销原有增益，再重新掷骰。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">暴击率超过 100% 的部分，每 1% 转化为 {C:DamageMath.CRIT_OVERFLOW}% 暴击伤害。\n</span>\n释放后的首次攻击额外附带 {C:DiceSystem.FATE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle rolls the Dice of Fate, gaining a random {C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MIN%}%–{C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MAX%}% Crit Chance until it casts this again. Recasting first removes the old bonus, then rolls again.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Each 1% Crit Chance above 100% converts into {C:DamageMath.CRIT_OVERFLOW}% Crit Damage.\n</span>\nThe first attack after casting has {C:DiceSystem.FATE_LIFESTEAL%}% bonus Lifesteal."

msgid "被动：骰子龟登场时将全部护甲与魔抗转化为等量护甲穿透，自身护甲与魔抗降为 0。\n\n主动：骰子龟对随机敌人突刺 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MIN}~{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MAX} 次，首段造成（{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，此后每段伤害为上一段的 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_KEEP%}%。\n每穿刺一次获得（{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT*ATK}）护盾，持续 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Dice Turtle converts all its Armor and Magic Resist into the same amount of Armor Pen, and its Armor and Magic Resist become 0.\n\nActive: Dice Turtle dashes through random enemies {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MIN}–{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MAX} times. The first hit deals ({C:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF*ATK}) physical damage; each later hit deals {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_KEEP%}% of the previous one.\nEach pierce grants a ({C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT*ATK}) shield for {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "彩虹龟射出七彩光束，单段造成（{C:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并根据当前棱镜颜色附加效果。\n红光额外造成（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE%}%×攻击力 = {T:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE*ATK}）真实伤害。\n蓝光使自身获得（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD*ATK}）护盾。\n绿光回复自身 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_GREEN_HEAL%}% 已损失生命值。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle fires a rainbow beam that deals ({C:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF*ATK}) physical damage and applies an effect based on the current prism color.\nRed light deals ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE%}% × Attack = {T:RainbowSystem.PRISM_RED_TRUE*ATK}) bonus true damage.\nBlue light grants a ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SHIELD*ATK}) shield.\nGreen light heals {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_GREEN_HEAL%}% of its missing health."

msgid "彩虹龟用棱镜之光为包括自身在内的全体友军施加（{C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE*ATK}）护盾，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle grants all allies, including itself, a ({C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE*ATK}) shield of prism light for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "彩虹龟在自身周围掀起七彩风暴，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SEC} 秒。风暴每 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} 秒对范围内的敌人造成（{C:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害与（{C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF*ATK}）真实伤害，并使其护甲与魔抗各降低 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SHRED%}%，同时为范围内的友军回复（{C:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL*ATK}）生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">风暴不会因彩虹龟被控制而中断。风暴期间彩虹龟的龟能不再充能。</span>"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle whips up a rainbow storm around itself for {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SEC} seconds. Every {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} seconds, it deals ({C:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF*ATK}) magic damage and ({C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF*ATK}) true damage to enemies inside, reduces their Armor and Magic Resist by {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SHRED%}%, and heals allies inside for ({C:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL*ATK}).\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The storm isn't interrupted if Rainbow Turtle is crowd-controlled. Its Energy doesn't charge during the storm.</span>"

msgid "被动：彩虹龟每 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_PROC_SEC} 秒随机触发以下一种效果：\n橙色：全体友军获得 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n黄色：对一名随机敌人施加 {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n青色：使一名随机敌人的攻击速度降低 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_CHILL_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n紫色：对一名随机敌人施加诅咒，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒，每秒造成目标 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。\n\n主动：彩虹龟射出一道彩虹光，从自身开始在友军与敌人之间交替弹射 {C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_BOUNCES} 次，命中友军时回复（{C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK}）生命值，命中敌人时造成（{C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">弹射途中彩虹龟被控制则剩余弹射取消。</span>"
msgstr "Passive: every {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_PROC_SEC} seconds, Rainbow Turtle triggers one of these at random:\nOrange: all allies gain {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nYellow: applies {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn to a random enemy.\nCyan: reduces a random enemy's attack speed by {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_CHILL_DOWN%}% for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nPurple: curses a random enemy for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds, dealing true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health each second.\n\nActive: Rainbow Turtle fires a rainbow ray that bounces {C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_BOUNCES} times, alternating between allies and enemies starting from itself. Allies hit heal for ({C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK}); enemies hit take ({C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK}) magic damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">If Rainbow Turtle is crowd-controlled mid-bounce, the remaining bounces are canceled.</span>"

msgid "赌神龟甩出一张扑克牌，造成（{C:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle flicks a playing card, dealing ({C:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

msgid "赌神龟丢出一张万能牌，造成（{C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG*ATK}）物理伤害，并使目标攻击力降低 {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_ATK_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n赌神龟获得（{C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD*ATK}）护盾，直到被打破，并回复自身 {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_HEAL%}% 最大生命值的生命值。"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle throws a Wild Card, dealing ({C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG*ATK}) physical damage and reducing the target's attack damage by {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_ATK_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nGambler Turtle gains a ({C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD*ATK}) shield until broken and heals {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_HEAL%}% of its max health."

msgid "赌神龟消耗自身 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% 当前生命值，化作 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_SEGMENTS} 张牌打向目标，共造成约等于所消耗生命值的物理伤害（受护甲减免）。\n每张牌命中时也会判定多重打击，每次触发回复（{C:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL*ATK}）生命值并追加一张牌，造成（{C:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。\n每张牌都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时的装备效果，其中多重打击追加的牌以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% 效果触发。\n释放后 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} 秒内多重打击概率提升 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">当前生命值低于 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% 最大生命值时，不消耗生命值也不出牌，转而回复自身 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_LOWHP_HEAL%}% 最大生命值的生命值，同样获得概率提升。</span>"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle spends {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% of its current health and turns it into {C:GamblerSystem.BET_SEGMENTS} cards thrown at the target, dealing physical damage roughly equal to the health spent (reduced by armor).\nEach card hit can also trigger Multi-Strike; each trigger heals ({C:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL*ATK}) and adds a card dealing ({C:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage.\nEach card counts as an attack and triggers on-attack item effects; extra Multi-Strike cards trigger them at {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% effect.\nFor {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} seconds after casting, Multi-Strike chance is increased by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Below {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% max health, it spends no health and throws no cards; instead it heals {C:GamblerSystem.BET_LOWHP_HEAL%}% of its max health and still gets the chance bonus.</span>"

msgid "被动：赌神龟登场时损失自身 {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HP_COST%}% 最大生命值，基础多重打击概率由 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% 提升至 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%。\n\n主动：赌神龟随机抽取一个花色，永久提升对应属性：\n♠ 黑桃：攻击力 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_ATK}，最大生命值 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_HP}\n♥ 红心：护甲 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}，魔抗 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}\n♦ 方块：暴击率 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_CRIT%}%，护甲穿透 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_PEN}\n♣ 梅花：生命偷取 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_LIFESTEAL%}%，攻击速度 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_ASPD%}%\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">抽取期间 {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_LOCK_SEC} 秒龟能停止充能。抽到的花色在本大轮内跨场累积，进入新大轮时重置。</span>"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Gambler Turtle loses {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HP_COST%}% of its max health, and its base Multi-Strike chance rises from {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% to {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%.\n\nActive: Gambler Turtle draws a random suit and permanently gains its stats:\n♠ Spades: Attack +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_ATK}, Max Health +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_HP}\n♥ Hearts: Armor +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}, Magic Resist +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}\n♦ Diamonds: Crit Chance +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_CRIT%}%, Armor Pen +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_PEN}\n♣ Clubs: Lifesteal +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_LIFESTEAL%}%, Attack Speed +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_ASPD%}%\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Energy stops charging for {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_LOCK_SEC} seconds while drawing. Suits drawn build up across matches this Season and reset in a new Season.</span>"

msgid "猎人龟射出一箭，造成（{C:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。\n当前目标生命值低于 {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HP_GATE%}% 时，猎人龟获得 {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle shoots an arrow, dealing ({C:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage.\nWhile its current target is below {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HP_GATE%}% health, Hunter Turtle gains {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HASTE%}% attack speed."

msgid "猎人龟瞄准目标射击，造成（{C:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并施加 {E:HunterSystem.SHOT_POISON_COEF*ATK} 层中毒、持续 {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒的 {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减与猎杀印记。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">猎杀印记持续 {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} 秒，期间被动的处决线提升至 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%。</span>"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle takes aim and shoots, dealing ({C:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage and applying {E:HunterSystem.SHOT_POISON_COEF*ATK} Poison, {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds, and a Hunt Mark.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Hunt Mark lasts {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} seconds, raising the passive's execute threshold to {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%.</span>"

msgid "猎人龟翻滚：被近战敌人贴近时斜着拉开距离，残血时撤到队友身后，目标残血时朝它翻滚，否则翻滚到与目标保持射程的位置。\n下次攻击命中时额外造成（{C:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并获得 {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE%}% 闪避，持续 {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE_SEC} 秒，同时获得（{C:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle rolls: diagonally away when a melee enemy closes in, behind allies when low on health, toward the target when the target is low, and otherwise to a spot at range from the target.\nIts next attack hit deals ({C:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF*ATK}) bonus physical damage, and it gains {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE%}% Dodge for {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE_SEC} seconds plus a ({C:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield."

msgid "猎人龟每 {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_GAP} 秒射出 1 支追踪箭，共 {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} 支，每支随机锁定一名敌人，造成（{C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK}）真实伤害，{C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} 支共（{C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK*HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS}）真实伤害。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle fires 1 homing arrow every {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_GAP} seconds, {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} in total. Each locks onto a random enemy and deals ({C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK}) true damage, for ({C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK*HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS}) true damage across all {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} arrows."

msgid "海盗龟挥舞弯刀劈砍目标，造成（{C:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并回复（{C:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL*ATK}）生命值。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle slashes the target with its cutlass, dealing ({C:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF*ATK}) physical damage and healing ({C:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL*ATK})."

msgid "海盗龟命令海盗船朝随机敌人发射 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} 发炮弹，每发对落点附近的敌人造成（{C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_MAXHP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n{C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} 发全部命中时共造成（{C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_TOTAL_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS}）外加 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_TOTAL_MAXHP%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每发炮弹单独造成伤害，位于多个落点重叠处的敌人会被多次命中。\n</span>"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle orders the pirate ship to fire {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} cannonballs at random enemies. Each deals ({C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage to enemies near where it lands.\nIf all {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} hit, they deal ({C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_TOTAL_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS}) + {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_TOTAL_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health as physical damage in total.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Each cannonball deals damage separately; enemies where landing spots overlap are hit more than once.\n</span>"

msgid "海盗龟命令海盗船扔来一瓶朗姆酒，每秒回复（{C:PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT}）生命值，持续 {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} 秒，合计 {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_TOTAL}，同时获得（{C:PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF}）护甲和（{C:PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF}）魔抗，持续 {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">持续回复效果可叠加。\n</span>"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle has the pirate ship toss it a bottle of rum, healing ({C:PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT}) per second for {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} seconds ({E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_TOTAL} total) and gaining ({C:PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF}) Armor and ({C:PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF}) Magic Resist for {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The healing over time stacks.\n</span>"

msgid "海盗龟首次龟能充满时召唤一艘海盗船。海盗船冲锋撞击目标，对其附近的敌人造成（100%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:ATK}）魔法伤害并击飞 {C:PirateSystem.SHIP_CHARGE_STUN} 秒，之后留在场上攻击最近的敌人，每次造成（{C:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF%}%×海盗船攻击力 = {N:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE}）物理伤害。\n此后海盗龟每次龟能充满时朝目标扇形射出 {C:PirateSystem.SHOT_PELLETS} 颗霰弹，每颗对命中的第一个敌人造成（{C:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并击退。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">海盗船的生命值为 {E:HP*PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE}（{C:PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE%}% 海盗龟最大生命值），攻击力为 {E:ATK}（{C:PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE%}% 海盗龟攻击力），没有护甲与魔抗。</span>"
msgstr "The first time Pirate Turtle's Energy is full, it summons a pirate ship. The ship rams the target, dealing (100% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:ATK}) magic damage to nearby enemies and knocking them up for {C:PirateSystem.SHIP_CHARGE_STUN} seconds, then stays on the field attacking the nearest enemy for ({C:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF%}% × ship Attack = {N:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE}) physical damage per hit.\nAfter that, each time its Energy is full, Pirate Turtle fires {C:PirateSystem.SHOT_PELLETS} pellets in a cone at the target, each dealing ({C:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to the first enemy hit and knocking it back.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The pirate ship has {E:HP*PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE} health ({C:PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE%}% of Pirate Turtle's max health) and {E:ATK} Attack ({C:PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE%}% of Pirate Turtle's Attack), with no Armor or Magic Resist.</span>"

msgid "糖果龟挥锤砸向目标，造成（{C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {N:HP*CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP}）物理伤害，并使其攻击力降低 {C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">攻击力降低效果不可叠加，再次命中刷新持续时间。</span>"
msgstr "Candy Turtle smashes the target with its mallet, dealing ({C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {N:HP*CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP}) physical damage and reducing its attack damage by {C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The attack damage reduction doesn't stack; another hit refreshes its duration.</span>"

msgid "糖果龟蓄力后猛砸前方直线上的敌人，总计（{C:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {N:HP*CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT}）物理伤害由命中的敌人均分，并回复造成伤害 {C:CandySystem.HAMMER_LIFESTEAL%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle charges up and slams enemies in a line in front. ({C:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {N:HP*CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT}) total physical damage is split among enemies hit, and it heals for {C:CandySystem.HAMMER_LIFESTEAL%}% of damage dealt."

msgid "糖果龟在敌方中心区域降下糖衣炮弹雨，共 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICKS} 跳，每 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICK_SEC} 秒一跳，每跳落下 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHELLS} 颗糖弹。\n每颗糖弹使落点附近的友军获得（{C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT}）护盾，持续 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并对落点附近的敌人造成（{C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {M:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT}）魔法伤害，减速 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_PCT%}%，持续 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle rains sugarcoated shells on the center of the enemy side: {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICKS} waves, one every {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICK_SEC} seconds, each dropping {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHELLS} shells.\nEach shell gives nearby allies a ({C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT}) shield for {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and deals ({C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {M:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT}) magic damage to nearby enemies, slowing them by {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_PCT%}% for {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "被动：糖果龟登场时召唤一颗糖果炸弹。炸弹最大生命值为糖果龟登场时最大生命值×{C:CandySystem.BOMB_HP_PCT%}%，攻击力、护甲与魔抗均为 0，不主动攻击，每秒衰减自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DECAY_PCT%}% 最大生命值。\n\n主动：若炸弹存活，其最大生命值上限提升糖果龟最大生命值的 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_MAXHP_PCT%}%，并回复相当于糖果龟最大生命值 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_HEAL_PCT%}% 的生命值。\n若炸弹已阵亡，则召唤一颗新炸弹，生命值为糖果龟最大生命值的 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}%。\n炸弹因自身衰减或被击杀而死亡时爆炸，对全体敌人造成总计相当于炸弹 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DEATH_AOE%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，由存活敌人均摊。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Candy Turtle summons a Candy Bomb with max health equal to {C:CandySystem.BOMB_HP_PCT%}% of Candy Turtle's max health on spawn, and 0 Attack, Armor and Magic Resist. It doesn't attack and loses {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DECAY_PCT%}% of its max health per second.\n\nActive: if the bomb is alive, its max health rises by {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% of Candy Turtle's max health and it heals for {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_HEAL_PCT%}% of Candy Turtle's max health.\nIf the bomb is dead, summons a new one with {C:CandySystem.BOMB_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of Candy Turtle's max health.\nWhen the bomb dies from decay or is killed, it explodes, dealing magic damage totaling {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DEATH_AOE%}% of its max health, split among living enemies."

msgid "泡泡龟对目标连击 3 段，共造成（{C:BubbleSystem.HIT_TOTAL_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BubbleSystem.HIT_SEG_COEF*ATK*BubbleSystem.HIT_SEGMENTS}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle hits the target 3 times, dealing ({C:BubbleSystem.HIT_TOTAL_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BubbleSystem.HIT_SEG_COEF*ATK*BubbleSystem.HIT_SEGMENTS}) total physical damage."

msgid "泡泡龟使生命值最低的己方单位获得（{C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾，持续 {C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期、被打破或持盾者阵亡时爆裂，对全体敌人造成（{C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">护盾存在期间，泡泡龟的龟能停止充能。即使泡泡龟已阵亡，护盾仍会爆裂。</span>"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle gives the lowest-health ally a ({C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield for {C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield expires, breaks or its holder dies, it bursts, dealing ({C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to all enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Bubble Turtle's Energy stops charging while the shield exists. The shield still bursts even if Bubble Turtle has died.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_CONSUME%}% 当前泡泡值，对目标周围的每个敌人造成相当于所消耗泡泡值 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_MAGIC_MULT%}% 的魔法伤害，外加（{C:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">施放后剩余 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_KEEP%}% 泡泡值。</span>"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle spends {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_CONSUME%}% of its current Bubbles to deal magic damage equal to {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_MAGIC_MULT%}% of the Bubbles spent, plus ({C:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage, to each enemy around the target.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">{C:BubbleSystem.BURST_KEEP%}% of the Bubbles remain after casting.</span>"

msgid "线条龟攻击目标，造成（{C:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC*ATK}）魔法伤害并为其叠加 1 层墨迹。"
msgstr "Line Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC*ATK}) magic damage and applying 1 Ink stack."

msgid "线条龟画线连接最近的 {C:LineSystem.LINK_TARGETS} 个敌人，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_SEC} 秒，对两个目标各造成（{C:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并各叠加 1 层墨迹。\n连接期间，一方所受伤害的 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_TRANSFER%}% 会以真实伤害传导给另一方，且一方获得墨迹时另一方同步获得。"
msgstr "Line Turtle draws a line linking the {C:LineSystem.LINK_TARGETS} nearest enemies for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_SEC} seconds, dealing ({C:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage and applying 1 Ink stack to each.\nWhile linked, {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_TRANSFER%}% of damage one takes is passed to the other as true damage, and Ink applied to one is applied to the other too."

msgid "线条龟对墨迹层数最多的敌人点下终笔，造成（{C:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK}）外加每层墨迹（{C:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK*ATK}）物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">该伤害不消耗墨迹。\n墨迹达到 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 层时为（{C:LineSystem.DOT_FULL_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LineSystem.DOT_FULL_COEF*ATK}）。\n场上无墨迹时转而攻击最近的敌人，造成（{C:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。\n</span>"
msgstr "Line Turtle adds the finishing stroke to the enemy with the most Ink, dealing ({C:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK*ATK}) per Ink stack as physical damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">This doesn't consume Ink.\nAt {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} Ink stacks it deals ({C:LineSystem.DOT_FULL_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LineSystem.DOT_FULL_COEF*ATK}).\nWith no Ink on the field, it attacks the nearest enemy instead for ({C:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK}) physical damage.\n</span>"

msgid "被动：墨迹的层数上限由 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 提升至 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB}。\n\n主动：线条龟向敌人最密集处投掷墨水炸弹，对落点附近的敌人造成 {C:LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} 段共（{C:LineSystem.BOMB_TOTAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LineSystem.BOMB_SEG_COEF*ATK*LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS}）魔法伤害，每段为目标叠加 1 层墨迹。"
msgstr "Passive: Ink's stack cap rises from {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} to {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB}.\n\nActive: Line Turtle throws an Ink Bomb at the densest group of enemies, dealing ({C:LineSystem.BOMB_TOTAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LineSystem.BOMB_SEG_COEF*ATK*LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS}) magic damage over {C:LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} hits to enemies near where it lands. Each hit applies 1 Ink stack."

msgid "闪电龟射出一道闪电，造成（{C:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n随后弹跳 {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOPS} 次，每次跳向附近最近的另一名敌人，每跳伤害为前一跳的 {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_DECAY%}%（{C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOP1_COEF%}% / {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOP2_COEF%}% 攻击力），每段命中叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle fires a bolt dealing ({C:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage.\nIt then bounces {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOPS} times, each to the nearest other enemy, each bounce dealing {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_DECAY%}% of the previous one ({C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOP1_COEF%}% / {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOP2_COEF%}% Attack). Each hit applies 1 Shock stack."

msgid "闪电龟在接下来的 {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_SEC} 秒内使被动电击及满层引爆的真实伤害提升 {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_BOOST%}%，并立即对目标造成（{C:LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF}）真实伤害。"
msgstr "For the next {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_SEC} seconds, Lightning Turtle's passive shocks and max-stack detonations deal {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_BOOST%}% more true damage, and it immediately deals ({C:LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF}) true damage to the target."

msgid "闪电龟释放 {C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_BOLTS} 道闪电随机轰击敌方，共造成（{C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL*ATK}）魔法伤害，每道命中叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle unleashes {C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_BOLTS} bolts that strike random enemies, dealing ({C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL*ATK}) total magic damage. Each hit applies 1 Shock stack."

msgid "闪电龟以雷电包裹自身，获得（{C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加自身 {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾，持续 {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾存在时，闪电龟每受到一段攻击便反击（{C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE*ATK}）魔法伤害，并为攻击者叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle wraps itself in thunder, gaining a ({C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhile the shield holds, each hit it takes strikes back for ({C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE*ATK}) magic damage and applies 1 Shock stack to the attacker."

msgid "凤凰龟持续喷射火焰，每 {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_TICK_SEC} 秒对身前 {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_ARC_DEG}° 扇形、射程内的所有敌人造成（{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_MAG_COEF%}%×攻击力×(1+攻击速度)）魔法伤害，并施加（{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">喷火不受攻击间隔限制，凤凰龟可以边喷边移动，喷火时移动速度降低 {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_MOVE_SLOW%}%。每次喷火视为一次攻击，只有扇形内离凤凰龟最近的敌人会触发攻击命中时的效果。</span>"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle breathes fire continuously, dealing ({C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_MAG_COEF%}% × Attack × (1 + Attack Speed)) magic damage to all enemies within range in a {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_ARC_DEG}° cone in front every {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_TICK_SEC} seconds and applying ({C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The flames ignore the attack interval, and Phoenix Turtle can move while breathing fire at {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_MOVE_SLOW%}% reduced move speed. Each tick counts as an attack; only the enemy in the cone closest to Phoenix Turtle triggers on-hit effects.</span>"

msgid "凤凰龟获得（{C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾，持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾存在时，凤凰龟每受到一段攻击便反击攻击者，造成（{C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE*ATK}）魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle gains a ({C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield for {C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhile the shield holds, each hit it takes strikes back at the attacker for ({C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE*ATK}) magic damage."

msgid "凤凰龟投出火球，先破坏目标 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_SHIELD_BREAK%}% 护盾，再造成（{C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害，并施加（{C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧。\n使目标的攻击力、护甲、魔抗各降低 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_STAT_DOWN%}%，并施加 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle hurls a fireball that first destroys {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_SHIELD_BREAK%}% of the target's shield, then deals ({C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage and applies ({C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn.\nReduces the target's attack damage, Armor and Magic Resist by {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_STAT_DOWN%}% each and applies {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "被动：涅槃复活时的生命值提升至 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值，复活后凤凰龟永久获得 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ATK%}% 攻击力。\n\n主动：凤凰龟获得 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ASPD%}% 攻击速度与 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">【灼烧】的伤害随攻击速度提升。</span>"
msgstr "Passive: Rebirth revives with {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_HP_PCT%}% of max health instead, and Phoenix Turtle permanently gains {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ATK%}% attack damage after reviving.\n\nActive: Phoenix Turtle gains {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ASPD%}% attack speed and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SPD%}% move speed for {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">[Burn] damage increases with attack speed.</span>"

msgid "石头龟对目标打击，造成（{C:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) + {C:StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF%}%×护甲({DEF}) + {C:StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF%}%×魔抗({MR}) = {N:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF*ATK+StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF*MR}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle strikes the target, dealing ({C:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) + {C:StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF%}% × Armor ({DEF}) + {C:StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF%}% × Magic Resist ({MR}) = {N:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF*ATK+StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF*MR}) physical damage."

msgid "石头龟为全体友军施加（{C:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) + {C:StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT}）护盾，持续 {C:StoneSystem.RS_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并使自身护甲与魔抗各提升 {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_UP%}%，持续 {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">持有此护盾期间石头龟的龟能不再充能。</span>"
msgstr "Stone Turtle grants all allies a ({C:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) + {C:StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT}) shield for {C:StoneSystem.RS_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and increases its own Armor and Magic Resist by {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_UP%}% for {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Stone Turtle's Energy doesn't charge while it holds this shield.</span>"

msgid "被动：石头龟每次受到攻击或技能伤害获得 1 层岩层，至多 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_LAYER_CAP} 层。每层岩层提供 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_DR_PER_LAYER%}% 减伤与 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_SIZE_PER_LAYER%}% 体型。\n\n主动：石头龟向前释放岩石冲击波，对前方一排敌人造成（{C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF%}%×护甲({DEF}) + {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF%}%×魔抗({MR}) = {N:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF*MR}）物理伤害，每层岩层使此伤害提高 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_PER_LAYER%}%，并将其击退、眩晕 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_STUN} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: each time Stone Turtle takes attack or ability damage, it gains 1 Rock Layer, up to {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_LAYER_CAP}. Each layer grants {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_DR_PER_LAYER%}% Damage Reduction and {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_SIZE_PER_LAYER%}% size.\n\nActive: Stone Turtle sends out a rock shockwave that deals ({C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF%}% × Armor ({DEF}) + {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF%}% × Magic Resist ({MR}) = {N:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF*MR}) physical damage to the row of enemies in front, +{C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_PER_LAYER%}% per Rock Layer, knocking them back and stunning them for {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_STUN} seconds."

msgid "石头龟嘲讽附近的所有敌人 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} 秒，并获得（{C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾与（{C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF}%×护甲({DEF}) = {E:minf(DEF*StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF,StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP*100)}%）减伤，持续 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} 秒。减伤至多 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP%}%。\n{C:StoneSystem.SLAM_DELAY} 秒后，石头龟猛砸地面，对附近的敌人造成（{C:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害并将其击飞 {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">砸地前被控制则砸地取消。</span>"
msgstr "Stone Turtle taunts all nearby enemies for {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} seconds and gains a ({C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield and ({C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF}% × Armor ({DEF}) = {E:minf(DEF*StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF,StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP*100)}%) Damage Reduction for {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} seconds, capped at {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP%}%.\nAfter {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_DELAY} seconds, it slams the ground, dealing ({C:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to nearby enemies and knocking them up for {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crowd control before the slam cancels it.</span>"

msgid "熔岩龟投出熔岩弹，造成（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK}）+ {C:LavaSystem.BOLT_TGT_HP%}%目标最大生命值 魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle hurls a lava ball that deals ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK}) + {C:LavaSystem.BOLT_TGT_HP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage and applies ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn."

msgid "熔岩龟在敌人最密集处生成一片岩浆池，持续 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SEC} 秒。\n岩浆池每 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TICK_SEC} 秒对池内的敌人造成（{C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加目标 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TGT_HP%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并使其减速 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SLOW_PCT%}%、魔抗降低 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_MR_DOWN%}%。离开岩浆池后减速与魔抗降低随即消失。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">火山形态下本技能替换为【火山爆发】，额外施加灼烧并回复生命值。</span>"
msgstr "Lava Turtle creates a magma pool at the densest group of enemies for {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SEC} seconds.\nEvery {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TICK_SEC} seconds, the pool deals ({C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TGT_HP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage to enemies inside, slows them by {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SLOW_PCT%}% and reduces their Magic Resist by {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_MR_DOWN%}%. The slow and Magic Resist reduction end as soon as they leave the pool.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">In Volcano Form, this ability becomes [Volcanic Eruption], which also applies Burn and heals.</span>"

msgid "熔岩龟蓄力 {C:LavaSystem.CAST_WINDUP} 秒后使目标脚下喷出岩浆柱，将附近的敌人击飞 {C:LavaSystem.SURGE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒，并对目标造成（{C:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。熔岩龟获得（{C:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾，直到被打破。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">蓄力期间被控制则技能取消。</span>"
msgstr "Lava Turtle charges for {C:LavaSystem.CAST_WINDUP} seconds, then erupts a magma pillar under the target, knocking up nearby enemies for {C:LavaSystem.SURGE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds and dealing ({C:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to the target. Lava Turtle gains a ({C:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield until broken.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crowd control during the charge cancels the ability.</span>"

msgid "普通形态：熔岩龟冲刺，残血或被敌人贴身时向后撤离，否则贴近目标。随后立即进行下一次攻击，这发熔岩弹贯穿全场，对沿途每名敌人造成（{C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加目标 {C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF*ATK}）层灼烧。\n\n火山形态：火山龟获得 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值、{C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度与 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Normal Form: Lava Turtle dashes, backing off when low on health or when an enemy is close, otherwise closing in on the target. It immediately attacks again, and this lava ball pierces across the whole field, dealing ({C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as magic damage to every enemy in its path and applying ({C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF*ATK}) Burn.\n\nVolcano Form: gains {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% of max health, {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% attack speed and {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% move speed for {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "赛博龟射出一道贯穿激光，激光沿直线飞出场外，对第一个命中的敌人造成（{C:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，之后命中的每个敌人受到 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CYBER_LASER_FALLOFF%}% 的伤害。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle fires a piercing laser that flies straight off the field, dealing ({C:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to the first enemy hit; each enemy after that takes {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CYBER_LASER_FALLOFF%}% of the damage."

msgid "赛博龟蓄力后朝一条直线发射能量射线，对直线上的所有敌人造成（{C:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS*ATK}）物理伤害，外加（{C:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE%}%×攻击力×浮游炮数({E:droneCount}) = {T:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE*ATK*droneCount}）真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">蓄力期间被控制则技能取消。</span>"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle charges up and fires an energy ray in a line, dealing ({C:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS*ATK}) physical damage plus ({C:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE%}% × Attack × drones ({E:droneCount}) = {T:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE*ATK*droneCount}) true damage to all enemies on it.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crowd control during the charge cancels the ability.</span>"

msgid "赛博龟侵入一名随机敌人，使其倒戈为赛博龟一方作战，持续 {C:CyberSystem.HIJACK_SEC} 秒。侵入期间赛博龟的龟能锁定，不再充能。\n倒戈的单位用自己的攻击与技能攻击原来的队友，仍会受到原来队友的攻击，不会获得赛博龟一方的治疗与护盾。它造成的击杀归赛博龟一方。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋与免疫控制的单位不会被侵入。</span>"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle hacks a random enemy, making it fight for Cyber Turtle's side for {C:CyberSystem.HIJACK_SEC} seconds. Cyber Turtle's Energy is locked and doesn't charge during the hack.\nThe hacked unit uses its own attacks and abilities on its former teammates, can still be attacked by them, and doesn't receive heals or shields from Cyber Turtle's side. Its kills count for Cyber Turtle's side.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs and units immune to crowd control can't be hacked.</span>"

msgid "赛博龟登场时获得 {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE} 层充能与 {C:CyberSystem.AI_MOVE_UP%}% 移动速度。近战敌人靠近时，赛博龟消耗 1 层充能冲刺躲开。\n每次释放获得 1 层充能，并冲刺到射程内合适的距离。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">被控制时不会冲刺。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, Cyber Turtle gains {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE} charges and {C:CyberSystem.AI_MOVE_UP%}% move speed. When a melee enemy closes in, it spends 1 charge to dash away.\nEach cast grants 1 charge and dashes to a good spot within range.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">It won't dash while crowd-controlled.</span>"

msgid "水晶龟刺出水晶刺，造成（{C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:CrystalSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害外加目标 {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_MAXHP_MAGIC%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并叠加 {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_STACKS} 层结晶印记。"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle thrusts a crystal spike, dealing ({C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:CrystalSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage plus {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_MAXHP_MAGIC%}% of the target's max health as magic damage, and applying {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_STACKS} Crystal Mark stacks."

msgid "水晶龟竖起水晶壁垒，获得（{C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_ATK*ATK}）+ 自身 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾，持续 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} 秒。\n全体友方的护甲与魔抗提升 +{C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_TEAM_RESIST%}%，持续 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} 秒。\n护盾结束或被打破时，朝当前目标方向释放一条直线水晶刺，水晶逐段从地底刺出。\n命中的敌人受到（{C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_TRUE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_TRUE_COEF*ATK}）真实伤害，叠加 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_STACKS} 层结晶印记，被击飞 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒，并被减速 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_PCT%}%，持续 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle raises a Crystal Bulwark, gaining a ({C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_ATK*ATK}) + {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_HP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} seconds.\nAll allies gain +{C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_TEAM_RESIST%}% Armor and Magic Resist for {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield ends or breaks, it sends a line of crystal spikes toward its current target, erupting from the ground section by section.\nEnemies hit take ({C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_TRUE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_TRUE_COEF*ATK}) true damage, gain {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_STACKS} Crystal Mark stacks, are knocked up for {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds, and are slowed by {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_PCT%}% for {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "水晶龟对当前目标周围的敌人释放 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_SEGMENTS} 段碎晶，共造成（{C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAGIC*ATK}）魔法伤害 +（{C:CrystalSystem.BURST_TRUE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:CrystalSystem.BURST_TRUE*ATK}）真实伤害，每段叠加 1 层结晶印记，共 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_SEGMENTS} 层。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">结晶印记叠加至 {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} 层时自动引爆。\n</span>"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle releases {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_SEGMENTS} bursts of crystal shards at enemies around its current target, dealing ({C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAGIC*ATK}) magic damage + ({C:CrystalSystem.BURST_TRUE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:CrystalSystem.BURST_TRUE*ATK}) true damage in total. Each burst applies 1 Crystal Mark stack, {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_SEGMENTS} in total.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crystal Marks detonate automatically at {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} stacks.\n</span>"

msgid "被动：水晶龟登场时召唤一颗水晶球，生命值为水晶龟最大生命值的 {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_HP_PCT%}%，攻击力与水晶龟相同。水晶球每 {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_IV} 秒射出一道贯穿光线，分两段对直线上的所有敌人共造成（{C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害，并叠加 {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_STACKS} 层结晶印记。\n\n主动：水晶龟朝目标射出一道相同的光线。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">水晶龟阵亡后水晶球继续战斗。</span>"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Crystal Turtle summons a crystal ball with {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_HP_PCT%}% of Crystal Turtle's max health and the same Attack. Every {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_IV} seconds, the ball fires a piercing ray that deals ({C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_COEF*ATK}) magic damage over two hits to all enemies on the line and applies {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_STACKS} Crystal Mark stacks.\n\nActive: Crystal Turtle fires the same ray at the target.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The crystal ball keeps fighting after Crystal Turtle dies.</span>"

msgid "宝箱龟朝目标猛砸宝箱，对前方短直线上的所有敌人造成（{C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle slams its chest at the target, dealing ({C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to all enemies in a short line in front."

msgid "宝箱龟回复（{C:ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_PCT}）生命值并获得（{C:ChestSystem.COUNT_SHIELD_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ChestSystem.COUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}）护盾。\n每拥有 {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_PER_TREASURE} 点财宝值，治疗效果提升 {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_BONUS%}%。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle heals ({C:ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_PCT}) and gains a ({C:ChestSystem.COUNT_SHIELD_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ChestSystem.COUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK}) shield.\nHealing increases by {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_BONUS%}% for every {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_PER_TREASURE} Treasure it has."

msgid "宝箱龟在目标位置卷起财宝风暴，每 {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} 秒对范围内的敌人造成（{C:ChestSystem.STORM_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:ChestSystem.STORM_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，共 {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICKS} 次。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle whips up a treasure storm at the target's location, dealing ({C:ChestSystem.STORM_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:ChestSystem.STORM_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to enemies inside every {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} seconds, {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICKS} times."

msgid "被动：宝箱龟每携带一件装备，便永久获得 {C:ChestSystem.GREED_ATK_PER_EQ%}% 攻击力与 {C:ChestSystem.GREED_HP_PER_EQ%}% 自身最大生命值。藏宝图开出的战利品也计入。\n\n主动：宝箱龟蓄力后朝一条直线发射能量射线，对直线上的所有敌人造成（{C:ChestSystem.CANNON_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:ChestSystem.CANNON_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并将其击飞。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">蓄力期间被控制则技能取消。</span>"
msgstr "Passive: for each item it carries, Treasure Chest Turtle permanently gains {C:ChestSystem.GREED_ATK_PER_EQ%}% attack damage and {C:ChestSystem.GREED_HP_PER_EQ%}% max health. Loot from the Treasure Map counts too.\n\nActive: Treasure Chest Turtle charges up and fires an energy ray in a line, dealing ({C:ChestSystem.CANNON_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:ChestSystem.CANNON_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to all enemies on it and knocking them up.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Crowd control during the charge cancels the ability.</span>"

msgid "星际龟发射星光弹，造成（{C:StarSystem.BOLT_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK}）外加目标 {C:StarSystem.BOLT_CURHP%}% 当前生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Space Turtle fires a starlight shot, dealing ({C:StarSystem.BOLT_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK}) + {C:StarSystem.BOLT_CURHP%}% of the target's current health as magic damage."

msgid "星际龟蓄力 {C:StarSystem.WORM_WINDUP} 秒后朝目标发射一个缓慢移动的虫洞。虫洞沿直线飞向场地边缘，将沿途的敌人吸向虫洞，附近的敌人被捕获并随虫洞移动。\n虫洞抵达边缘时爆炸，对被捕获的敌人与附近的敌人造成（{C:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害，本战场每进行 1 秒，伤害提高 {C:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_PER_SEC%}%。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">伤害提高量在发射时确定。虫洞存在期间龟能不充能。蓄力期间被控制则技能取消。</span>"
msgstr "Space Turtle charges for {C:StarSystem.WORM_WINDUP} seconds, then launches a slow-moving wormhole at the target. It flies straight to the edge of the field, pulling in enemies along its path; nearby enemies are captured and carried along.\nWhen it reaches the edge, it explodes, dealing ({C:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to captured and nearby enemies, +{C:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_PER_SEC%}% for every second the battle has lasted.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The bonus is locked in on launch. Energy doesn't charge while the wormhole exists. Crowd control during the charge cancels the ability.</span>"

msgid "星际龟释放一圈向外扩散的星波，对命中的所有敌人造成（{C:StarSystem.WAVE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.WAVE_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n星能充满时，额外召唤一颗彗星砸向敌阵中心，消耗全部星能，对中心附近的敌人造成与消耗星能等量的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Space Turtle releases an expanding star wave, dealing ({C:StarSystem.WAVE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.WAVE_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to all enemies hit.\nWith full Star Power, it also calls a comet down on the center of the enemy group, spending all Star Power to deal that much true damage to enemies near the center."

msgid "星际龟在敌阵中心制造一个引力点，对周围的所有敌人造成（{C:StarSystem.WARP_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.WARP_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n星能充满时，引力点额外将范围内的敌人甩过中心点，落到对面一侧，并消耗全部星能。"
msgstr "Space Turtle creates a gravity point at the center of the enemy group, dealing ({C:StarSystem.WARP_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:StarSystem.WARP_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to all enemies around it.\nWith full Star Power, the gravity point also flings enemies in range across the center to the opposite side, spending all Star Power."

msgid "缩头乌龟攻击目标，造成（{C:HidingSystem.BASIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。\n每次攻击使自身永久获得 {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} 护甲与 {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} 魔抗，并获得（{C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_SHIELD%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*HidingSystem.HARDEN_SHIELD}）护盾。"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:HidingSystem.BASIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK}) physical damage.\nEach attack permanently grants {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} Armor and {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} Magic Resist, plus a ({C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_SHIELD%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*HidingSystem.HARDEN_SHIELD}) shield."

msgid "缩头乌龟立即为随从提供 {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_MINION_ENERGY%}% 龟能，随后自身缩入壳中 {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_SEC} 秒，期间受到的伤害降低 {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_DR%}%，且无法攻击或移动。"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle instantly gives its follower {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_MINION_ENERGY%}% Energy, then ducks into its shell for {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_SEC} seconds, taking {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_DR%}% less damage but unable to attack or move."

msgid "缩头乌龟获得（{C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_PCT}）护盾，持续 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并使护甲提升 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_UP%}%，持续 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期时，剩余护盾的 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_CONVERT%}% 转化为生命值。持有此护盾期间龟能不再充能。"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle gains a ({C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_PCT}) shield for {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_UP%}% Armor for {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield expires, {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_CONVERT%}% of what's left turns into healing. Energy doesn't charge while it holds this shield."

msgid "缩头乌龟为随从注入力量，持续 {C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_SEC} 秒：攻击力 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%、护甲与魔抗 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%、生命偷取 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%、暴击率 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_CRIT%}%。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">随从已阵亡时此技能无效。若随从先于缩头乌龟阵亡，缩头乌龟永久获得此增益，可多次累积。\n</span>"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle empowers its follower for {C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_SEC} seconds: Attack +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%, Armor and Magic Resist +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%, Lifesteal +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%, Crit Chance +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_CRIT%}%.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">No effect if the follower is dead. If the follower dies before Hiding Turtle, Hiding Turtle permanently gains this bonus, which can build up multiple times.\n</span>"

msgid "无头龟撕咬目标，造成（{C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害外加目标 {C:BasicConsts.HEADLESS_BITE_MAXHP%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle bites the target, dealing ({C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}) physical damage plus {C:BasicConsts.HEADLESS_BITE_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage."

msgid "无头龟咆哮威吓，对附近的所有敌人施加恐惧，持续 3 秒。\n恐惧期间，目标无法移动、攻击或释放技能，龟能停止充能。\n蛋类单位免疫此效果。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle roars, applying Fear to all nearby enemies for 3 seconds.\nWhile feared, targets can't move, attack or cast abilities, and their Energy stops charging.\nEgg units are immune."

msgid "无头龟从自身爆发出覆盖几乎整个战场的触须，持续 {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_SELF_STUN} 秒，期间无法移动或攻击，并获得 {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n施法 {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_SEC} 秒后触须伸出，对敌人造成（{C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_FOE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_FOE*ATK}）物理伤害，对友军造成（{C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_ALLY%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_ALLY*ATK}）物理伤害，并眩晕所有命中的单位。\n施法 {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_SEC} 秒后触须收回，对敌人造成（{C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_FOE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_FOE*ATK}）物理伤害，对友军造成（{C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_ALLY%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_ALLY*ATK}）物理伤害，并解除触须造成的眩晕。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">无头龟中途阵亡时，触须不再造成伤害并立即放开被缠住的单位。</span>"
msgstr "Headless Turtle bursts out tendrils covering almost the whole battlefield for {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_SELF_STUN} seconds, unable to move or attack meanwhile, and gains {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal.\n{C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_SEC} seconds in, the tendrils lash out, dealing ({C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_FOE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_FOE*ATK}) physical damage to enemies and ({C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_ALLY%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_ALLY*ATK}) physical damage to allies, stunning every unit hit.\n{C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_SEC} seconds in, the tendrils pull back, dealing ({C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_FOE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_FOE*ATK}) physical damage to enemies and ({C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_ALLY%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_ALLY*ATK}) physical damage to allies, and ending the tendril stun.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">If Headless Turtle dies partway through, the tendrils stop dealing damage and release everything they hold.</span>"

msgid "无头龟的接下来 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS} 次攻击射程增加 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_RANGE_BONUS}，并额外造成（{C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加目标 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_CURHP_PCT%}% 当前生命值的魔法伤害。\n第 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS} 次攻击后，无头龟挥出镰刀横扫正面 {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_ARC_DEG}° 锥形范围，击退命中的敌人并施加 {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_CURSE_SEC} 秒诅咒。诅咒每秒造成目标 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">强化期间龟能锁定，镰刀横扫后重新充能。</span>"
msgstr "Headless Turtle's next {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS} attacks gain {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_RANGE_BONUS} range and deal ({C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_CURHP_PCT%}% of the target's current health as bonus magic damage.\nAfter the {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS}th attack, it sweeps its scythe across a {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_ARC_DEG}° cone in front, knocking back enemies hit and cursing them for {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_CURSE_SEC} seconds. Curse deals true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of the target's max health each second.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Energy is locked while empowered and starts charging again after the scythe sweep.</span>"

msgid "龟壳攻击目标，造成（{C:ShellSystem.BASIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:ShellSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK}）伤害，伤害类型在物理与真实之间交替，第一次为物理伤害。\n每次攻击对主目标附近的其他敌人造成 {C:ShellSystem.SPLASH_PCT%}% 的溅射伤害，类型与本次攻击相同。"
msgstr "Turtle Shell attacks the target, dealing ({C:ShellSystem.BASIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:ShellSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK}) damage that alternates between physical and true, starting with physical.\nEach attack splashes {C:ShellSystem.SPLASH_PCT%}% of its damage, of the same type, to other enemies near the main target."

msgid "龟壳随机复制敌方的 2 个技能并依次释放，每个技能只发挥 {C:ShellSystem.COPY_EFFECT%}% 的效果。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">会永久改变属性或形态的技能不会被复制。已阵亡的敌人的技能同样可以复制。可复制的技能只有 1 个时，将其释放两次。</span>"
msgstr "Turtle Shell copies 2 random enemy abilities and casts them in turn, each at {C:ShellSystem.COPY_EFFECT%}% effect.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Abilities that permanently change stats or form can't be copied. Abilities of dead enemies can be copied too. If only 1 ability can be copied, it's cast twice.</span>"

msgid "龟壳夺取目标 {C:ShellSystem.ABSORB_PCT%}% 最大生命值：目标的最大生命值降低这一数值，龟壳的最大生命值与当前生命值增加这一数值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">目标当前生命值超出新上限的部分以真实伤害扣除。</span>"
msgstr "Turtle Shell takes {C:ShellSystem.ABSORB_PCT%}% of the target's max health: the target's max health drops by that much, and Turtle Shell's max and current health rise by that much.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Any of the target's current health above its new maximum is removed as true damage.</span>"

msgid "被动：龟壳 {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_IDLE_SEC} 秒内未受到伤害时进入潜影，变为不可选中。龟壳攻击或释放技能时解除潜影，范围伤害不会解除潜影。\n解除潜影后的首次攻击额外造成（{C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_BREAK_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:ShellSystem.STEALTH_BREAK_MAGIC*ATK}）魔法伤害，施加（{C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_POISON_MULT%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ShellSystem.STEALTH_POISON_MULT*ATK}）层中毒与 {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒。\n\n主动：龟壳朝目标方向飞行，对途经的敌人造成（{C:ShellSystem.DIVE_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:ShellSystem.DIVE_MAGIC*ATK}）魔法伤害并将其击退。龟壳沿途留下一条暗影火道，持续 {C:ShellSystem.BURN_LIFE} 秒，每 {C:ShellSystem.BURN_TICK_SEC} 秒对火道内的敌人施加（{C:ShellSystem.BURN_ATK_MULT%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ShellSystem.BURN_ATK_MULT*ATK}）层灼烧并减速 {C:ShellSystem.BURN_SLOW_PCT%}%。龟壳落地后进入潜影。"
msgstr "Passive: if Turtle Shell takes no damage for {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_IDLE_SEC} seconds, it enters Shadow and becomes untargetable. Attacking or casting ends Shadow; area damage doesn't.\nThe first attack after leaving Shadow deals ({C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_BREAK_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:ShellSystem.STEALTH_BREAK_MAGIC*ATK}) bonus magic damage and applies ({C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_POISON_MULT%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ShellSystem.STEALTH_POISON_MULT*ATK}) Poison and {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds.\n\nActive: Turtle Shell flies toward the target, dealing ({C:ShellSystem.DIVE_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:ShellSystem.DIVE_MAGIC*ATK}) magic damage to enemies it passes and knocking them back. It leaves a trail of shadow fire for {C:ShellSystem.BURN_LIFE} seconds that applies ({C:ShellSystem.BURN_ATK_MULT%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ShellSystem.BURN_ATK_MULT*ATK}) Burn and a {C:ShellSystem.BURN_SLOW_PCT%}% slow to enemies inside every {C:ShellSystem.BURN_TICK_SEC} seconds. Turtle Shell enters Shadow after landing."

msgid "竹叶龟甩出叶刃，造成（{C:BambooSystem.LEAF_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) + {C:BambooSystem.LEAF_MAXHP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {N:BambooSystem.LEAF_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*BambooSystem.LEAF_MAXHP_PCT}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle flings a leaf blade, dealing ({C:BambooSystem.LEAF_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) + {C:BambooSystem.LEAF_MAXHP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {N:BambooSystem.LEAF_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*BambooSystem.LEAF_MAXHP_PCT}) physical damage."

msgid "竹叶龟回复（{C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SELF%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SELF}）生命值，并为每名龟队友提供其 {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_ALLY_SHIELD%}% 最大生命值的护盾，持续 {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n若没有其他龟队友存活，转而回复（{C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SOLO%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SOLO}）生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">训龟大师、龟蛋与召唤物不算龟队友。</span>"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle heals ({C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SELF%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SELF}) and gives each turtle teammate a shield equal to {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_ALLY_SHIELD%}% of its max health for {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nIf no other turtle teammates are alive, it heals ({C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SOLO%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SOLO}) instead.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The Turtle Trainer, Turtle Eggs and summons don't count as turtle teammates.</span>"

msgid "竹叶龟伸出一条竹藤，钩住全场最远的敌人，造成 {N:BambooSystem.SMACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害、眩晕 {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_STUN} 秒，并将其拉至竹叶龟身前。\n同时施加冰寒，使其攻击力和移动速度各降低 {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋免疫控制，仅受到伤害。</span>"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle shoots out a bamboo vine that hooks the farthest enemy on the field, dealing {N:BambooSystem.SMACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage, stunning it for {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_STUN} seconds and pulling it in front of Bamboo Turtle.\nIt also applies Chill, reducing its attack damage and move speed by {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_DOWN%}% for {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs are immune to the control and only take the damage.</span>"

msgid "竹叶龟以目标为中心蓄力 {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_WINDUP} 秒，随后竹刺破地而出，对范围内的敌人造成（{C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BambooSystem.SPIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {N:HP*BambooSystem.SPIKE_MAXHP_PCT}）物理伤害，并将其击飞 {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋不会被击飞。蓄力期间被控制则技能取消。</span>"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle charges for {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_WINDUP} seconds around the target, then bamboo spikes burst from the ground, dealing ({C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BambooSystem.SPIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {N:HP*BambooSystem.SPIKE_MAXHP_PCT}) physical damage to enemies in the area and knocking them up for {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs aren't knocked up. Crowd control during the charge cancels the ability.</span>"

msgid "天使龟攻击目标，造成（{C:AngelSystem.VERDICT_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:AngelSystem.VERDICT_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Angel Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:AngelSystem.VERDICT_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:AngelSystem.VERDICT_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

msgid "被动：天使龟首次死亡时以自身 {C:AngelSystem.REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值复活一次。\n\n主动：天使龟使当前输出最高的己方单位获得（{C:AngelSystem.BLESS_SHIELD%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:AngelSystem.BLESS_SHIELD*ATK}）护盾和 {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_HASTE%}% 攻击速度，持续 {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: the first time Angel Turtle dies, it revives once with {C:AngelSystem.REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health.\n\nActive: Angel Turtle gives the ally with the highest damage dealt a ({C:AngelSystem.BLESS_SHIELD%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:AngelSystem.BLESS_SHIELD*ATK}) shield and {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_HASTE%}% attack speed for {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_SEC} seconds."

msgid "天使龟对目标斩出 {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_SEGMENTS} 道圣光，共造成（{C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_TOTAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:AngelSystem.EQUAL_TOTAL*ATK}）物理伤害，本次施法获得 {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n若目标稀有度为 A 级及以上，额外造成（{C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_COEF*ATK}）外加 {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_LOST%}% 目标已损失生命值的真实伤害。\n每道圣光和对 A 级及以上目标的额外伤害都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时与命中时的装备效果。"
msgstr "Angel Turtle slashes the target with {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_SEGMENTS} strokes of holy light, dealing ({C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_TOTAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:AngelSystem.EQUAL_TOTAL*ATK}) total physical damage, with {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal for this cast.\nIf the target's rarity is A or higher, it deals ({C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_COEF*ATK}) + {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_LOST%}% of the target's missing health as bonus true damage.\nEach stroke and the bonus damage against A-or-higher targets count as attacks, triggering on-attack and on-hit item effects."

msgid "寒冰龟射出冰锥，交替造成（{C:IceSystem.CONE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {P:IceSystem.CONE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害或魔法伤害，每次攻击获得 1 层冰柱。\n每层冰柱提供 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% 护甲和 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% 魔抗，最多 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} 层，每个战场结束时重置。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">若选择【冰霜】，每层冰柱使其范围 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}%、持续时间 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} 秒。</span>"
msgstr "Ice Turtle fires icicles that alternate between ({C:IceSystem.CONE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {P:IceSystem.CONE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical and magic damage, gaining 1 Ice Pillar stack per attack.\nEach Ice Pillar stack grants {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% Armor and {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% Magic Resist, up to {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} stacks, reset at the end of each battle.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With [Frost], each Ice Pillar stack gives it +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}% size and +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} seconds of duration.</span>"

msgid "寒冰龟在目标处降下冰霜领域，持续 {C:IceSystem.FROST_BASE_SEC} 秒。领域内的敌人魔抗降低 {C:IceSystem.FROST_MR_DOWN%}%，并每 {C:IceSystem.FROST_TICK_SEC} 秒受到（{C:IceSystem.FROST_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.FROST_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n每层冰柱使领域范围 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}%、持续时间 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">满 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} 层冰柱时持续 {C:IceSystem.FROST_FULL_SEC} 秒，共造成 {C:IceSystem.FROST_FULL_TICKS} 次伤害（0 层时 {C:IceSystem.FROST_BASE_TICKS} 次）。</span>"
msgstr "Ice Turtle brings down a frost zone at the target for {C:IceSystem.FROST_BASE_SEC} seconds. Enemies inside lose {C:IceSystem.FROST_MR_DOWN%}% Magic Resist and take ({C:IceSystem.FROST_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.FROST_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage every {C:IceSystem.FROST_TICK_SEC} seconds.\nEach Ice Pillar stack gives the zone +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}% size and +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} seconds of duration.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">At {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} Ice Pillar stacks it lasts {C:IceSystem.FROST_FULL_SEC} seconds and deals {C:IceSystem.FROST_FULL_TICKS} hits ({C:IceSystem.FROST_BASE_TICKS} at 0 stacks).</span>"

msgid "寒冰龟冰封目标，造成（{C:IceSystem.FREEZE_DMG%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.FREEZE_DMG*ATK}）魔法伤害，并回复相当于自身护甲与魔抗之和的生命值。\n拥有 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} 层冰柱后，额外眩晕目标 {C:IceSystem.FREEZE_STUN_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ice Turtle freezes the target, dealing ({C:IceSystem.FREEZE_DMG%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.FREEZE_DMG*ATK}) magic damage and healing for its combined Armor and Magic Resist.\nAt {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} Ice Pillar stacks, it also stuns the target for {C:IceSystem.FREEZE_STUN_SEC} seconds."

msgid "寒冰龟使包括自身在内的全体友军获得（{C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_PCT*HP}）护盾，持续 {C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期、被打破或持盾者阵亡时爆裂，对其附近的敌人造成（{C:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">场上没有其他友军时，护盾为（{C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SOLO_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SOLO_PCT*HP}），爆裂伤害为（{C:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_SOLO_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_SOLO_COEF*ATK}）。</span>"
msgstr "Ice Turtle gives all allies, including itself, a ({C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_PCT*HP}) shield for {C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhen a shield expires, breaks or its holder dies, it bursts, dealing ({C:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to nearby enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With no other allies on the field, the shield is ({C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SOLO_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SOLO_PCT*HP}) and the burst deals ({C:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_SOLO_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_SOLO_COEF*ATK}).</span>"

msgid "忍者龟斩击目标，造成（{C:NinjaSystem.SLASH_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.SLASH_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并施加（{C:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK}）层流血，暴击时转而施加（{C:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK_CRIT%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK_CRIT*ATK}）层。"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle slashes the target, dealing ({C:NinjaSystem.SLASH_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.SLASH_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage and applying ({C:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK}) Bleed, or ({C:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK_CRIT%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK_CRIT*ATK}) on a crit."

msgid "被动：忍者龟获得 {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_DODGE%}% 闪避和 {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_CRIT%}% 暴击率。\n\n主动：忍者龟向目标投掷手里剑，造成（{C:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。暴击时其中 {E:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_BASE+NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_PER_LV*LV}% =（{C:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_LV1}% - {C:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_LVMAX}%，随等级提升）转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Passive: Ninja Turtle gains {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_DODGE%}% Dodge and {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_CRIT%}% Crit Chance.\n\nActive: Ninja Turtle throws a shuriken at the target, dealing ({C:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_COEF*ATK}) physical damage. On a crit, {E:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_BASE+NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_PER_LV*LV}% of it (= {C:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_LV1}% – {C:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_LVMAX}%, rising with level) becomes true damage."

msgid "忍者龟扔出炸弹，对落点附近的敌人造成（{C:NinjaSystem.BOMB_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.BOMB_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并使其护甲降低 {C:NinjaSystem.BOMB_DEF_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle throws a bomb that deals ({C:NinjaSystem.BOMB_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.BOMB_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to enemies near where it lands and reduces their Armor by {C:NinjaSystem.BOMB_DEF_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "忍者龟获得 {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN} 护甲穿透，持续 {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN_SEC} 秒，随后闪现到全场最远的敌人身后背刺 {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS} 段，共造成（{C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_TOTAL%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEG_COEF*ATK*NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS}）物理伤害，之后继续攻击该敌人。"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle gains {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN} Armor Pen for {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN_SEC} seconds, then blinks behind the farthest enemy on the field and backstabs it {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS} times for ({C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_TOTAL%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEG_COEF*ATK*NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS}) total physical damage, then keeps attacking that enemy."

msgid "变脸龟远程形态射出灵能弹，造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_RANGED_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_RANGED_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。\n近战形态挥砍，造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_MELEE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_MELEE_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "In ranged form, Two-Face Turtle fires a psi bolt dealing ({C:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_RANGED_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_RANGED_COEF*ATK}) physical damage.\nIn melee form, it slashes for ({C:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_MELEE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_MELEE_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

msgid "· 远程形态【灵能冲击】：\n变脸龟射出灵能炮弹，命中第一个敌人时爆炸，对附近的敌人造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP%}% + {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP*100+TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP_PER_ATK*100*ATK}%）目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n· 近战形态【锤击】：\n变脸龟跃向目标并锤击地面，对附近的敌人造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_COEF*ATK}）外加（{C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_SELF_MAXHP%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {N:HP*TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_SELF_MAXHP}）物理伤害，并获得相当于对目标所造成伤害 {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "· Ranged form [Psi Blast]:\nTwo-Face Turtle fires a psi shell that explodes on the first enemy hit, dealing ({C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP%}% + {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP*100+TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP_PER_ATK*100*ATK}%) of the target's max health as physical damage to nearby enemies.\n· Melee form [Hammer]:\nTwo-Face Turtle leaps at the target and hammers the ground, dealing ({C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_SELF_MAXHP%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {N:HP*TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_SELF_MAXHP}) physical damage to nearby enemies, and gains a shield equal to {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_PCT%}% of the damage dealt to the target for {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "· 远程形态【精神干扰】：\n变脸龟对目标造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_TRUE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_TRUE*ATK}）真实伤害，施加 {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒，并破坏其 {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_SHIELD_BREAK%}% 护盾。\n· 近战形态【吸收】：\n变脸龟对目标造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_ATK_COEF*ATK}）外加 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_MAXHP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害，并回复（{C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_ATK}）外加 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_LOST%}% 自身已损失生命值。"
msgstr "· Ranged form [Mind Disrupt]:\nTwo-Face Turtle deals ({C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_TRUE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_TRUE*ATK}) true damage to the target, applies {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds, and destroys {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_SHIELD_BREAK%}% of its shield.\n· Melee form [Absorb]:\nTwo-Face Turtle deals ({C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage and heals ({C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_ATK}) + {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_LOST%}% of its missing health."

msgid "被动：变脸龟登场后不再切换形态，始终远程作战，也没有切换后的强化攻击。变脸龟获得近战时的最大生命值、护甲、魔抗与护盾加成，攻击力同样降低 {C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY%}%。每受到一段攻击或技能伤害永久获得 1 护甲和 1 魔抗，各最多 {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_TOUGH_CAP}。\n\n主动：变脸龟发射 {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_BASE} 段灵能波，交替造成（{C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害和（{C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK}）真实伤害并击飞目标。每次释放后段数 +1，持续到本战场结束。"
msgstr "Passive: after spawning, Two-Face Turtle no longer switches forms and always fights at range, without the post-switch empowered attacks. It gains the melee form's max health, Armor, Magic Resist and shield bonuses, and its attack damage is likewise reduced by {C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY%}%. Each attack or ability hit it takes permanently grants 1 Armor and 1 Magic Resist, up to {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_TOUGH_CAP} each.\n\nActive: Two-Face Turtle fires {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_BASE} psi waves, alternating between ({C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK}) physical damage and ({C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK}) true damage, and knocking up the target. Each cast adds 1 more wave until the battle ends."

msgid "幽灵龟攻击目标，造成（{C:GhostSystem.BASIC_PHYS%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:GhostSystem.BASIC_PHYS*ATK}）物理伤害和（{C:GhostSystem.BASIC_TRUE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:GhostSystem.BASIC_TRUE*ATK}）真实伤害。"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:GhostSystem.BASIC_PHYS%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:GhostSystem.BASIC_PHYS*ATK}) physical damage and ({C:GhostSystem.BASIC_TRUE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:GhostSystem.BASIC_TRUE*ATK}) true damage."

msgid "幽灵龟对目标造成（{C:GhostSystem.RAID_MAGIC%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:GhostSystem.RAID_MAGIC*ATK}）魔法伤害并将其击飞，回复相当于该伤害 {C:GhostSystem.RAID_LIFESTEAL%}% 的生命值，并获得 {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE%}% 闪避，持续 {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle deals ({C:GhostSystem.RAID_MAGIC%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:GhostSystem.RAID_MAGIC*ATK}) magic damage to the target and knocks it up, heals for {C:GhostSystem.RAID_LIFESTEAL%}% of that damage, and gains {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE%}% Dodge for {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "幽灵龟对目标释放灵魂风暴，造成两段共（{C:GhostSystem.STORM_DMG%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:GhostSystem.STORM_DMG*ATK}）魔法伤害并施加 {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} 秒诅咒。\n若目标已被诅咒，转而造成（{C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSED_TRUE%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSED_TRUE*ATK}）真实伤害，并使诅咒持续时间延长 {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle unleashes a soul storm on the target, dealing ({C:GhostSystem.STORM_DMG%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:GhostSystem.STORM_DMG*ATK}) magic damage over two hits and cursing it for {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} seconds.\nIf the target is already cursed, it deals ({C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSED_TRUE%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSED_TRUE*ATK}) true damage instead and extends the Curse by {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "幽灵龟进入虚化状态，持续 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEC} 秒，期间受到的物理伤害降低 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}%，并对目标攻击 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEGMENTS} 段，共造成（{C:GhostSystem.PHASE_TOTAL%}%×攻击力 = {T:GhostSystem.PHASE_TOTAL*ATK}）真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">虚化期间龟能停止充能。</span>"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle becomes Phased for {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEC} seconds, taking {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}% less physical damage, and strikes the target {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEGMENTS} times for ({C:GhostSystem.PHASE_TOTAL%}% × Attack = {T:GhostSystem.PHASE_TOTAL*ATK}) total true damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Energy stops charging while Phased.</span>"

msgid "钻石龟攻击目标，造成（{C:DiamondSystem.CUT_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:DiamondSystem.CUT_ATK_COEF*ATK}）+（{C:DiamondSystem.CUT_DEF_COEF%}%×护甲({DEF}) = {E:DiamondSystem.CUT_DEF_COEF*DEF}）+（{C:DiamondSystem.CUT_MR_COEF%}%×魔抗({MR}) = {M:DiamondSystem.CUT_MR_COEF*MR}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Diamond Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:DiamondSystem.CUT_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:DiamondSystem.CUT_ATK_COEF*ATK}) + ({C:DiamondSystem.CUT_DEF_COEF%}% × Armor ({DEF}) = {E:DiamondSystem.CUT_DEF_COEF*DEF}) + ({C:DiamondSystem.CUT_MR_COEF%}% × Magic Resist ({MR}) = {M:DiamondSystem.CUT_MR_COEF*MR}) physical damage."

msgid "钻石龟获得（{C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_PCT}）护盾，持续 {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并提升固定数值的护甲（{C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF}）和魔抗（{C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF}），持续 {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_SEC} 秒。\n持有护盾期间龟能停止充能，护盾破裂或到期后恢复。"
msgstr "Diamond Turtle gains a ({C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_PCT}) shield for {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_SEC} seconds, plus flat Armor ({C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF}) and Magic Resist ({C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF}) for {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_SEC} seconds.\nEnergy stops charging while it holds the shield and resumes when the shield breaks or expires."

msgid "被动：钻石龟登场时自身护甲与魔抗再提升 {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SELF_RESIST_BONUS%}%。\n\n主动：钻石龟短暂蓄力后冲撞目标，造成（{C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF%}%×护甲({DEF}) = {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF*DEF}）外加（{C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF%}%×魔抗({MR}) = {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF*MR}）外加（{C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，将其击退并击飞，同时施加 {E:DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK+DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_RESIST*(DEF+MR)} 层流血与 {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_PCT%}% 减速，减速持续 {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Diamond Turtle's own Armor and Magic Resist increase by another {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SELF_RESIST_BONUS%}%.\n\nActive: Diamond Turtle briefly charges, then rams the target, dealing ({C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF%}% × Armor ({DEF}) = {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF*DEF}) + ({C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF%}% × Magic Resist ({MR}) = {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF*MR}) + ({C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage, knocking it back and up, and applying {E:DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK+DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_RESIST*(DEF+MR)} Bleed and a {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_PCT%}% slow for {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "财神龟攻击目标，造成（{C:FortuneSystem.SWORD_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力 + {C:FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF%}%×攻击力×金币数 = {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_ATK_COEF + ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF*goldCoins}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle attacks the target, dealing ({C:FortuneSystem.SWORD_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack + {C:FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF%}% × Attack × Gold = {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_ATK_COEF + ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF*goldCoins}) physical damage."

msgid "财神龟掷骰子获得 {C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MIN}~{C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MAX} 枚金币，回复（{C:FortuneSystem.DICE_HEAL_PCT%}%×最大生命值({HP}) = {E:HP*FortuneSystem.DICE_HEAL_PCT}）生命值。"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle rolls dice for {C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MIN}–{C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MAX} Gold and heals ({C:FortuneSystem.DICE_HEAL_PCT%}% × Max Health ({HP}) = {E:HP*FortuneSystem.DICE_HEAL_PCT})."

msgid "财神龟蓄力后逐枚投出全部金币，每枚造成（{C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF}）物理伤害和（{C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {T:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF}）真实伤害。目标阵亡时改投最近的敌人，投币期间免疫控制。\n首次释放时获得等于金币数的护盾，持续 {C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每个战场只能投一次。此后本技能变为：消耗 {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_COST} 龟能，获得金币数 ×{C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_MULT} 的护盾，持续 {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，不消耗金币，没有金币时不释放。持有该护盾期间龟能停止充能。</span>"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle charges up, then throws all its Gold one coin at a time. Each coin deals ({C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF}) physical damage and ({C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {T:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF}) true damage. If the target dies, it switches to the nearest enemy. Immune to crowd control while throwing.\nThe first cast grants a shield equal to its Gold for {C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">It can only throw once per battle. After that, this ability becomes: spend {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_COST} Energy to gain a Gold × {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_MULT} shield for {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_SEC} seconds without spending Gold; it won't cast with no Gold. Energy stops charging while it holds that shield.</span>"

msgid "财神龟首次释放时随机获得 1 件 1~3 费的 1★ 临时装备，龟能消耗随之变为 {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST}。\n之后每次释放使该装备提升 1 星，升至 {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_MAX_STAR}★ 后龟能消耗降至 {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST_MAXED}，此后每次释放回复（{C:FortuneSystem.BUY_FULL_HEAL_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*FortuneSystem.BUY_FULL_HEAL_COEF}）生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">临时装备不占背包栏位，战斗结束后消失。</span>"
msgstr "On its first cast, Fortune Turtle gains a random 1–3 cost 1★ temporary item, and its Energy cost becomes {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST}.\nEach later cast raises that item by 1 star. At {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_MAX_STAR}★, the Energy cost drops to {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST_MAXED}, and each cast from then on heals ({C:FortuneSystem.BUY_FULL_HEAL_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*FortuneSystem.BUY_FULL_HEAL_COEF}).\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Temporary items take no Inventory slot and disappear after the battle.</span>"

msgid "赛博龟登场时获得 {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE} 层充能与 {C:CyberSystem.AI_MOVE_UP%}% 移动速度。近战敌人靠近时，赛博龟消耗 1 层充能冲刺躲开。\n每次释放获得 1 层充能，并冲刺到射程内合适的距离。"
msgstr "On spawn, Cyber Turtle gains {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE} charges and {C:CyberSystem.AI_MOVE_UP%}% move speed. When a melee enemy closes in, it spends 1 charge to dash away.\nEach cast grants 1 charge and dashes to a good spot within range."

msgid "水晶龟受到的魔法伤害降低 {C:CrystalSystem.MAGIC_DR%}%。\n水晶龟的攻击为目标叠加结晶印记，满 {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成目标 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并使其魔抗降低 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle takes {C:CrystalSystem.MAGIC_DR%}% less magic damage.\nIts attacks apply Crystal Marks to targets. At {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} stacks, they detonate for magic damage equal to {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health and reduce its Magic Resist by {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "水晶龟刺出水晶刺，造成 {N:CrystalSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害外加目标 {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_MAXHP_MAGIC%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并叠加 {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_STACKS} 层结晶印记。"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle thrusts a crystal spike, dealing {N:CrystalSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage plus {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_MAXHP_MAGIC%}% of the target's max health as magic damage, and applying {C:CrystalSystem.BASIC_STACKS} Crystal Mark stacks."

msgid "水晶龟竖起水晶壁垒，获得 {E:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_ATK*ATK} 外加自身 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾，持续 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} 秒，并使全体友方的护甲与魔抗提升 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_TEAM_RESIST%}%，持续 {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} 秒。\n护盾结束或被打破时，水晶龟朝目标射出一条直线水晶刺，命中的敌人受到 {T:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_TRUE_COEF*ATK} 真实伤害，叠加 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_STACKS} 层结晶印记，被击飞 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒并被减速 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_PCT%}%，持续 {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle raises a Crystal Bulwark, gaining a {E:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_ATK*ATK} + {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_HP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} seconds, and giving all allies {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_TEAM_RESIST%}% Armor and Magic Resist for {C:CrystalSystem.BULWARK_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield ends or breaks, it sends a line of crystal spikes at the target. Enemies hit take {T:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_TRUE_COEF*ATK} true damage, gain {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_STACKS} Crystal Mark stacks, are knocked up for {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds, and are slowed by {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_PCT%}% for {C:CrystalSystem.SPIKE_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "水晶龟对目标周围的敌人连续释放 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_SEGMENTS} 段碎晶，共造成 {M:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAGIC*ATK} 魔法伤害和 {T:CrystalSystem.BURST_TRUE*ATK} 真实伤害，每一段都为命中的敌人叠加一层结晶印记。"
msgstr "Crystal Turtle releases {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_SEGMENTS} bursts of crystal shards at enemies around the target, dealing {M:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAGIC*ATK} magic damage and {T:CrystalSystem.BURST_TRUE*ATK} true damage in total. Each burst applies a Crystal Mark stack to enemies hit."

msgid "被动：水晶龟登场时召唤一颗水晶球。水晶球每 {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_IV} 秒射出一道贯穿光线，分两段对直线上的所有敌人共造成 {M:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，并叠加 {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_STACKS} 层结晶印记。\n\n主动：水晶龟射出一道相同的光线。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Crystal Turtle summons a crystal ball. Every {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_IV} seconds, the ball fires a piercing ray that deals {M:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_COEF*ATK} magic damage over two hits to all enemies on the line and applies {C:CrystalSystem.ORB_RAY_STACKS} Crystal Mark stacks.\n\nActive: Crystal Turtle fires the same ray."

msgid "宝箱龟根据造成的伤害积累财宝值，每达到一个阈值便从战利品池中随机获得一件装备，并回复生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\"><b>一大轮</b>内最多获得 {C:ChestSystem.CHEST_MAX_OPEN} 件装备，跨场累积，新的大轮开始时重置。\n</span>"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle builds Treasure from damage dealt. Each time it reaches a threshold, it gets a random item from the loot pool and heals.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Up to {C:ChestSystem.CHEST_MAX_OPEN} items per <b>Season</b>, building up across matches and resetting when a new Season starts.\n</span>"

msgid "宝箱龟朝目标猛砸宝箱，对前方短直线上的所有敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle slams its chest at the target, dealing {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK} physical damage to all enemies in a short line in front."

msgid "宝箱龟回复 {E:HP*ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_PCT} 生命值并获得 {E:ChestSystem.COUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾。\n宝箱龟每拥有 {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_PER_TREASURE} 点财宝值，治疗效果提升 {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_BONUS%}%。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle heals {E:HP*ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_PCT} and gains a {E:ChestSystem.COUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield.\nHealing increases by {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_HEAL_BONUS%}% for every {C:ChestSystem.COUNT_PER_TREASURE} Treasure it has."

msgid "宝箱龟在目标位置卷起财宝风暴，每 {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} 秒对范围内的敌人造成 {N:ChestSystem.STORM_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，共 {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICKS} 次。"
msgstr "Treasure Chest Turtle whips up a treasure storm at the target's location, dealing {N:ChestSystem.STORM_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage to enemies inside every {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} seconds, {C:ChestSystem.STORM_TICKS} times."

msgid "被动：宝箱龟每携带一件装备，便永久获得 {C:ChestSystem.GREED_ATK_PER_EQ%}% 攻击力与 {C:ChestSystem.GREED_HP_PER_EQ%}% 自身最大生命值。藏宝图开出的战利品也计入。\n\n主动：宝箱龟蓄力后朝一条直线发射能量射线，对直线上的所有敌人造成 {N:ChestSystem.CANNON_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并将其击飞。"
msgstr "Passive: for each item it carries, Treasure Chest Turtle permanently gains {C:ChestSystem.GREED_ATK_PER_EQ%}% attack damage and {C:ChestSystem.GREED_HP_PER_EQ%}% max health. Loot from the Treasure Map counts too.\n\nActive: Treasure Chest Turtle charges up and fires an energy ray in a line, dealing {N:ChestSystem.CANNON_COEF*ATK} physical damage to all enemies on it and knocking them up."

msgid "星际龟将攻击与技能造成伤害的 {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_GAIN%}% 转化为星能，星能上限为 {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_CAP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值。\n星际龟每次攻击或释放技能后，对目标额外造成相当于星能 {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_TRUE_PCT%}% 的真实伤害。\n若携带【星波】或【扭曲空间】，星能充满时释放强化版本并消耗全部星能。"
msgstr "Space Turtle converts {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_GAIN%}% of attack and ability damage into Star Power, capped at {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_CAP_PCT%}% of its max health.\nAfter each attack or ability, it deals bonus true damage to the target equal to {C:StarSystem.ENERGY_TRUE_PCT%}% of its Star Power.\nWith [Star Wave] or [Warp Space], full Star Power casts the empowered version and spends it all."

msgid "星际龟发射星光弹，造成 {M:StarSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK} 外加目标 {C:StarSystem.BOLT_CURHP%}% 当前生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Space Turtle fires a starlight shot, dealing {M:StarSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:StarSystem.BOLT_CURHP%}% of the target's current health as magic damage."

msgid "星际龟蓄力 {C:StarSystem.WORM_WINDUP} 秒后朝目标发射一个缓慢移动的虫洞。虫洞沿直线飞向场地边缘，将沿途的敌人吸向虫洞，附近的敌人被捕获并随虫洞移动。\n虫洞抵达边缘时爆炸，对被捕获的敌人与附近的敌人造成 {M:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，本战场每进行 1 秒，伤害提高 {C:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_PER_SEC%}%。"
msgstr "Space Turtle charges for {C:StarSystem.WORM_WINDUP} seconds, then launches a slow-moving wormhole at the target. It flies straight to the edge of the field, pulling in enemies along its path; nearby enemies are captured and carried along.\nWhen it reaches the edge, it explodes, dealing {M:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_COEF*ATK} magic damage to captured and nearby enemies, +{C:StarSystem.WORM_BOOM_PER_SEC%}% for every second the battle has lasted."

msgid "星际龟释放一圈向外扩散的星波，对命中的所有敌人造成 {M:StarSystem.WAVE_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。\n星能充满时，额外召唤一颗彗星砸向敌阵中心，消耗全部星能，对中心附近的敌人造成与消耗星能等量的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Space Turtle releases an expanding star wave, dealing {M:StarSystem.WAVE_COEF*ATK} magic damage to all enemies hit.\nWith full Star Power, it also calls a comet down on the center of the enemy group, spending all Star Power to deal that much true damage to enemies near the center."

msgid "星际龟在敌阵中心制造一个引力点，对周围的所有敌人造成 {M:StarSystem.WARP_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。\n星能充满时，引力点额外将范围内的敌人甩过中心点，落到对面一侧，并消耗全部星能。"
msgstr "Space Turtle creates a gravity point at the center of the enemy group, dealing {M:StarSystem.WARP_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage to all enemies around it.\nWith full Star Power, the gravity point also flings enemies in range across the center to the opposite side, spending all Star Power."

msgid "缩头乌龟登场时，从全部 A / B / C 稀有度的龟中随机召唤一只作为随从。随从拥有原龟 {C:HidingSystem.MINION_HP_SCALE%}% 的最大生命值与 {C:HidingSystem.MINION_ATK_SCALE%}% 的攻击力，带着原龟的被动与一个技能自主作战。"
msgstr "On spawn, Hiding Turtle summons a random A / B / C rarity turtle as a follower. The follower has {C:HidingSystem.MINION_HP_SCALE%}% of the original's max health and {C:HidingSystem.MINION_ATK_SCALE%}% of its attack damage, and fights on its own with the original's passive and one ability."

msgid "缩头乌龟攻击目标，造成 {N:HidingSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n每次攻击使自身永久获得 {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} 护甲与 {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} 魔抗，并获得 {E:ATK*HidingSystem.HARDEN_SHIELD} 护盾。"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:HidingSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nEach attack permanently grants {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} Armor and {C:HidingSystem.HARDEN_RESIST} Magic Resist, plus a {E:ATK*HidingSystem.HARDEN_SHIELD} shield."

msgid "缩头乌龟立即为随从提供 {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_MINION_ENERGY%}% 龟能，随后自身缩入壳中 {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_SEC} 秒，期间获得 {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_DR%}% 减伤。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">缩壳期间缩头乌龟无法攻击或移动。\n</span>"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle instantly gives its follower {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_MINION_ENERGY%}% Energy, then ducks into its shell for {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_SEC} seconds, gaining {C:HidingSystem.SHRINK_DR%}% Damage Reduction.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Hiding Turtle can't attack or move while in its shell.\n</span>"

msgid "缩头乌龟获得 {E:HP*HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_PCT} 护盾，持续 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并使护甲提升 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_UP%}%，持续 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期时，剩余护盾的 {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_CONVERT%}% 转化为生命值。持有此护盾期间龟能不再充能。"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle gains a {E:HP*HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_PCT} shield for {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_UP%}% Armor for {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_DEF_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield expires, {C:HidingSystem.DEFEND_CONVERT%}% of what's left turns into healing. Energy doesn't charge while it holds this shield."

msgid "缩头乌龟为随从注入力量，持续 {C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_SEC} 秒：攻击力 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%、护甲与魔抗 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%、生命偷取 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}% 和暴击率 +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_CRIT%}%。"
msgstr "Hiding Turtle empowers its follower for {C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_SEC} seconds: Attack +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%, Armor and Magic Resist +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}%, Lifesteal +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_STAT%}% and Crit Chance +{C:HidingSystem.EMPOWER_CRIT%}%."

msgid "无头龟撕咬目标，造成 {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害外加目标 {C:BasicConsts.HEADLESS_BITE_MAXHP%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle bites the target, dealing {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK} physical damage plus {C:BasicConsts.HEADLESS_BITE_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage."

msgid "无头龟发出咆哮威吓周围的所有敌人，施加恐惧 3 秒，期间敌人无法移动、攻击或释放技能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">恐惧期间敌人的龟能也停止充能。\n</span>"
msgstr "Headless Turtle roars at all nearby enemies, applying Fear for 3 seconds, during which they can't move, attack or cast abilities.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Feared enemies' Energy also stops charging.\n</span>"

msgid "无头龟从自身爆发出覆盖几乎整个战场的触须，持续 {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_SELF_STUN} 秒，期间无法移动或攻击，并获得 {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n触须伸出时，对敌人造成 {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_FOE*ATK} 物理伤害，对友军造成 {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_ALLY*ATK} 物理伤害，并眩晕所有命中的单位。\n触须收回时，对敌人造成 {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_FOE*ATK} 物理伤害，对友军造成 {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_ALLY*ATK} 物理伤害，并解除触须造成的眩晕。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle bursts out tendrils covering almost the whole battlefield for {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_SELF_STUN} seconds, unable to move or attack meanwhile, and gains {C:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal.\nWhen the tendrils lash out, they deal {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_FOE*ATK} physical damage to enemies and {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_PASS_ALLY*ATK} to allies, stunning every unit hit.\nWhen they pull back, they deal {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_FOE*ATK} physical damage to enemies and {N:HeadlessSystem.TENDRIL_DETACH_ALLY*ATK} to allies, ending the tendril stun."

msgid "无头龟的接下来 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS} 次攻击额外造成 {M:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加目标 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_CURHP_PCT%}% 当前生命值的魔法伤害。\n第 {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS} 次攻击后，无头龟挥出镰刀横扫正面 {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_ARC_DEG}° 锥形范围，击退命中的敌人并施加 {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_CURSE_SEC} 秒诅咒。诅咒每秒造成目标 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle's next {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS} attacks deal {M:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_CURHP_PCT%}% of the target's current health as bonus magic damage.\nAfter the {C:HeadlessSystem.SOUL_HITS}th attack, it sweeps its scythe across a {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_ARC_DEG}° cone in front, knocking back enemies hit and cursing them for {C:HeadlessSystem.SCYTHE_CURSE_SEC} seconds. Curse deals true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of the target's max health each second."

msgid "龟壳在登场后第 {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_1} 秒与第 {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_2} 秒各自动觉醒一次，每次使六项属性各提升 {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}%，暴击率提升 {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_CRIT%}%。\n龟壳受到伤害时将伤害转化为储能，储能 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_STORE_SEC} 秒后发出一道缓慢移动的冲击波，对触碰到的敌人造成相当于储能 {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_DMG_PCT%}% 的物理伤害，\n同时获得相当于储能 {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_SHIELD_PCT%}% 的护盾，随后进入 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_CD_SEC} 秒冷却，之后重新开始储能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">储能来自受到的伤害，上限为自身最大生命值的 {C:ShellSystem.STORE_CAP_PCT%}%。护盾在 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_SHIELD_SEC} 秒内逐渐衰减。\n</span>"
msgstr "Turtle Shell awakens automatically at {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_1} and {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_AT_2} seconds after spawning, each time raising six stats by {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_PCT%}% and Crit Chance by {C:ShellSystem.AWAKEN_CRIT%}%.\nTurtle Shell turns damage taken into Stored Energy. After storing for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_STORE_SEC} seconds, it releases a slow-moving shockwave that deals physical damage equal to {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_DMG_PCT%}% of Stored Energy to enemies it touches,\nand gains a shield equal to {C:ShellSystem.RELEASE_SHIELD_PCT%}% of Stored Energy, then cools down for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_CD_SEC} seconds before storing again.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Stored Energy comes from damage taken, up to {C:ShellSystem.STORE_CAP_PCT%}% of max health. The shield decays over {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.SHELL_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\n</span>"

msgid "龟壳打击目标，造成 {N:ShellSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK} 伤害，伤害类型在物理与真实之间逐次交替，并对主目标周围的其他敌人造成 {C:ShellSystem.SPLASH_PCT%}% 的溅射伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">溅射伤害的类型与本次攻击相同。\n</span>"
msgstr "Turtle Shell strikes the target for {N:ShellSystem.BASIC_COEF*ATK} damage, alternating between physical and true each hit, and splashes {C:ShellSystem.SPLASH_PCT%}% of it to other enemies around the main target.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The splash has the same damage type as the attack.\n</span>"

msgid "龟壳随机复制敌方的 2 个技能并依次释放，每个技能只发挥 {C:ShellSystem.COPY_EFFECT%}% 的效果。"
msgstr "Turtle Shell copies 2 random enemy abilities and casts them in turn, each at {C:ShellSystem.COPY_EFFECT%}% effect."

msgid "龟壳夺取目标 {C:ShellSystem.ABSORB_PCT%}% 最大生命值：目标的最大生命值降低这一数值，龟壳的最大生命值与当前生命值增加这一数值。"
msgstr "Turtle Shell takes {C:ShellSystem.ABSORB_PCT%}% of the target's max health: the target's max health drops by that much, and Turtle Shell's max and current health rise by that much."

msgid "被动：龟壳 {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_IDLE_SEC} 秒内未受到伤害时进入潜影，变为不可选中。龟壳攻击或释放技能时解除潜影，范围伤害不会解除潜影。\n解除潜影后的首次攻击额外造成 {M:ShellSystem.STEALTH_BREAK_MAGIC*ATK} 魔法伤害，施加 {E:ShellSystem.STEALTH_POISON_MULT*ATK} 层中毒与 {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒。\n\n主动：龟壳朝目标方向飞行，对途经的敌人造成 {M:ShellSystem.DIVE_MAGIC*ATK} 魔法伤害并将其击退。龟壳沿途留下一条暗影火道，持续 {C:ShellSystem.BURN_LIFE} 秒，每 {C:ShellSystem.BURN_TICK_SEC} 秒对火道内的敌人施加 {E:ShellSystem.BURN_ATK_MULT*ATK} 层灼烧并减速 {C:ShellSystem.BURN_SLOW_PCT%}%。龟壳落地后进入潜影。"
msgstr "Passive: if Turtle Shell takes no damage for {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_IDLE_SEC} seconds, it enters Shadow and becomes untargetable. Attacking or casting ends Shadow; area damage doesn't.\nThe first attack after leaving Shadow deals {M:ShellSystem.STEALTH_BREAK_MAGIC*ATK} bonus magic damage and applies {E:ShellSystem.STEALTH_POISON_MULT*ATK} Poison and {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:ShellSystem.STEALTH_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds.\n\nActive: Turtle Shell flies toward the target, dealing {M:ShellSystem.DIVE_MAGIC*ATK} magic damage to enemies it passes and knocking them back. It leaves a trail of shadow fire for {C:ShellSystem.BURN_LIFE} seconds that applies {E:ShellSystem.BURN_ATK_MULT*ATK} Burn and a {C:ShellSystem.BURN_SLOW_PCT%}% slow to enemies inside every {C:ShellSystem.BURN_TICK_SEC} seconds. Turtle Shell enters Shadow after landing."

msgid "竹叶龟每 {C:BambooSystem.GROW_CD} 秒蓄力一次，下次攻击额外造成 {M:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_ATK_COEF+HP*BambooSystem.GROW_HP_PCT} 魔法伤害，回复 {C:BambooSystem.GROW_HEAL_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值并永久提升最大生命值（本大轮内跨场累积）。"
msgstr "Every {C:BambooSystem.GROW_CD} seconds, Bamboo Turtle charges up. Its next attack deals {M:ATK*BambooSystem.GROW_ATK_COEF+HP*BambooSystem.GROW_HP_PCT} bonus magic damage, heals {C:BambooSystem.GROW_HEAL_PCT%}% of its max health, and permanently raises its max health (building up across matches this Season)."

msgid "竹叶龟甩出一道叶刃，造成 {N:BambooSystem.LEAF_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*BambooSystem.LEAF_MAXHP_PCT} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle flings a leaf blade, dealing {N:BambooSystem.LEAF_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*BambooSystem.LEAF_MAXHP_PCT} physical damage."

msgid "竹叶龟回复 {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SELF} 生命值，并为每名龟队友提供其 {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_ALLY_SHIELD%}% 最大生命值的护盾，持续 {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。若没有其他龟队友存活，转而回复 {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SOLO} 生命值。"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle heals {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SELF} and gives each turtle teammate a shield equal to {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_ALLY_SHIELD%}% of its max health for {C:BambooSystem.REGEN_SHIELD_SEC} seconds. If no other turtle teammates are alive, it heals {E:HP*BambooSystem.REGEN_SOLO} instead."

msgid "竹叶龟伸出竹藤钩住全场最远的敌人，造成 {N:BambooSystem.SMACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并眩晕 {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_STUN} 秒，同时将其拉拽到自己身前。\n被钩中的敌人陷入冰寒，攻击力和移动速度各降低 {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle hooks the farthest enemy on the field with a bamboo vine, dealing {N:BambooSystem.SMACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage, stunning it for {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_STUN} seconds and pulling it in front of itself.\nThe hooked enemy is Chilled, losing {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_DOWN%}% attack damage and move speed for {C:BambooSystem.SMACK_CHILL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "竹叶龟以目标为中心蓄力 {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_WINDUP} 秒，随后竹刺破地而出，对范围内的敌人造成 {N:BambooSystem.SPIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值的物理伤害，并将其击飞 {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Bamboo Turtle charges for {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_WINDUP} seconds around the target, then bamboo spikes burst from the ground, dealing {N:BambooSystem.SPIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its own max health as physical damage to enemies in the area and knocking them up for {C:BambooSystem.SPIKE_KNOCK_SEC} seconds."

msgid "天使龟每段攻击命中敌人时，额外造成 {C:AngelSystem.JUDGE_CURHP%}% 目标当前生命值的魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">选择【平等】时，其每段伤害也会触发此效果。</span>"
msgstr "Each of Angel Turtle's attack hits deals bonus magic damage equal to {C:AngelSystem.JUDGE_CURHP%}% of the target's current health.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With [Equality], each of its hits also triggers this.</span>"

msgid "天使龟攻击目标，造成 {N:AngelSystem.VERDICT_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Angel Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:AngelSystem.VERDICT_COEF*ATK} physical damage."

msgid "被动：天使龟首次死亡时以自身 {C:AngelSystem.REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值复活一次。\n\n主动：天使龟使当前输出最高的己方单位获得 {E:AngelSystem.BLESS_SHIELD*ATK} 护盾和 {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_HASTE%}% 攻击速度，持续 {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: the first time Angel Turtle dies, it revives once with {C:AngelSystem.REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health.\n\nActive: Angel Turtle gives the ally with the highest damage dealt a {E:AngelSystem.BLESS_SHIELD*ATK} shield and {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_HASTE%}% attack speed for {C:AngelSystem.BLESS_SEC} seconds."

msgid "天使龟对目标斩出 {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_SEGMENTS} 道圣光，共造成 {N:AngelSystem.EQUAL_TOTAL*ATK} 物理伤害，本次施法获得 {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n若目标稀有度为 A 级及以上，额外造成 {T:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_LOST%}% 目标已损失生命值的真实伤害。\n每道圣光和对 A 级及以上目标的额外伤害都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时与命中时的装备效果。"
msgstr "Angel Turtle slashes the target with {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_SEGMENTS} strokes of holy light, dealing {N:AngelSystem.EQUAL_TOTAL*ATK} total physical damage, with {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal for this cast.\nIf the target's rarity is A or higher, it deals {T:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_COEF*ATK} + {C:AngelSystem.EQUAL_JUDGE_LOST%}% of the target's missing health as bonus true damage.\nEach stroke and the bonus damage against A-or-higher targets count as attacks, triggering on-attack and on-hit item effects."

msgid "寒冰龟射出冰锥，交替造成 {P:IceSystem.CONE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害或魔法伤害，每次攻击获得 1 层冰柱。\n每层冰柱提供 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% 护甲和 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% 魔抗，最多 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} 层，每个战场结束时重置。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">若选择【冰霜】，每层冰柱使其范围 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}%、持续时间 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} 秒。</span>"
msgstr "Ice Turtle fires icicles that alternate between {P:IceSystem.CONE_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical and magic damage, gaining 1 Ice Pillar stack per attack.\nEach Ice Pillar stack grants {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% Armor and {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_DEFMR%}% Magic Resist, up to {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} stacks, reset at the end of each battle.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With [Frost], each Ice Pillar stack gives it +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}% size and +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} seconds of duration.</span>"

msgid "寒冰龟在目标处降下冰霜领域，持续 {C:IceSystem.FROST_BASE_SEC} 秒。领域内的敌人魔抗降低 {C:IceSystem.FROST_MR_DOWN%}%，并每 {C:IceSystem.FROST_TICK_SEC} 秒受到 {M:IceSystem.FROST_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。\n每层冰柱使领域范围 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}%、持续时间 +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ice Turtle brings down a frost zone at the target for {C:IceSystem.FROST_BASE_SEC} seconds. Enemies inside lose {C:IceSystem.FROST_MR_DOWN%}% Magic Resist and take {M:IceSystem.FROST_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage every {C:IceSystem.FROST_TICK_SEC} seconds.\nEach Ice Pillar stack gives the zone +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_RADIUS%}% size and +{C:IceSystem.ICICLE_FROST_SEC} seconds of duration."

msgid "寒冰龟冰封目标，造成 {M:IceSystem.FREEZE_DMG*ATK} 魔法伤害，并回复相当于自身护甲与魔抗之和的生命值。\n拥有 {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} 层冰柱后，额外眩晕目标 {C:IceSystem.FREEZE_STUN_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ice Turtle freezes the target, dealing {M:IceSystem.FREEZE_DMG*ATK} magic damage and healing for its combined Armor and Magic Resist.\nAt {C:IceSystem.ICICLE_MAX} Ice Pillar stacks, it also stuns the target for {C:IceSystem.FREEZE_STUN_SEC} seconds."

msgid "寒冰龟使包括自身在内的全体友军获得 {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_PCT*HP} 护盾，持续 {C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期、被打破或持盾者阵亡时爆裂，对其附近的敌人造成 {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">场上没有其他友军时，护盾为 {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SOLO_PCT*HP}，爆裂伤害为 {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_SOLO_COEF*ATK}。</span>"
msgstr "Ice Turtle gives all allies, including itself, a {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_PCT*HP} shield for {C:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhen a shield expires, breaks or its holder dies, it bursts, dealing {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_COEF*ATK} magic damage to nearby enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">With no other allies on the field, the shield is {E:IceSystem.TEAM_SHIELD_SOLO_PCT*HP} and the burst deals {M:IceSystem.TEAM_BURST_SOLO_COEF*ATK}.</span>"

msgid "忍者龟获得 {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT%}% 暴击率、{C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT_DMG%}% 暴击伤害和 {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_ARMOR_PEN} 护甲穿透。\n附近有敌人时，忍者龟自动冲刺斩击最近的敌人，对其造成 {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_MAIN_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，对路径上的其他敌人造成 {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_SIDE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并将命中的敌人击飞 {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">同一敌人 {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_TARGET_CD} 秒内只会被冲刺一次。</span>"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle gains {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT%}% Crit Chance, {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_CRIT_DMG%}% Crit Damage and {C:NinjaSystem.INSTINCT_ARMOR_PEN} Armor Pen.\nWith enemies nearby, Ninja Turtle automatically dashes through the nearest one, dealing {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_MAIN_COEF*ATK} physical damage to it and {N:NinjaSystem.DASH_SIDE_COEF*ATK} physical damage to other enemies in the path, knocking those hit up for {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The same enemy can be dashed at most once every {C:NinjaSystem.DASH_TARGET_CD} seconds.</span>"

msgid "忍者龟斩击目标，造成 {N:NinjaSystem.SLASH_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并施加 {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK} 层流血，暴击时转而施加 {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK_CRIT*ATK} 层。"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle slashes the target, dealing {N:NinjaSystem.SLASH_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applying {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK} Bleed, or {E:NinjaSystem.SLASH_BLEED_ATK_CRIT*ATK} on a crit."

msgid "被动：忍者龟获得 {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_DODGE%}% 闪避和 {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_CRIT%}% 暴击率。\n\n主动：忍者龟向目标投掷手里剑，造成 {N:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。暴击时其中 {E:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_BASE+NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_PER_LV*LV}% 转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Passive: Ninja Turtle gains {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_DODGE%}% Dodge and {C:NinjaSystem.FOOT_CRIT%}% Crit Chance.\n\nActive: Ninja Turtle throws a shuriken at the target, dealing {N:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_COEF*ATK} physical damage. On a crit, {E:NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_BASE+NinjaSystem.SHURIKEN_TRUE_PER_LV*LV}% of it becomes true damage."

msgid "忍者龟扔出炸弹，对落点附近的敌人造成 {N:NinjaSystem.BOMB_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并使其护甲降低 {C:NinjaSystem.BOMB_DEF_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle throws a bomb that deals {N:NinjaSystem.BOMB_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage to enemies near where it lands and reduces their Armor by {C:NinjaSystem.BOMB_DEF_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "忍者龟获得 {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN} 护甲穿透，持续 {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN_SEC} 秒，随后闪现到全场最远的敌人身后背刺 {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS} 段，共造成 {N:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEG_COEF*ATK*NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS} 物理伤害，之后继续攻击该敌人。"
msgstr "Ninja Turtle gains {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN} Armor Pen for {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_PEN_SEC} seconds, then blinks behind the farthest enemy on the field and backstabs it {C:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS} times for {N:NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEG_COEF*ATK*NinjaSystem.BACKSTAB_SEGMENTS} total physical damage, then keeps attacking that enemy."

msgid "变脸龟有远程和近战两种形态。释放技能时自动切换形态，再施放该形态的技能。\n近战形态获得额外的最大生命值、护甲、魔抗和护盾，但攻击力降低。\n切换形态后的下一次攻击会得到强化。"
msgstr "Two-Face Turtle has a ranged form and a melee form. Casting an ability automatically switches forms, then casts that form's ability.\nMelee form gains bonus max health, Armor, Magic Resist and a shield, but loses attack damage.\nThe next attack after switching forms is empowered."

msgid "变脸龟远程形态射出灵能弹，近战形态挥砍，分别造成 {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_RANGED_COEF*ATK} 和 {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_MELEE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Two-Face Turtle fires a psi bolt in ranged form and slashes in melee form, dealing {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_RANGED_COEF*ATK} and {N:TwoHeadSystem.BASIC_MELEE_COEF*ATK} physical damage respectively."

msgid "远程形态：变脸龟射出灵能炮弹，命中第一个敌人时爆炸，对附近的敌人造成 {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_COEF*ATK} 外加 {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP*100+TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP_PER_ATK*100*ATK}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n近战形态：变脸龟跃向目标并锤击地面，对附近的敌人造成 {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_COEF*ATK+HP*TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_SELF_MAXHP} 物理伤害，并获得相当于对目标所造成伤害 {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ranged form: Two-Face Turtle fires a psi shell that explodes on the first enemy hit, dealing {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_COEF*ATK} + {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP*100+TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_RANGED_MAXHP_PER_ATK*100*ATK}% of the target's max health as physical damage to nearby enemies.\nMelee form: Two-Face Turtle leaps at the target and hammers the ground, dealing {N:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_COEF*ATK+HP*TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_MELEE_SELF_MAXHP} physical damage to nearby enemies, and gains a shield equal to {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_PCT%}% of the damage dealt to the target for {C:TwoHeadSystem.STRIKE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "远程形态：变脸龟对目标造成 {T:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_TRUE*ATK} 真实伤害，施加 {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒，并破坏其 {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_SHIELD_BREAK%}% 护盾。\n近战形态：变脸龟对目标造成 {N:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_MAXHP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害，并回复 {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_ATK} 外加 {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_LOST%}% 自身已损失生命值。"
msgstr "Ranged form: Two-Face Turtle deals {T:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_TRUE*ATK} true damage to the target, applies {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds, and destroys {C:TwoHeadSystem.DISRUPT_SHIELD_BREAK%}% of its shield.\nMelee form: Two-Face Turtle deals {N:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage and heals {E:ATK*TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_ATK} + {C:TwoHeadSystem.ABSORB_HEAL_LOST%}% of its missing health."

msgid "被动：变脸龟登场后不再切换形态，始终远程作战，也没有切换后的强化攻击。变脸龟获得近战时的最大生命值、护甲、魔抗与护盾加成，攻击力同样降低 {C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY%}%。每受到一段攻击或技能伤害永久获得 1 护甲和 1 魔抗，各最多 {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_TOUGH_CAP}。\n\n主动：变脸龟发射 {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_BASE} 段灵能波，交替造成 {N:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害和 {T:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK} 真实伤害并击飞目标。每次释放后段数 +1，持续到本战场结束。"
msgstr "Passive: after spawning, Two-Face Turtle no longer switches forms and always fights at range, without the post-switch empowered attacks. It gains the melee form's max health, Armor, Magic Resist and shield bonuses, and its attack damage is likewise reduced by {C:TwoHeadSystem.MELEE_ATK_PENALTY%}%. Each attack or ability hit it takes permanently grants 1 Armor and 1 Magic Resist, up to {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_TOUGH_CAP} each.\n\nActive: Two-Face Turtle fires {C:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_BASE} psi waves, alternating between {N:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK} physical damage and {T:TwoHeadSystem.FUSION_WAVE_COEF*ATK} true damage, and knocking up the target. Each cast adds 1 more wave until the battle ends."

msgid "幽灵龟攻击目标，造成 {N:GhostSystem.BASIC_PHYS*ATK} 物理伤害和 {T:GhostSystem.BASIC_TRUE*ATK} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:GhostSystem.BASIC_PHYS*ATK} physical damage and {T:GhostSystem.BASIC_TRUE*ATK} true damage."

msgid "幽灵龟对目标造成 {M:GhostSystem.RAID_MAGIC*ATK} 魔法伤害并将其击飞，回复相当于该伤害 {C:GhostSystem.RAID_LIFESTEAL%}% 的生命值，并获得 {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE%}% 闪避，持续 {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle deals {M:GhostSystem.RAID_MAGIC*ATK} magic damage to the target and knocks it up, heals for {C:GhostSystem.RAID_LIFESTEAL%}% of that damage, and gains {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE%}% Dodge for {C:GhostSystem.RAID_DODGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "幽灵龟对目标释放灵魂风暴，造成两段共 {M:GhostSystem.STORM_DMG*ATK} 魔法伤害并施加 {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} 秒诅咒。\n若目标已被诅咒，转而造成 {T:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSED_TRUE*ATK} 真实伤害，并使诅咒持续时间延长 {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle unleashes a soul storm on the target, dealing {M:GhostSystem.STORM_DMG*ATK} magic damage over two hits and cursing it for {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} seconds.\nIf the target is already cursed, it deals {T:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSED_TRUE*ATK} true damage instead and extends the Curse by {C:GhostSystem.STORM_CURSE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "幽灵龟进入虚化状态，持续 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEC} 秒，期间受到的物理伤害降低 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}%，并对目标攻击 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEGMENTS} 段，共造成 {T:GhostSystem.PHASE_TOTAL*ATK} 真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">虚化期间龟能停止充能。</span>"
msgstr "Ghost Turtle becomes Phased for {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEC} seconds, taking {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}% less physical damage, and strikes the target {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_SEGMENTS} times for {T:GhostSystem.PHASE_TOTAL*ATK} total true damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Energy stops charging while Phased.</span>"

msgid "钻石龟攻击目标，造成 {N:DiamondSystem.CUT_ATK_COEF*ATK+DiamondSystem.CUT_DEF_COEF*DEF+DiamondSystem.CUT_MR_COEF*MR} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Diamond Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:DiamondSystem.CUT_ATK_COEF*ATK+DiamondSystem.CUT_DEF_COEF*DEF+DiamondSystem.CUT_MR_COEF*MR} physical damage."

msgid "钻石龟获得 {E:HP*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_PCT} 护盾，持续 {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并提升 {E:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF} 护甲和 {M:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF} 魔抗，持续 {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Diamond Turtle gains a {E:HP*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_PCT} shield for {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_SHIELD_SEC} seconds, plus {E:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF} Armor and {M:ATK*DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_COEF} Magic Resist for {C:DiamondSystem.FORTIFY_RESIST_SEC} seconds."

msgid "被动：钻石龟登场时自身护甲与魔抗再提升 {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SELF_RESIST_BONUS%}%。\n\n主动：钻石龟短暂蓄力后冲撞目标，造成 {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF*(DEF+MR)+DiamondSystem.SMASH_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，将其击退并击飞，同时施加 {E:DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK+DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_RESIST*(DEF+MR)} 层流血与 {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_PCT%}% 减速，减速持续 {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Diamond Turtle's own Armor and Magic Resist increase by another {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SELF_RESIST_BONUS%}%.\n\nActive: Diamond Turtle briefly charges, then rams the target, dealing {N:DiamondSystem.SMASH_RESIST_COEF*(DEF+MR)+DiamondSystem.SMASH_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage, knocking it back and up, and applying {E:DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_ATK*ATK+DiamondSystem.SMASH_BLEED_RESIST*(DEF+MR)} Bleed and a {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_PCT%}% slow for {C:DiamondSystem.SMASH_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "财神龟攻击目标，造成 {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_ATK_COEF + ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF*goldCoins} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_ATK_COEF + ATK*FortuneSystem.SWORD_GOLD_COEF*goldCoins} physical damage."

msgid "财神龟掷出骰子，获得 {C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MIN}~{C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MAX} 枚金币并回复 {E:HP*FortuneSystem.DICE_HEAL_PCT} 生命值。"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle rolls dice for {C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MIN}–{C:FortuneSystem.DICE_MAX} Gold and heals {E:HP*FortuneSystem.DICE_HEAL_PCT}."

msgid "财神龟蓄力后逐枚投出全部金币，每枚造成 {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF} 物理伤害和 {T:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF} 真实伤害。目标阵亡时改投最近的敌人，投币期间免疫控制。\n首次释放时获得等于金币数的护盾，持续 {C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每个战场只能投一次。此后本技能变为：消耗 {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_COST} 龟能，获得金币数 ×{C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_MULT} 的护盾，持续 {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，不消耗金币，没有金币时不释放。持有该护盾期间龟能停止充能。</span>"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle charges up, then throws all its Gold one coin at a time. Each coin deals {N:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF} physical damage and {T:ATK*FortuneSystem.ALLIN_COIN_COEF} true damage. If the target dies, it switches to the nearest enemy. Immune to crowd control while throwing.\nThe first cast grants a shield equal to its Gold for {C:FortuneSystem.ALLIN_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">It can only throw once per battle. After that, this ability becomes: spend {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_COST} Energy to gain a Gold × {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_MULT} shield for {C:FortuneSystem.GOLD_SHIELD_SEC} seconds without spending Gold; it won't cast with no Gold. Energy stops charging while it holds that shield.</span>"

msgid "财神龟首次释放时随机获得 1 件 1~3 费的 1★ 临时装备，龟能消耗随之变为 {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST}。\n之后每次释放使该装备提升 1 星，升至 {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_MAX_STAR}★ 后龟能消耗降至 {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST_MAXED}，此后每次释放回复 {E:ATK*FortuneSystem.BUY_FULL_HEAL_COEF} 生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">临时装备不占背包栏位，战斗结束后消失。</span>"
msgstr "On its first cast, Fortune Turtle gains a random 1–3 cost 1★ temporary item, and its Energy cost becomes {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST}.\nEach later cast raises that item by 1 star. At {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_MAX_STAR}★, the Energy cost drops to {C:FortuneSystem.BUY_COST_MAXED}, and each cast from then on heals {E:ATK*FortuneSystem.BUY_FULL_HEAL_COEF}.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Temporary items take no Inventory slot and disappear after the battle.</span>"

