msgid "拖到友方单位上使用，立即回复 (50 + 10% 目标最大生命值) 生命值。"
msgstr "Drag onto an ally to use: instantly heals (50 + 10% of the target's max health)."

msgid "拖到友方单位上使用，其所有技能的剩余冷却时间 -1 回合 (最低 0)。"
msgstr "Drag onto an ally to use: reduces the remaining cooldown of all its abilities by 1 turn (minimum 0)."

msgid "拖到敌方单位上使用，造成 60 物理伤害 (不归属任何龟，不触发生命偷取与 on-hit 链，仅按目标护甲减免)。"
msgstr "Drag onto an enemy to use: deals 60 physical damage (not attributed to any turtle, doesn't trigger Lifesteal or on-hit effects, reduced only by the target's armor)."

msgid "拖到友方单位上使用，攻击力 +25%，持续 3 回合。"
msgstr "Drag onto an ally to use: +25% attack damage for 3 turns."

msgid "拖到友方单位上使用，立即添加 +80 护盾。"
msgstr "Drag onto an ally to use: instantly grants an 80 shield."

msgid "拖到友方单位上使用，立即回复 15% 目标最大生命值。"
msgstr "Drag onto an ally to use: instantly heals 15% of the target's max health."

msgid "拖到友方单位上使用，立即清除身上所有负面状态。\n※ 负面效果包括：灼烧 / 中毒 / 流血 / 诅咒 DoT / 冰寒 / 攻防魔抗削减 / 治疗削减 / 易伤标记 / 泡泡束缚"
msgstr "Drag onto an ally to use: instantly removes all debuffs.\n※ Debuffs include: Burn / Poison / Bleed / Curse DoT / Chill / Attack, Armor and Magic Resist reduction / Grievous Wounds / Vulnerable mark / Bubble Bind"

msgid "拖到敌方单位上使用，标记 2 回合，期间受到的所有伤害 +20% (任何来源)。"
msgstr "Drag onto an enemy to use: marks it for 2 turns, during which it takes 20% more damage from all sources."

msgid "登场时召唤【斧头】。\n主动：【斧头】会持续积累龟能，龟能达到 {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_ENERGY} 时，回复自身 {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_HEAL_PCT%}% 最大生命值，并获得自身 {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_SHIELD_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾。\n被动：【斧头】的攻击会窃取目标 {C:AxeEvolution.SHIELD_STEAL_PCT%}% 的护盾，转为自身的护盾。\n【砍伐经验】：每次购买小木斧获得 {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_BUY} 点，持有小木斧时每场对局结束后获得 {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_MATCH} 点，【斧头】每次参与击杀获得 {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_KILL} 点。\n小木斧获得 {C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[0]} 点【砍伐经验】后进化为【石斧】，之后再获得 {C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[1]}、{C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[2]}、{C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[3]} 点，依次进化为【铁斧】、【金斧】、【钻石斧】。每次进化，小木斧的售价提高 1 费。成为【钻石斧】后再获得 {C:AxeEvolution.FINAL_NEED} 点【砍伐经验】，可以在商店中选择一个最终造物。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">参与击杀：【斧头】击杀目标，或在目标阵亡前 {C:AxeEvolution.ASSIST_WINDOW} 秒内命中过该目标。\n只能持有 1 把小木斧，再次购买时转而获得 {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_BUY} 点砍伐经验。无法升星。\n每次进化时，超出的砍伐经验不计入下一次进化。\n选定最终造物后本大轮内不可更改，并且不再获得砍伐经验。每个大轮开始时，砍伐经验与进化全部重置。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, summons [Axe].\nActive: [Axe] keeps building Energy. At {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_ENERGY} Energy, it heals {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_HEAL_PCT%}% of its max health and gains a shield equal to {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_SHIELD_PCT%}% of its max health.\nPassive: [Axe]'s attacks steal {C:AxeEvolution.SHIELD_STEAL_PCT%}% of the target's shield as its own.\n[Chopping XP]: {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_BUY} for each Little Wooden Axe bought, {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_MATCH} after each match while holding one, and {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_KILL} each time [Axe] takes part in a kill.\nAt {C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[0]} [Chopping XP], the Little Wooden Axe evolves into [Stone Axe]; then at another {C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[1]}, {C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[2]} and {C:AxeEvolution.STAGE_NEEDS[3]}, into [Iron Axe], [Gold Axe] and [Diamond Axe]. Each evolution raises its sell price by 1. Once it's a [Diamond Axe], another {C:AxeEvolution.FINAL_NEED} [Chopping XP] lets you choose a Final Creation in the shop.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Taking part in a kill: [Axe] kills the target, or hit it within {C:AxeEvolution.ASSIST_WINDOW} seconds before it died.\nYou can hold only 1 Little Wooden Axe; buying another gives {C:AxeEvolution.EXP_ON_BUY} Chopping XP instead. It can't be starred up.\nExcess Chopping XP doesn't carry over to the next evolution.\nOnce chosen, the Final Creation can't be changed this Season and no more Chopping XP is earned. Chopping XP and evolutions reset at the start of each Season.</span>"

msgid "小木斧每次进化，【斧头】额外获得 {C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_HP} 生命值、{C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_ATK} 攻击力、{C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_DEF} 护甲和 {C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_MR} 魔抗，并获得以下效果：\n【石斧】：每 {C:AxeEvolution.SMASH_IV} 秒，【斧头】的下一次攻击额外造成（{C:AxeEvolution.SMASH_ATK%}% 攻击力）物理伤害，并将目标击飞和短暂击退。\n【铁斧】：【斧头】每第 2 次攻击变为竖劈，额外造成目标 {C:AxeEvolution.CLEAVE_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害，并施加 {C:AxeEvolution.CLEAVE_BLEED} 层流血。\n【金斧】：【斧头】的攻击在 {C:AxeEvolution.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° 横扫和竖劈之间交替，横扫命中前方所有敌人。每次攻击命中获得 1 层【效率】，持续 {C:AxeEvolution.EFF_DUR} 秒，可无限叠加，叠加时刷新持续时间。每层【效率】提供 {C:AxeEvolution.EFF_ASPD%}% 攻击速度和 {C:AxeEvolution.EFF_MOVE%}% 移动速度。\n【钻石斧】：龟能达到 {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_ENERGY} 时，【斧头】还会开始【蓄力猛砸】，蓄力 {C:AxeEvolution.CHARGE_TIME} 秒，期间获得 {C:AxeEvolution.CHARGE_DR%}% 减伤。蓄力结束时砸下，对前方区域内的每个敌人造成（{C:AxeEvolution.SLAM_ATK%}% 攻击力）物理伤害，将其击飞并眩晕 {C:AxeEvolution.SLAM_STUN} 秒。"
msgstr "Each time the Little Wooden Axe evolves, [Axe] gains {C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_HP} Health, {C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_ATK} Attack, {C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_DEF} Armor and {C:AxeEvolution.PASSIVE_MR} Magic Resist, plus these effects:\n[Stone Axe]: every {C:AxeEvolution.SMASH_IV} seconds, [Axe]'s next attack deals ({C:AxeEvolution.SMASH_ATK%}% Attack) bonus physical damage and knocks the target up and briefly back.\n[Iron Axe]: every 2nd attack from [Axe] becomes a downward cleave that deals bonus true damage equal to {C:AxeEvolution.CLEAVE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health and applies {C:AxeEvolution.CLEAVE_BLEED} Bleed.\n[Gold Axe]: [Axe]'s attacks alternate between a {C:AxeEvolution.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° sweep, which hits all enemies in front, and a downward cleave. Each attack hit grants 1 [Efficiency] stack for {C:AxeEvolution.EFF_DUR} seconds, stacking infinitely and refreshing on each stack. Each [Efficiency] stack grants {C:AxeEvolution.EFF_ASPD%}% attack speed and {C:AxeEvolution.EFF_MOVE%}% move speed.\n[Diamond Axe]: at {C:AxeEvolution.ACTIVE_ENERGY} Energy, [Axe] also starts a [Charged Slam], charging for {C:AxeEvolution.CHARGE_TIME} seconds with {C:AxeEvolution.CHARGE_DR%}% Damage Reduction. When the charge ends, it slams down, dealing ({C:AxeEvolution.SLAM_ATK%}% Attack) physical damage to every enemy in the area in front, knocking them up and stunning them for {C:AxeEvolution.SLAM_STUN} seconds."

msgid "【亡灵之斧】：额外获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_HP} 生命值、{C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_ATK} 攻击力、{C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_DEF} 护甲和 {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_DEF} 魔抗。附近的敌人每秒受到其 {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_RING_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。附近每有一个敌人，【斧头】每秒回复自身 {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_LEECH_PCT%}% 最大生命值。【斧头】阵亡 {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_REVIVE_DELAY} 秒后以自身 {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值复活，每个战场一次。\n【炽天使】：额外获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_HP} 生命值、{C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_ATK} 攻击力、{C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_DEF} 护甲和 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_DEF} 魔抗，射程变为 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_RANGE} 码。攻击施加 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BURN_ON_HIT} 层灼烧。【蓄力猛砸】替换为在 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_CAST_TIME} 秒内投出 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BOOMERANGS} 把回旋镖，期间不获得减伤。回旋镖飞出后返回，命中时造成（{C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BOOM_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害，并施加 {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BOOM_BURN} 层灼烧。\n【全息斧】：额外获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_HP} 生命值、{C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ATK} 攻击力、{C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_DEF} 护甲、{C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_DEF} 魔抗和 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ENERGY_RATE%}% 龟能充能。攻击为生命值百分比最低的友军提供 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ONHIT_SHIELD} 护盾和 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ONHIT_ENERGY} 龟能。【蓄力猛砸】替换为插地 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_PLANT_TIME} 秒，期间获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_PLANT_DR%}% 减伤，附近的友军每 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_TICK} 秒回复 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_HEAL} 生命值和 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_ENERGY} 龟能，并获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_ASPD%}% 攻击速度。\n【余烬】：额外获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_HP} 生命值、{C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_ATK} 攻击力、{C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_ASPD%}% 攻击速度和 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_MOVE%}% 移动速度。攻击命中时，对目标施加 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_SEED_PER_HIT} 层【余烬种子】，并处决生命值低于斩杀线的目标。每层【余烬种子】使该目标的斩杀线提高其最大生命值的 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_SEED_EXEC_PCT%}%，无上限。每处决一个单位获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_EXEC_ENERGY} 龟能。【蓄力猛砸】替换为【余烬之光】：{C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_TIME} 秒内获得 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取、{C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_DR%}% 减伤和 {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_ASPD%}% 攻击速度，并免疫控制效果。期间仍会积累龟能，再次释放时效果独立叠加。"
msgstr "[Undead Axe]: gains {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_HP} Health, {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_ATK} Attack, {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_DEF} Armor and {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_DEF} Magic Resist. Nearby enemies take magic damage equal to {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_RING_MAXHP_PCT%}% of their max health each second. For each nearby enemy, [Axe] heals {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_LEECH_PCT%}% of its max health per second. {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_REVIVE_DELAY} seconds after [Axe] dies, it revives with {C:AxeFinalStats.UNDEAD_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health, once per battle.\n[Seraph]: gains {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_HP} Health, {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_ATK} Attack, {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_DEF} Armor and {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_DEF} Magic Resist, and its range becomes {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_RANGE}. Attacks apply {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BURN_ON_HIT} Burn. [Charged Slam] is replaced by throwing {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BOOMERANGS} boomerangs over {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_CAST_TIME} seconds, with no Damage Reduction meanwhile. The boomerangs fly out and return, dealing ({C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BOOM_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage on hit and applying {C:AxeFinalStats.SERAPH_BOOM_BURN} Burn.\n[Holo Axe]: gains {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_HP} Health, {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ATK} Attack, {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_DEF} Armor, {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_DEF} Magic Resist and {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ENERGY_RATE%}% Energy Charge. Attacks give the ally with the lowest health percentage a {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ONHIT_SHIELD} shield and {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_ONHIT_ENERGY} Energy. [Charged Slam] is replaced by planting itself in the ground for {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_PLANT_TIME} seconds with {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_PLANT_DR%}% Damage Reduction; every {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_TICK} seconds, nearby allies heal {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_HEAL}, gain {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_ENERGY} Energy and {C:AxeFinalStats.HOLO_AURA_ASPD%}% attack speed.\n[Ember]: gains {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_HP} Health, {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_ATK} Attack, {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_ASPD%}% attack speed and {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_MOVE%}% move speed. Attack hits apply {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_SEED_PER_HIT} [Ember Seed] stacks and execute targets below the execute threshold. Each [Ember Seed] stack raises that target's execute threshold by {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_SEED_EXEC_PCT%}% of its max health, with no cap. Each execution grants {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_EXEC_ENERGY} Energy. [Charged Slam] is replaced by [Ember Light]: for {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_TIME} seconds, gains {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal, {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_DR%}% Damage Reduction and {C:AxeFinalStats.EMBER_LIGHT_ASPD%}% attack speed, and is immune to crowd control. It still builds Energy meanwhile, and recasts stack independently."

msgid "先点击发光的位置。"
msgstr "Tap the glowing spot first."

msgid "教程加成：你的龟造成的伤害提高 50%，受到的伤害降低 30%。"
msgstr "Tutorial bonus: your turtles deal 50% more damage and take 30% less damage."

msgid "龟会自动战斗。先打上路战场，结束后再打下路战场。"
msgstr "Turtles fight automatically. The Top Lane battle comes first, then the Bottom Lane."

msgid "每只龟都有一个技能。当【{pet}】血条下的龟能槽攒满时，就会释放技能。"
msgstr "Every turtle has an ability. When the Energy bar under [{pet}]'s health bar fills up, it casts its ability."

msgid "场边的是你的训龟大师。它会在战斗中释放你选择的技能。"
msgstr "On the sideline is your Turtle Trainer. It casts the abilities you chose during battle."

msgid "击碎敌方的【龟蛋】，就能赢下这个战场。"
msgstr "Break the enemy's [Turtle Egg] to win the battle."

msgid "两个战场各赢一个，比分 1 : 1，进入【终极战场】决胜。"
msgstr "If each side wins one lane, it's 1 : 1 and the [Final Battle] decides the winner."

msgid "点击刚买的【{item}】。"
msgstr "Tap the [{item}] you just bought."

msgid "再点击一只龟，把装备装到它身上。"
msgstr "Then tap a turtle to equip it."

msgid "点击【站位】，调整龟开战时站的位置。"
msgstr "Tap [Positions] to set where your turtles start."

msgid "拖动一只龟到想要的位置。近战龟放在前面会更好一些。"
msgstr "Drag a turtle to where you want it. Melee turtles do better in front."

msgid "点击【完成】，保存站位。"
msgstr "Tap [Done] to save the positions."

msgid "教程完成。点击【完成教程】，开始你的第一场对战。"
msgstr "Tutorial complete. Tap [Finish Tutorial] to start your first battle."

msgid "每打一场都会获得【深海币】和【经验】。前往商店使用它们。"
msgstr "Every battle earns [Abyss Coins] and [XP]. Spend them in the Shop."

msgid "装备数量由等级决定。1 级时全队还不能装备任何装备。"
msgstr "Your level decides how many items you can equip. At level 1, your team can't equip any yet."

msgid "购买【经验】提升到 2 级，全队就能装备 2 件装备。"
msgstr "Buy [XP] to reach level 2, and your team can equip 2 items."

msgid "点击一件装备，查看它的效果。"
msgstr "Tap an item to see what it does."

msgid "点击【购买】，装备会放入背包。"
msgstr "Tap [Buy] and the item goes into your Inventory."

msgid "集齐 3 件同名同星的装备，会自动合成为一件更强的 2 星装备。"
msgstr "Collect 3 copies of the same item at the same star level and they combine into a stronger 2-star item."

msgid "点击【背包】，把装备装到你的龟身上。"
msgstr "Tap [Inventory] to equip items on your turtles."

msgid "从这里选出 3 只龟组成你的队伍。先选择【{pet}】。"
msgstr "Pick 3 turtles here to form your team. Start with [{pet}]."

msgid "每只龟都有 3 个技能，每场带 1 个。点击一个技能装备它。"
msgstr "Each turtle has 3 abilities and brings 1 to each battle. Tap an ability to equip it."

msgid "再选择【{pet}】。"
msgstr "Next, pick [{pet}]."

msgid "最后选择【{pet}】。"
msgstr "Finally, pick [{pet}]."

msgid "本周第一场对战开始后，这 3 只龟会锁定到下周一，技能仍可每场更换。"
msgstr "Once your first battle this week starts, these 3 turtles are locked until next Monday. You can still change abilities every battle."

