msgid "首次死亡时以自身 {C:AngelSystem.REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值复活一次。"
msgstr "The first time it dies, revives once with {C:AngelSystem.REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health."

msgid "获得 {C:ChestSystem.CROWN_ATK%}% 攻击力、{C:ChestSystem.CROWN_CRIT%}% 暴击率、{C:ChestSystem.CROWN_CRIT_DMG%}% 暴击伤害与 {C:ChestSystem.CROWN_LS%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Gain {C:ChestSystem.CROWN_ATK%}% attack damage, {C:ChestSystem.CROWN_CRIT%}% Crit Chance, {C:ChestSystem.CROWN_CRIT_DMG%}% Crit Damage and {C:ChestSystem.CROWN_LS%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "攻击和技能命中时为目标叠加 1 层金色闪电。在 {C:ChestSystem.THUNDER_STACKS} 层时，金色闪电会引爆，造成 {C:ChestSystem.THUNDER_ATK_COEF%}% 攻击力的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Attack and ability hits apply 1 Golden Lightning stack. At {C:ChestSystem.THUNDER_STACKS} stacks, it detonates for {C:ChestSystem.THUNDER_ATK_COEF%}% Attack as true damage."

msgid "攻击和技能伤害转化为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Attack and ability damage becomes true damage."

msgid "前排 · 近战"
msgstr "Front Row · Melee"

msgid "人体浪板"
msgstr "Body Surf"

msgid "近战小将锁定一个敌人并跃起，起跳时回复（{C:HidingSystem.SURF_HEAL_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:HidingSystem.SURF_HEAL_COEF*ATK}）生命值，距离过近时先向后跳开。随后射出铁链，将该敌人眩晕 {C:HidingSystem.SURF_STUN_SEC} 秒并将自身拉向目标，接触时造成其 {C:HidingSystem.SURF_CONTACT_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的物理伤害。之后踩着目标滑行，对其持续造成（{C:HidingSystem.SURF_RIDE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.SURF_RIDE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并对沿途敌人造成（{C:HidingSystem.SURF_PASS_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.SURF_PASS_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害并将其击退，最后跳下。"
msgstr "The Melee Minion locks onto an enemy and leaps, healing ({C:HidingSystem.SURF_HEAL_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:HidingSystem.SURF_HEAL_COEF*ATK}) on takeoff, hopping back first if too close. It then fires a chain that stuns the enemy for {C:HidingSystem.SURF_STUN_SEC} seconds and pulls itself to the target, dealing physical damage equal to {C:HidingSystem.SURF_CONTACT_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its max health on contact. It then rides the target like a surfboard, dealing ({C:HidingSystem.SURF_RIDE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.SURF_RIDE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to it over time and ({C:HidingSystem.SURF_PASS_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.SURF_PASS_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to enemies along the way, knocking them back, before jumping off."

msgid "近战小将的攻击造成（{C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "The Melee Minion's attacks deal ({C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

msgid "后排 · 远程"
msgstr "Back Row · Ranged"

msgid "追踪火箭筒"
msgstr "Homing Rocket Launcher"

msgid "远程小将锁定一名敌人，蓄力 {C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_CHARGE_SEC} 秒后发射一枚慢速追踪导弹，命中时引发核爆，对附近的敌人造成（{C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.ROCKET_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并施加 {C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "The Ranged Minion locks onto an enemy, charges for {C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_CHARGE_SEC} seconds, then fires a slow homing missile that explodes on hit, dealing ({C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:HidingSystem.ROCKET_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to nearby enemies and applying {C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:HidingSystem.ROCKET_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds."

msgid "远程小将的攻击造成（{C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "The Ranged Minion's attacks deal ({C:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:BasicConsts.DEFAULT_BASIC_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

msgid "精英 · 近战"
msgstr "Elite · Melee"

msgid "精英小将在附近有敌人时举拳蓄力 0.35 秒，随后砸向地面，对前方锥形范围内的敌人造成（{C:EliteSystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:EliteSystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。每 3 次施放时转而高高跃起，在空中蓄力 1 秒后砸下，对附近的全部敌人造成（{C:EliteSystem.HAMMER_BIG_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:EliteSystem.HAMMER_BIG_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。"
msgstr "With enemies nearby, the Elite Minion raises its fist for 0.35 seconds, then smashes the ground, dealing ({C:EliteSystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:EliteSystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to enemies in a cone in front. Every 3rd cast, it leaps high instead, charges in the air for 1 second and slams down, dealing ({C:EliteSystem.HAMMER_BIG_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:EliteSystem.HAMMER_BIG_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage to all nearby enemies."

msgid "旋刃"
msgstr "Whirling Blade"

msgid "精英小将每第 {C:EliteSystem.WHIRL_EVERY} 次攻击挥出旋刃，对周围的敌人造成（{C:EliteSystem.WHIRL_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:EliteSystem.WHIRL_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，并回复相当于所造成伤害 {C:EliteSystem.WHIRL_HEAL_PCT%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:EliteSystem.WHIRL_EVERY}th attack, the Elite Minion swings a whirling blade, dealing ({C:EliteSystem.WHIRL_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:EliteSystem.WHIRL_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage to enemies around it and healing for {C:EliteSystem.WHIRL_HEAL_PCT%}% of the damage dealt."

msgid "精英小将每 {C:EliteSystem.WHIP_CD_SEC} 秒锁定一个不贴身的敌人，射出锁链，命中后将其眩晕 {C:EliteSystem.WHIP_STUN_SEC} 秒并拉至自身后方，造成（{C:EliteSystem.WHIP_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {M:EliteSystem.WHIP_ATK_COEF*ATK}）魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EliteSystem.WHIP_CD_SEC} seconds, the Elite Minion locks onto an enemy that isn't next to it and fires a chain. On hit, it stuns the enemy for {C:EliteSystem.WHIP_STUN_SEC} seconds and pulls it behind itself, dealing ({C:EliteSystem.WHIP_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {M:EliteSystem.WHIP_ATK_COEF*ATK}) magic damage."

msgid "精英小将的攻击、铁锁或铁锤命中生命值低于 {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_HP_PCT%}% 的敌人时发动吞噬，持续 {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_SEC} 秒，期间获得 {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_DR%}% 减伤。吞噬完成时击杀该敌人，回复相当于其剩余生命值 {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_HEAL_MULT} 倍的生命值，获得 {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_ASPD_BONUS%}% 攻击速度，持续 {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_HASTE_SEC} 秒，并窃取该敌人的主动技能。"
msgstr "When the Elite Minion's attack, Iron Chain or Iron Hammer hits an enemy below {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_HP_PCT%}% health, it Devours it over {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_SEC} seconds, gaining {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_DR%}% Damage Reduction meanwhile. When the Devour completes, it kills the enemy, heals {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_HEAL_MULT}× that enemy's remaining health, gains {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_ASPD_BONUS%}% attack speed for {C:EliteSystem.CONSUME_HASTE_SEC} seconds, and steals its active ability."

msgid "长手刃"
msgstr "Long Arm Blade"

msgid "精英小将的攻击造成（{C:EliteSystem.BLADE_ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:EliteSystem.BLADE_ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害。"
msgstr "The Elite Minion's attacks deal ({C:EliteSystem.BLADE_ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:EliteSystem.BLADE_ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage."

