msgstr "+{C:ReserveConsts.GROWTH_PER_BATTLE%}% per match"

msgid "援军小将锁定一名敌人，在其前后左右各出现一道气波，同时追向该敌人。每道气波对命中的第一个敌人造成（{C:ReserveConsts.ATK_COEF%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {N:ReserveConsts.ATK_COEF*ATK}）物理伤害，外加相当于该敌人 {C:ReserveConsts.MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "The Reinforcement Minion locks onto an enemy, and waves appear on all four sides of it, closing in at once. Each wave deals ({C:ReserveConsts.ATK_COEF%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {N:ReserveConsts.ATK_COEF*ATK}) physical damage plus magic damage equal to {C:ReserveConsts.MAXHP_PCT%}% of that enemy's max health to the first enemy it hits."

msgid "终极战场中，援军小将与幸存单位一起登场。所属玩家本周每进行一场对局，援军小将的生命值、攻击力、护甲和魔抗提升 {C:ReserveConsts.GROWTH_PER_BATTLE%}%。"
msgstr "In the Final Battle, the Reinforcement Minion enters alongside the surviving units. For every match its player has played this week, its health, Attack, Armor and Magic Resist increase by {C:ReserveConsts.GROWTH_PER_BATTLE%}%."

