msgid "炸弹·爆破"
msgstr "Bombs · Demolition"

msgid "炸弹提高携带者的护甲穿透。每个战场开始 {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} 秒后，一发导弹落到战场中心，轰炸并击飞所有敌方单位。"
msgstr "Bombs grant their carriers Armor Pen. {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} seconds into each battlefield, a missile strikes the center of the field, blasting and knocking up every enemy unit."

msgid "每件炸弹为携带者提供 +4 护甲穿透 · 【导弹轰炸】每个战场开始 {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} 秒后，导弹落到战场中心，对所有敌方单位造成 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + 目标最大生命值 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% 的物理伤害，并击飞 {C:BombSynergySystem.AIR_SEC} 秒，龟蛋除外"
msgstr "Each Bomb item grants its carrier +4 Armor Pen · [Missile Strike] {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} seconds into each battlefield, a missile strikes the center of the field, dealing {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% of the target's max health as physical damage to every enemy unit and knocking them up for {C:BombSynergySystem.AIR_SEC} second (eggs excluded)"

msgid "每件炸弹为携带者提供 +8 护甲穿透 · 【导弹轰炸】伤害提高至 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + 目标最大生命值 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}%"
msgstr "Each Bomb item grants its carrier +8 Armor Pen · [Missile Strike] damage increased to {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% of the target's max health"

msgid "每件炸弹为携带者提供 +12 护甲穿透 · 【导弹轰炸】伤害提高至 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + 目标最大生命值 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}%"
msgstr "Each Bomb item grants its carrier +12 Armor Pen · [Missile Strike] damage increased to {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% of the target's max health"

msgid "武士刀小将"
msgstr "Katana Minion"

msgid "鞭炮"
msgstr "Firecrackers"

msgid "攻击有几率在目标周围引爆一串鞭炮，造成范围物理伤害。"
msgstr "Attacks have a chance to set off a string of firecrackers around the target, dealing area physical damage."

msgid "攻击有 {C:EqBombBatch.CRACKER_CHANCE%}% 几率在目标周围引爆一串鞭炮，对附近的敌人造成 {C:EqBombBatch.CRACKER_ATK%}% 攻击力的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Attacks have a {C:EqBombBatch.CRACKER_CHANCE%}% chance to set off a string of firecrackers around the target, dealing {C:EqBombBatch.CRACKER_ATK%}% Attack as physical damage to nearby enemies."

msgid "爆竹筒"
msgstr "Firework Tube"

msgid "定时在自己周围炸一圈，击退身边的敌人并获得护盾。"
msgstr "Periodically bursts around itself, knocking back nearby enemies and gaining a shield."

msgid "每 {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_IV} 秒在携带者周围引爆一圈爆竹：击退附近的敌人，造成（{C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_FLAT}+{C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_ATK%}% 攻击力）物理伤害，并获得 {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_SHIELD} 点护盾，持续 {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_IV} seconds, bursts around itself: knocks back nearby enemies, dealing ({C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_FLAT} + {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_ATK%}% Attack) physical damage, and gains a {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_SHIELD} shield for {C:EqBombBatch.TUBE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "手雷"
msgstr "Grenade"

msgid "定时朝敌人最密集处扔手雷，造成范围物理伤害并破甲。"
msgstr "Periodically throws a grenade at the densest group of enemies, dealing area physical damage and shredding armor."

msgid "每 {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_IV} 秒朝敌人最密集处投掷一颗手雷，对落点附近的敌人造成（{C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_FLAT}+{C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_ATK%}% 攻击力）物理伤害，并使其护甲降低 {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_SHRED}，持续 {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_SHRED_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_IV} seconds, throws a grenade at the densest group of enemies, dealing ({C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_FLAT} + {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_ATK%}% Attack) physical damage to enemies near the impact point and reducing their Armor by {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_SHRED} for {C:EqBombBatch.GRENADE_SHRED_SEC} seconds."

msgid "烟雾弹"
msgstr "Smoke Bomb"

msgid "定时放烟雾，烟里的友军获得潜行，潜行中的攻击额外造成真实伤害。"
msgstr "Periodically releases smoke. Allies in the smoke gain stealth, and attacks from stealth deal bonus true damage."

msgid "每 {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_IV} 秒在身边放一团烟雾，持续 {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_SEC} 秒。烟雾内的友军每 {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_PULSE} 秒获得一次潜行：无法被选中，攻击时现形。潜行状态下的下一次攻击额外造成（{C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_TRUE_FLAT}+{C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_TRUE_ATK%}% 攻击力）真实伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_IV} seconds, releases a cloud of smoke around itself for {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_SEC} seconds. Allies inside gain stealth every {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_PULSE} second: they can't be targeted and are revealed when they attack. The next attack from stealth deals ({C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_TRUE_FLAT} + {C:EqBombBatch.SMOKE_TRUE_ATK%}% Attack) bonus true damage."

msgid "粘弹"
msgstr "Sticky Bomb"

msgid "定时丢粘弹减速敌人，爆炸后铺粘液，叠加中毒。"
msgstr "Periodically throws a sticky bomb that slows an enemy, then explodes into a pool of goo that stacks Poison."

msgid "每 {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_IV} 秒朝一个敌人丢一枚粘弹，使其移动速度降低 {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_SLOW%}%，持续 {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_FUSE} 秒。随后粘弹爆炸，造成（{C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_FLAT}+{C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_ATK%}% 攻击力）物理伤害，并在地上铺粘液 {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_SEC} 秒：粘液里的敌人移动速度降低 {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_SLOW%}%，每 {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_TICK} 秒叠加 {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_POISON} 层中毒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_IV} seconds, throws a sticky bomb at an enemy, slowing its move speed by {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_SLOW%}% for {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_FUSE} seconds. The bomb then explodes, dealing ({C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_FLAT} + {C:EqBombBatch.STICKY_ATK%}% Attack) physical damage and leaving goo on the ground for {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_SEC} seconds: enemies in the goo are slowed by {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_SLOW%}% and gain {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_POISON} Poison stacks every {C:EqBombBatch.GOO_TICK} seconds."

msgid "地雷"
msgstr "Landmine"

msgid "在站位图里摆地雷，敌人踩中爆炸并眩晕。"
msgstr "Place landmines on the formation map. Enemies that step on them are blasted and stunned."

msgid "在站位图中摆放 {C:EqBombBatch.MINE_COUNT} 颗地雷（不摆则埋在己方前排正前方，对手看不见）。敌人踩中时爆炸，对附近的敌人造成 {C:EqBombBatch.MINE_DMG} 物理伤害并眩晕 {C:EqBombBatch.MINE_STUN} 秒。"
msgstr "Place {C:EqBombBatch.MINE_COUNT} landmines on the formation map (if not placed, they are buried in front of your front line; invisible to the opponent). When an enemy steps on one, it explodes, dealing {C:EqBombBatch.MINE_DMG} physical damage to nearby enemies and stunning them for {C:EqBombBatch.MINE_STUN} seconds."

msgid "炸药桶"
msgstr "Powder Keg"

msgid "阵亡时原地大爆炸，按携带者最大生命值造成范围物理伤害。"
msgstr "Explodes on death, dealing area physical damage based on its own max health."

msgid "阵亡时原地大爆炸，对附近的敌人造成携带者 {C:EqBombBatch.BARREL_PCT%}% 最大生命值的物理伤害。"
msgstr "On death, explodes where it stands, dealing physical damage equal to {C:EqBombBatch.BARREL_PCT%}% of its own max health to nearby enemies."

msgid "定时炸弹"
msgstr "Time Bomb"

msgid "定时给敌人绑炸弹，每绑一颗之后的伤害都更高。"
msgstr "Periodically straps a bomb to an enemy. Each bomb strapped makes later ones deal more damage."

msgid "每 {C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_IV} 秒给最近的敌人绑一颗定时炸弹，{C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_FUSE} 秒后爆炸，对附近的敌人造成（{C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_FLAT}+{C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_ATK%}% 攻击力）物理伤害。每绑一颗，之后的定时炸弹伤害提高 {C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_STACK%}%，跨战场保留，一局结束重置。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_IV} seconds, straps a time bomb to the nearest enemy. After {C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_FUSE} seconds it explodes, dealing ({C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_FLAT} + {C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_ATK%}% Attack) physical damage to nearby enemies. Each bomb strapped increases the damage of later time bombs by {C:EqBombBatch.TIMER_STACK%}%. Carries over between battlefields and resets when the match ends."

msgid "炮筒"
msgstr "Cannon"

msgid "召唤一门高血量【炮筒】，龟能满时进入重炮状态，直线击退并流血。"
msgstr "Summons a high-health [Cannon]. When its Energy is full it enters Heavy Shot mode, knocking back and bleeding enemies in a line."

msgid "登场时在己方后方召唤一门【炮筒】。炮筒龟能满时进入重炮状态，炮弹沿直线飞过整个战场，击退直线上的敌人并施加流血。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a [Cannon] behind your side. When its Energy is full it enters Heavy Shot mode: shells fly in a straight line across the whole battlefield, knocking back enemies in the line and applying Bleed."

msgid "遥控炸弹"
msgstr "Remote Bomb"

msgid "召唤一枚持续追踪敌人的【遥控炸弹】，阵亡时大范围爆炸。"
msgstr "Summons a [Remote Bomb] that keeps chasing enemies and explodes over a large area when it dies."

msgid "登场时在己方前排召唤一枚【遥控炸弹】。遥控炸弹会持续追踪一名敌人，不会攻击，阵亡时大范围爆炸，造成物理伤害和基于携带者最大生命值的真实伤害，并施加流血。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a [Remote Bomb] in your front line. It keeps chasing one enemy without attacking, and when it dies it explodes over a large area, dealing physical damage plus true damage based on the holder's max health, and applying Bleed."

msgid "武士刀"
msgstr "Katana"

msgid "召唤一名【武士刀小将】，前三次技能挥剑气波，第四次蓄力回血后吹出龙卷风。"
msgstr "Summons a [Katana Minion]. Its first three casts swing sword waves, and the fourth charges up to heal, then blows tornadoes."

msgid "登场时召唤一名【武士刀小将】。武士刀小将龟能满时释放技能，四次一循环：前三次向前方挥出一道剑气波，第四次蓄力并回复自身生命值，随后向前方吹出龙卷风，击飞敌人。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a [Katana Minion]. When its Energy is full it casts its ability in a 4-cast cycle: the first three send a sword wave forward, and the fourth charges up while healing itself, then blows tornadoes forward that knock enemies up."

msgid "护甲 -%d"
msgstr "Armor -%d"

msgid "减速 %d%%"
msgstr "Slow %d%%"

msgid "匕首"
msgstr "Dagger"

msgid "仪式"
msgstr "Ritual"

msgid "匕首·刺杀"
msgstr "Daggers · Assassinate"

msgid "仪式·血契"
msgstr "Ritual · Blood Pact"

msgid "匕首提高携带者的暴击伤害。每个战场开始时，我方所有单位的下一次攻击必定暴击，并附带额外暴击伤害与生命偷取。"
msgstr "Daggers grant their carriers Crit Damage. When each battlefield begins, the next attack of every allied unit is a guaranteed critical strike with bonus Crit Damage and Life Steal."

msgid "仪式匕首的携带者每击杀一名敌人刻下一道血契。血契整个大轮累计，每道血契永久提高携带者与全队的攻击力。"
msgstr "Each kill by a Ritual Dagger carrier carves a Blood Pact. Blood Pacts accumulate across the whole round, and each one permanently increases the Attack of the carrier and the whole team."

msgid "每件匕首为携带者提供 +6% 暴击伤害 · 【刺杀】每个战场开始时，我方所有单位的下一次攻击必定暴击，暴击伤害额外提高 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[0]%}%，并获得 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取"
msgstr "Each Dagger item grants its carrier +6% Crit Damage · [Assassinate] When each battlefield begins, the next attack of every allied unit is a guaranteed critical strike with +{C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[0]%}% bonus Crit Damage and {C:DaggerSynergySystem.LIFESTEAL%}% Life Steal"

msgid "每件匕首为携带者提供 +12% 暴击伤害 · 【刺杀】额外暴击伤害提高至 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[1]%}%，每个战场开始 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} 秒后再触发一次"
msgstr "Each Dagger item grants its carrier +12% Crit Damage · [Assassinate] bonus Crit Damage increased to {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[1]%}%, and it triggers again {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} seconds into the fight"

msgid "每件匕首为携带者提供 +20% 暴击伤害 · 【刺杀】额外暴击伤害提高至 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[2]%}%，每个战场开始 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} 秒与 20 秒后各再触发一次"
msgstr "Each Dagger item grants its carrier +20% Crit Damage · [Assassinate] bonus Crit Damage increased to {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[2]%}%, and it triggers again {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} and 20 seconds into the fight"

msgid "【血契】携带者每击杀一名敌人，刻下 1 道血契，至多 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_CAP} 道，整个大轮累计，大轮重置。多件仪式匕首共用同一份血契 · 每道血契使全队攻击力提高 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_TEAM_ATK%}%"
msgstr "[Blood Pact] Each kill by the carrier carves 1 Blood Pact, up to {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_CAP}. Pacts accumulate across the whole round and reset with the round. Multiple Ritual Daggers share the same Pacts · Each Blood Pact increases the whole team's Attack by {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_TEAM_ATK%}%"

msgid "暗影忍者"
msgstr "Shadow Ninja"

msgid "影子忍者"
msgstr "Shadow Clone"

msgid "血契 %d"
msgstr "Blood Pact %d"

msgid "折叠小刀"
msgstr "Folding Knife"

msgid "每个战场的第一次攻击附带流血。"
msgstr "The first attack on each battlefield applies Bleed."

msgid "每个战场开始后，第一次攻击附带 {C:EqDaggerBatch.FOLD_BLEED} 层流血。"
msgstr "After each battlefield begins, the first attack applies {C:EqDaggerBatch.FOLD_BLEED} Bleed stacks."

msgid "柳叶飞刀"
msgstr "Willow-Leaf Knife"

msgid "定时朝最远的敌人射出飞刀，造成可以暴击的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Periodically throws a knife toward the farthest enemy, dealing magic damage that can crit."

msgid "每 {C:EqDaggerBatch.KNIFE_IV} 秒朝最远的敌人射出一把柳叶飞刀，命中途经的第一个敌人，造成（{C:EqDaggerBatch.KNIFE_FLAT}+{C:EqDaggerBatch.KNIFE_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害，可以暴击。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqDaggerBatch.KNIFE_IV} seconds, throws a willow-leaf knife toward the farthest enemy. It hits the first enemy in its path, dealing ({C:EqDaggerBatch.KNIFE_FLAT} + {C:EqDaggerBatch.KNIFE_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage. This damage can crit."

msgid "苦无"
msgstr "Kunai"

msgid "定时朝随机敌人掷出苦无，每命中一枚为携带者回复生命值。"
msgstr "Periodically throws kunai at random enemies, restoring health for each one that hits."

msgid "每 {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_IV} 秒朝随机敌人掷出 {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_N} 枚苦无，每枚造成（{C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_FLAT}+{C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害，并为携带者回复 {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_HEAL} 点生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_IV} seconds, throws {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_N} kunai at random enemies. Each deals ({C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_FLAT} + {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage and restores {C:EqDaggerBatch.KUNAI_HEAL} health to the carrier."

msgid "毒牙匕首"
msgstr "Venom Fang"

msgid "暴击时按携带者攻击力施加中毒。"
msgstr "Critical strikes apply Poison based on Attack."

msgid "造成暴击时，使目标叠加相当于携带者 {C:EqDaggerBatch.FANG_POISON_ATK%}% 攻击力的中毒层数。"
msgstr "Critical strikes apply Poison stacks equal to {C:EqDaggerBatch.FANG_POISON_ATK%}% of the carrier's Attack."

msgid "三棱刺"
msgstr "Tri-Edge Stiletto"

msgid "攻击和技能无视目标一部分护甲。"
msgstr "Attacks and abilities ignore part of the target's Armor."

msgid "攻击和技能无视目标 {C:EqDaggerBatch.PIERCE_PCT%}% 护甲。"
msgstr "Attacks and abilities ignore {C:EqDaggerBatch.PIERCE_PCT%}% of the target's Armor."

msgid "弯匕"
msgstr "Kris"

msgid "击杀敌人后短时间内提高攻击速度。"
msgstr "Gains Attack Speed for a short time after a kill."

msgid "击杀敌人后 {C:EqDaggerBatch.KRIS_SEC} 秒内攻击速度提高 {C:EqDaggerBatch.KRIS_ASPD%}%。"
msgstr "After killing an enemy, gains {C:EqDaggerBatch.KRIS_ASPD%}% Attack Speed for {C:EqDaggerBatch.KRIS_SEC} seconds."

msgid "仪式匕首"
msgstr "Ritual Dagger"

msgid "斩杀低血量的敌人，每次击杀刻下血契，整个大轮持续变强。"
msgstr "Executes low-health enemies. Every kill carves a Blood Pact that keeps growing across the whole round."

msgid "攻击和技能直接击杀生命值低于其 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_EXEC%}% 最大生命值的敌人。每击杀一名敌人刻下 1 道【血契】，整个大轮累计，至多 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_CAP} 道。每道血契使携带者攻击力提高 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_ATK}、护甲穿透提高 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_PEN}。"
msgstr "Attacks and abilities execute enemies below {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_EXEC%}% of their max health. Each kill carves 1 [Blood Pact], accumulating across the whole round, up to {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_CAP}. Each Blood Pact grants the carrier {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_ATK} Attack and {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_PEN} Armor Pen."

msgid "暗影匕首"
msgstr "Shadow Dagger"

msgid "召唤【暗影忍者】，影袭背刺生命值最低的敌人，半血时分出影子一起掷出手里剑。"
msgstr "Summons a [Shadow Ninja] that backstabs the lowest-health enemy. At half health it splits off a shadow, and both throw shurikens."

msgid "登场时召唤一名【暗影忍者】。暗影忍者登场时隐身，龟能满时化为黑烟，背刺生命值比例最低的敌人并掷出手里剑。暗影忍者的生命值首次低于一半时，分出一名影子忍者。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a [Shadow Ninja]. It enters stealthed, and when its Energy is full it vanishes into black smoke, backstabs the enemy with the lowest health ratio and throws a shuriken. The first time it drops below half health, it splits off a shadow clone."

msgid "黑曜石匕首"
msgstr "Obsidian Dagger"

msgid "暴击时把黑曜石匕首插进敌人身上，足以致命时一起拔出并回复生命值。"
msgstr "Critical strikes lodge obsidian daggers in the enemy. Once they can kill, they are ripped out together and restore health."

msgid "造成暴击时，在目标身上插入一把黑曜石匕首，匕首不会自行拔出。目标身上全部匕首一起拔出的伤害足以击杀目标时，立即全部拔出：每把造成（{C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_FLAT}+{C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_ATK%}% 攻击力+目标 {C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_MAXHP%}% 最大生命值）物理伤害，并为携带者回复 {C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_HEAL} 点生命值。"
msgstr "Critical strikes lodge an obsidian dagger in the target; daggers never come out on their own. As soon as ripping out all daggers in the target would kill it, they are all ripped out at once: each deals ({C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_FLAT} + {C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_ATK%}% Attack + {C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health) physical damage and restores {C:EqDaggerBatch.OBS_HEAL} health to the carrier."

msgid "血契 %d / %d"
msgstr "Blood Pact %d / %d"

msgid "血契 %d / %d（已满）"
msgstr "Blood Pact %d / %d (full)"

msgid "学徒笔记"
msgstr "Apprentice's Notes"

msgid "每第 {C:EqMagicBatch.NOTE_EVERY} 次攻击额外射出一枚追踪魔法飞弹，造成（{C:EqMagicBatch.NOTE_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.NOTE_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqMagicBatch.NOTE_EVERY}rd attack fires an extra homing magic missile that deals ({C:EqMagicBatch.NOTE_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.NOTE_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage."

msgid "每第三次攻击额外射出一枚追踪魔法飞弹。"
msgstr "Every third attack fires an extra homing magic missile."

msgid "羊皮咒卷"
msgstr "Parchment Scroll"

msgid "释放技能时获得 {C:EqMagicBatch.SCROLL_SHIELD} 点护盾，持续 {C:EqMagicBatch.SCROLL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Casting an ability grants a {C:EqMagicBatch.SCROLL_SHIELD} Shield for {C:EqMagicBatch.SCROLL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "释放技能时获得护盾。"
msgstr "Casting an ability grants a Shield."

msgid "烈焰法典"
msgstr "Tome of Flames"

msgid "释放技能时朝最近的敌人掷出一颗火球，造成（{C:EqMagicBatch.FIRE_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.FIRE_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害并施加灼烧，层数等于这次技能消耗龟能的 {C:EqMagicBatch.FIRE_BURN_PER_EN%}%。"
msgstr "Casting an ability hurls a fireball at the nearest enemy, dealing ({C:EqMagicBatch.FIRE_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.FIRE_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage and applying Burn stacks equal to {C:EqMagicBatch.FIRE_BURN_PER_EN%}% of the energy spent on that ability."

msgid "释放技能时朝最近的敌人掷出火球，按消耗的龟能施加灼烧。"
msgstr "Casting an ability hurls a fireball at the nearest enemy, applying Burn based on the energy spent."

msgid "霜语魔典"
msgstr "Frostwhisper Grimoire"

msgid "释放技能时对周围的敌人释放冰霜新星，造成（{C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害并施加冰寒，使其移动速度降低 {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_MOVE_DOWN%}%、攻击速度降低 {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_ASPD_DOWN%}%，持续时间等于这次技能消耗的龟能 × {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_SEC_PER_EN} 秒。"
msgstr "Casting an ability releases a frost nova around you, dealing ({C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage and applying Chill, reducing Move Speed by {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_MOVE_DOWN%}% and Attack Speed by {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_ASPD_DOWN%}% for (energy spent on that ability × {C:EqMagicBatch.FROST_SEC_PER_EN}) seconds."

msgid "释放技能时冻住周围的敌人，冰寒持续时间基于消耗的龟能。"
msgstr "Casting an ability chills nearby enemies. Chill duration is based on the energy spent."

msgid "风暴之书"
msgstr "Book of Storms"

msgid "每 {C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_IV} 秒对 {C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_N} 名随机敌人各降下一道闪电，造成（{C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_IV} seconds, lightning strikes {C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_N} random enemies, each taking ({C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.STORM_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage."

msgid "定时对随机敌人降下闪电。"
msgstr "Periodically calls lightning down on random enemies."

msgid "治愈圣典"
msgstr "Codex of Mending"

msgid "释放技能时为生命值比例最低的友军施加持续回复，每秒回复（{C:EqMagicBatch.HOLY_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.HOLY_ATK%}% 攻击力）生命值，持续时间等于这次技能消耗的龟能 × {C:EqMagicBatch.HOLY_SEC_PER_EN} 秒。"
msgstr "Casting an ability grants the ally with the lowest Health percentage a heal over time that restores ({C:EqMagicBatch.HOLY_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.HOLY_ATK%}% Attack) Health per second for (energy spent on that ability × {C:EqMagicBatch.HOLY_SEC_PER_EN}) seconds."

msgid "释放技能时为生命值比例最低的友军持续回复生命值。"
msgstr "Casting an ability heals the ally with the lowest Health percentage over time."

msgid "亡者之书"
msgstr "Book of the Dead"

msgid "释放技能后随机召唤一具【骷髅战士】、【骷髅法师】或【骷髅祭司】，存在时间等于这次消耗的龟能 × {C:EqMagicBatch.SKEL_SEC_PER_EN} 秒。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, summons a random [Skeleton Warrior], [Skeleton Mage] or [Skeleton Priest] that lasts for the Energy spent × {C:EqMagicBatch.SKEL_SEC_PER_EN} seconds."

msgid "释放技能后召唤一具随机的【骷髅战士】、【骷髅法师】或【骷髅祭司】。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, summons a random [Skeleton Warrior], [Skeleton Mage] or [Skeleton Priest]."

msgid "镜像魔典"
msgstr "Mirror Grimoire"

msgid "每个战场第一次释放技能和充能条存满后的那次技能，都会再释放一次。"
msgstr "Your first ability on each battlefield, and the one after the charge bar fills, are cast twice."

msgid "禁咒全书"
msgstr "Forbidden Codex"

msgid "浮空魔典"
msgstr "Floating Tome"

msgid "释放技能后获得 {C:EqMagicBatch.TOME_HP} 点最大生命值并回复等量生命值，持续时间等于这次技能消耗的龟能 × {C:EqMagicBatch.TOME_SEC_PER_EN} 秒。近战单位携带时，{C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_N} 张书页环绕携带者，每张书页碰到敌人时对其造成（{C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_ATK%}% 攻击力）魔法伤害，每次碰到获得 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_SHIELD} 点护盾，持续 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，至多 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_SHIELD_CAP} 点。远程单位携带时，身后悬浮至多 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_N} 张书页，每 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_REGEN} 秒补充一张。受到不低于携带者 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_BLOCK_PCT%}% 最大生命值的单次攻击或技能伤害时，消耗一张书页抵挡至多 {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_BLOCK_MAX} 点伤害，持续伤害不会触发。"
msgstr "Casting an ability grants {C:EqMagicBatch.TOME_HP} maximum Health and restores the same amount of Health for (energy spent on that ability × {C:EqMagicBatch.TOME_SEC_PER_EN}) seconds. On a melee carrier, {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_N} pages orbit you, each page dealing ({C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_ATK%}% Attack) magic damage to an enemy it touches and granting a {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_SHIELD} Shield for {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds per touch, up to {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_SHIELD_CAP}. On a ranged carrier, up to {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_N} pages float behind you, regrowing one every {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_REGEN} seconds. When a single attack or ability deals damage of at least {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_BLOCK_PCT%}% of your maximum Health, a page blocks up to {C:EqMagicBatch.PAGE_BLOCK_MAX} of it. Damage over time does not trigger it."

msgid "释放技能后提高最大生命值。近战时书页环绕伤敌并给护盾，远程时书页替携带者挡下大额伤害。"
msgstr "Casting an ability raises maximum Health. Melee: orbiting pages cut enemies and grant Shields. Ranged: pages block big hits."

msgid "魔法书"
msgstr "Spellbook"

msgid "魔法书·飞弹"
msgstr "Spellbooks · Magic Missiles"

msgid "骷髅战士"
msgstr "Skeleton Warrior"

msgid "骷髅法师"
msgstr "Skeleton Mage"

msgid "骷髅祭司"
msgstr "Skeleton Priest"

msgid "魔法书提高携带者造成的伤害。我方任意单位（包括召唤物）每释放一次技能，按这次消耗的龟能召唤一批魔法飞弹，飞向随机敌人。"
msgstr "Spellbooks grant their carriers Damage Amp. Whenever any allied unit (summons included) casts an ability, it conjures magic missiles based on the energy spent, which fly at random enemies."

msgid "每件魔法书为携带者提供 +3% 增伤 · 【飞弹】我方单位每释放一次技能，每消耗 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[0]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚魔法飞弹，至少 1 枚。每枚飞向一名随机敌人，造成（{C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]}+目标 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% 最大生命值）魔法伤害"
msgstr "Each Spellbook grants its carrier +3% Damage Amp · [Magic Missiles] Whenever an allied unit casts an ability, it conjures 1 magic missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[0]} energy spent (at least 1). Each flies at a random enemy and deals ({C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% of the target's maximum Health) magic damage"

msgid "每个战场第一次释放技能后，立即再释放一次。每次释放技能将消耗的龟能存入充能条，存满 {C:EqMagicBatch.MIRROR_THR} 点后，下一次释放技能后立即再释放一次，充能条从零开始重新积累。再释放的那一次同样触发释放技能时的效果，但不存入充能条。"
msgstr "The first time you cast an ability on each battlefield, cast it again immediately. Each cast stores the energy spent in a charge bar; when it reaches {C:EqMagicBatch.MIRROR_THR}, it empties and your next ability is cast again immediately. The repeated cast also counts as casting an ability, but does not add to the charge bar."

msgid "每件魔法书为携带者提供 +6% 增伤 · 【飞弹】每 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[1]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚，伤害提高至（{C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]}+目标 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% 最大生命值）"
msgstr "Each Spellbook grants its carrier +6% Damage Amp · [Magic Missiles] now 1 missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[1]} energy, damage increased to ({C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% of the target's maximum Health)"

msgid "每件魔法书为携带者提供 +10% 增伤 · 【飞弹】每 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[2]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚，伤害提高至（{C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]}+目标 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% 最大生命值）"
msgstr "Each Spellbook grants its carrier +10% Damage Amp · [Magic Missiles] now 1 missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[2]} energy, damage increased to ({C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% of the target's maximum Health)"

msgid "技能的龟能消耗减少 {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_CUT} 点。释放技能后，下一次攻击变为禁咒弹，造成（{C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_FLAT}+{C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_ATK%}% 攻击力+目标 {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_MAXHP%}% 最大生命值）魔法伤害，并对目标周围的敌人造成其 {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_SPLASH%}% 的伤害。"
msgstr "Your abilities cost {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_CUT} less energy. After casting an ability, your next attack becomes a forbidden bolt that deals ({C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_FLAT} + {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_ATK%}% Attack + {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_MAXHP%}% of the target's maximum Health) magic damage, and deals {C:EqMagicBatch.FORB_SPLASH%}% of that damage to enemies around the target."

msgid "技能更快就绪，释放技能后的下一次攻击变为禁咒弹。"
msgstr "Abilities are ready sooner, and the attack after each ability becomes a forbidden bolt."

msgid "格挡 %d"
msgstr "Blocked %d"

msgid "金光层数 %d（每层 +%d 生命值、+%d 攻击力）"
msgstr "Gold stacks %d (each +%d HP, +%d Attack)"

msgid "本周未上架"
msgstr "Out of rotation"

msgid "横扫状态：%d 秒"
msgstr "Sweep: %ds"

msgid "%s的复制体"
msgstr "%s (Copy)"

msgid "本周羁绊"
msgstr "This week"

msgid "生命上限 -%d"
msgstr "Max Health -%d"

msgid "新"
msgstr "NEW"

msgid "面具"
msgstr "Mask"

msgid "筹码"
msgstr "Chip"

msgid "长矛"
msgstr "Spear"

msgid "特殊羁绊"
msgstr "Special Synergy"

msgid "携带者每次攻击后追打目标 {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[0]} 次"
msgstr "The carrier follows up each attack with {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[0]} extra strike"

msgid "全队单位每受到 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RAGE_THRESHOLD} 点伤害，对最近的敌人释放冲击波"
msgstr "Every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RAGE_THRESHOLD} damage your units take unleashes a shockwave at the nearest enemy"

msgid "每把枪每射出 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[0]} 发子弹，额外射出 1 发金弹"
msgstr "Every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[0]} shots, each Gun fires 1 extra Golden Bullet"

msgid "每 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PERIOD} 秒，敌方全体叠加 1 层腐蚀，每层使其受到的伤害提高 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[0]%}%"
msgstr "Every {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PERIOD} seconds, all enemies gain 1 Corrosion stack, each increasing damage taken by {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[0]%}%"

msgid "每件法器充满 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[1]} 点法力时，释放该法器的主动效果"
msgstr "Each Artifact casts its active effect at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[1]} Mana"

msgid "召唤 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[0]} 根无法被击杀的触手，拍击沿途敌人"
msgstr "Summon {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[0]} unkillable Tentacle that slams enemies in its path"

msgid "每 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[0]} 枚深海币，本局结束时获得"
msgstr "Mint {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[0]} Abyss Coin every {C:GadgetSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, collected after the match"

msgid "每 {C:FoodSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒，每件食物使携带者永久获得 {C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[0]} 最大生命值"
msgstr "Every {C:FoodSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, each Food item permanently grants its carrier {C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[0]} max health"

msgid "生命值高于 {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% 时攻击力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[0]%}%，低于时获得 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[0]%}% 生命偷取"
msgstr "Above {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% health: +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[0]%}% attack damage. Below: {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[0]%}% Lifesteal"

msgid "生命值最高的敌人成为猎物，全队对猎物造成的伤害提高 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[0]%}%"
msgstr "The highest-health enemy becomes Prey. Your team deals {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[0]%}% more damage to Prey"

msgid "每个战场开始 {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} 秒后，导弹轰炸并击飞所有敌方单位"
msgstr "{C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} seconds into combat, a missile blasts and knocks up every enemy"

msgid "每个战场开始时，我方所有单位的下一次攻击必定暴击"
msgstr "At the start of combat, every allied unit's next attack is a guaranteed critical strike"

msgid "我方单位释放技能时，每消耗 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[0]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚魔法飞弹"
msgstr "When an ally casts a skill, summon 1 Magic Missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[0]} Energy spent"

msgid "每个战场开始 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} 秒后，百夫长从天而降，击飞全场敌人"
msgstr "{C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} seconds into combat, the Centurion crashes down and knocks up every enemy"

msgid "每个战场开始时，在我方阵地召唤 {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[0]} 只敌方龟的复制体"
msgstr "At the start of combat, summon a copy of {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[0]} enemy turtle on your side"

msgid "消耗品，无法升星，不计入其他羁绊的件数"
msgstr "Consumable. Cannot be upgraded and does not count toward other synergies"

msgid "纸面具"
msgstr "Paper Mask"

msgid "登场获得物理护盾，受到伤害时按护甲朝攻击者掷出纸刃。"
msgstr "Gains a physical shield on deployment. Taking damage throws a paper blade at the attacker based on Armor."

msgid "登场时获得携带者 {C:EqMaskBatch.PAPER_SHIELD_PCT%}% 最大生命值的物理护盾，该护盾只吸收物理伤害。每受到一段攻击或技能伤害，朝攻击者掷出一片纸刃，造成携带者 {C:EqMaskBatch.PAPER_COUNTER%}% 护甲的物理伤害。持续伤害不会触发此效果。"
msgstr "On deployment, gains a physical shield equal to {C:EqMaskBatch.PAPER_SHIELD_PCT%}% of max health that only absorbs physical damage. Each instance of attack or skill damage taken throws a paper blade at the attacker, dealing physical damage equal to {C:EqMaskBatch.PAPER_COUNTER%}% of Armor. Damage over time does not trigger this effect."

msgid "狐狸面具"
msgstr "Fox Mask"

msgid "对最大生命值比自己高的敌人造成的伤害提高，至多提高 {C:EqMaskBatch.FOX_MAX%}%。"
msgstr "Deals more damage to enemies with higher max health than the holder, up to {C:EqMaskBatch.FOX_MAX%}% more."

msgid "对最大生命值高于携带者的敌人伤害提高，提高量随两者最大生命值的差值增加，差值达到 {C:EqMaskBatch.FOX_FULL_DIFF} 时提高 {C:EqMaskBatch.FOX_MAX%}%。"
msgstr "Deals more damage to enemies with higher max health than the holder. The bonus grows with the max health difference, reaching {C:EqMaskBatch.FOX_MAX%}% at a difference of {C:EqMaskBatch.FOX_FULL_DIFF}."

msgid "京剧脸谱"
msgstr "Opera Mask"

msgid "定时按红、黑、白轮换脸谱：红脸加真伤，黑脸减伤加双抗，白脸加攻速并偷龟能。"
msgstr "Periodically cycles Red, Black and White faces: Red adds true damage, Black reduces damage taken and grants Armor and Magic Resist, White grants Attack Speed and steals Energy."

msgid "每 {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_IV} 秒按红、黑、白的顺序换一次脸谱。红脸：攻击额外造成 {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_RED_TRUE%}% 攻击力的真实伤害。黑脸：每段受到的伤害减少 {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_BLACK_FLAT} 点，并获得 {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_BLACK_RES} 护甲和魔抗。白脸：获得 {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_WHITE_ASPD%}% 攻击速度，攻击偷取目标 {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_WHITE_EN} 点龟能。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_IV} seconds, switches face in the order Red, Black, White. Red: attacks deal an extra {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_RED_TRUE%}% Attack as true damage. Black: each instance of damage taken is reduced by {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_BLACK_FLAT}, and gains {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_BLACK_RES} Armor and Magic Resist. White: gains {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_WHITE_ASPD%}% Attack Speed, and attacks steal {C:EqMaskBatch.FACE_WHITE_EN} Energy from the target."

msgid "舞狮头"
msgstr "Lion Dance Head"

msgid "召唤一头【舞狮】，龟能满时冲撞途经的敌人，撞退并眩晕。"
msgstr "Summons a [Lion Dancer] that charges through enemies when its Energy is full, knocking them back and stunning them."

msgid "登场时召唤一头【舞狮】。舞狮龟能满时朝前方冲撞，撞退并眩晕途经的敌人。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a [Lion Dancer]. When its Energy is full it charges forward, knocking back and stunning enemies in its path."

msgid "小丑面具"
msgstr "Clown Mask"

msgid "释放技能后嘲讽附近的敌人并获得护盾，嘲讽时间基于消耗的龟能。"
msgstr "After casting a skill, taunts nearby enemies and gains a shield. Taunt duration is based on the Energy spent."

msgid "释放技能后嘲讽附近的敌人，每消耗 100 点龟能嘲讽 {C:EqMaskBatch.CLOWN_SEC_PER_100} 秒，并获得携带者 {C:EqMaskBatch.CLOWN_SHIELD_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾，持续 {C:EqMaskBatch.CLOWN_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "After casting a skill, taunts nearby enemies for {C:EqMaskBatch.CLOWN_SEC_PER_100} seconds per 100 Energy spent, and gains a shield equal to {C:EqMaskBatch.CLOWN_SHIELD_PCT%}% of max health for {C:EqMaskBatch.CLOWN_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "鬼面"
msgstr "Ghost Mask"

msgid "生命值首次降到一半时潜行并回复生命值。"
msgstr "The first time health drops to half, enters stealth and restores health."

msgid "生命值首次降到 {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_LINE%}% 时进入潜行，持续 {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_SEC} 秒：无法被选中，攻击时现形，{C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_REHIDE} 秒后重新潜行。这段时间内每秒回复携带者 {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_REGEN%}% 最大生命值。每个战场一次。"
msgstr "The first time health drops to {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_LINE%}%, enters stealth for {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_SEC} seconds: cannot be targeted, is revealed when attacking, and re-enters stealth after {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_REHIDE} seconds. During this time, restores {C:EqMaskBatch.GHOST_REGEN%}% of max health per second. Once per battle."

msgid "防毒面具"
msgstr "Gas Mask"

msgid "免疫灼烧、中毒和流血，每损失 1% 生命值获得 {C:EqMaskBatch.GAS_MOVE_PER_PCT%}% 移动速度。"
msgstr "Immune to Burn, Poison and Bleed. Gains {C:EqMaskBatch.GAS_MOVE_PER_PCT%}% Move Speed for each 1% of health lost."

msgid "免疫灼烧、中毒和流血。每损失 1% 生命值，获得 {C:EqMaskBatch.GAS_MOVE_PER_PCT%}% 移动速度。"
msgstr "Immune to Burn, Poison and Bleed. Gains {C:EqMaskBatch.GAS_MOVE_PER_PCT%}% Move Speed for each 1% of health lost."

msgid "威尼斯面具"
msgstr "Venetian Mask"

msgid "首次受到致命伤害时倒地复活，继续战斗。"
msgstr "The first time it takes lethal damage, falls down instead of dying, then rises to keep fighting."

msgid "首次受到致命伤害时倒地不死，{C:EqMaskBatch.VEN_SEC} 秒内生命值逐渐回复至携带者 {C:EqMaskBatch.VEN_HEAL%}% 最大生命值后继续战斗，倒地期间无法被选中。每个战场一次。"
msgstr "The first time it takes lethal damage, falls down instead of dying, gradually restores health to {C:EqMaskBatch.VEN_HEAL%}% of max health over {C:EqMaskBatch.VEN_SEC} seconds, then keeps fighting. Cannot be targeted while down. Once per battle."

msgid "黄金面具"
msgstr "Golden Mask"

msgid "金光钉住一名敌人持续造成递增的真实伤害直到其死亡，击杀生成深海币并让这件面具永久成长。"
msgstr "A golden beam pins an enemy, dealing escalating true damage until it dies. Kills create Abyss Coins and permanently grow this mask."

msgid "面具升空射出一道金光，{C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_DELAY} 秒后从天而降钉住一名敌人，每秒造成（{C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_FLAT}+目标 {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_PCT%}% 最大生命值）真实伤害，之后每过 1 秒，每秒伤害再提高 {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_RAMP%}%，直到目标死亡。目标死亡后金光冷却 {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_CD} 秒。金光每击杀一个单位，生成 1 枚深海币，并使这件黄金面具永久获得 1 层，每层提供 {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_STK_HP} 最大生命值和 {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_STK_ATK} 攻击力。"
msgstr "The mask rises and fires a golden beam that crashes down after {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_DELAY} seconds and pins an enemy, dealing ({C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_FLAT} + {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_PCT%}% of the target's max health) true damage per second. Each second after that, the damage per second increases by {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_RAMP%}% until the target dies. After the target dies, the beam goes on a {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_CD}-second cooldown. Each unit the beam kills creates 1 Abyss Coin and permanently gives this Golden Mask 1 stack. Each stack grants {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_STK_HP} max health and {C:EqMaskBatch.GOLD_STK_ATK} Attack."

msgid "千面"
msgstr "Thousand Faces"

msgid "把一名敌人拽进里世界决斗，期间持续偷取它的属性。"
msgstr "Drags an enemy into the Otherworld for a duel, stealing its stats throughout."

msgid "每个战场开始 {C:OtherworldSystem.OW_AT} 秒后，把一名随机敌人拽进里世界决斗，至多 {C:OtherworldSystem.OW_SEC} 秒。在里世界中每秒偷取敌方 {C:OtherworldSystem.OW_STEAL%}% 攻击力、护甲和魔抗，偷到的属性持续到战场结束。里世界中一方全部阵亡时决斗提前结束。"
msgstr "{C:OtherworldSystem.OW_AT} seconds into combat, drags a random enemy into the Otherworld for a duel lasting up to {C:OtherworldSystem.OW_SEC} seconds. In the Otherworld, steals {C:OtherworldSystem.OW_STEAL%}% of the enemy's Attack, Armor and Magic Resist every second. Stolen stats last until the battlefield ends. The duel ends early when either side is defeated."

msgid "竹矛"
msgstr "Bamboo Spear"

msgid "每第三次攻击刺出一道竹刺浪。"
msgstr "Every third attack sends out a wave of bamboo spikes."

msgid "每第 {C:EqSpearBatch.BAMBOO_EVERY} 次攻击，朝最远的敌人方向从地里刺出一道竹刺浪，对路径上的每名敌人造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.BAMBOO_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqSpearBatch.BAMBOO_EVERY}rd attack, bamboo spikes burst from the ground toward the farthest enemy, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.BAMBOO_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage to each enemy in the path."

msgid "鱼叉"
msgstr "Harpoon"

msgid "定时叉住伤害最高的敌人拉过来。"
msgstr "Periodically harpoons the highest-damage enemy and drags it in."

msgid "每 {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_IV} 秒朝造成伤害最多的敌人射出鱼叉，造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_DMG} 魔法伤害并眩晕 {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_STUN} 秒，眩晕期间每 {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_PULL_IV} 秒把它朝自己拉近一段距离。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_IV} seconds, fires a harpoon at the enemy that has dealt the most damage, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_DMG} magic damage and stunning it for {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_STUN} seconds. While stunned, it is pulled closer every {C:EqSpearBatch.HARPOON_PULL_IV} seconds."

msgid "标枪"
msgstr "Javelin"

msgid "定时朝最远的敌人掷标枪，附带流血。"
msgstr "Periodically throws a javelin at the farthest enemy, applying Bleed."

msgid "每 {C:EqSpearBatch.JAV_IV} 秒朝最远的敌人掷出一根标枪，造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.JAV_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害，并施加 {C:EqSpearBatch.JAV_BLEED_PCT%}% 攻击力的流血层数。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqSpearBatch.JAV_IV} seconds, throws a javelin at the farthest enemy, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.JAV_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage and applying Bleed stacks equal to {C:EqSpearBatch.JAV_BLEED_PCT%}% Attack."

msgid "骑枪"
msgstr "Lance"

msgid "跑起来攒冲势，下一击击飞敌人。"
msgstr "Builds Momentum while moving. The next attack knocks the enemy up."

msgid "移动时积攒冲势，冲势达到上限后，下一次攻击消耗全部冲势，造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.LANCE_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害，将目标击飞并眩晕 {C:EqSpearBatch.LANCE_STUN} 秒，自己回复 {C:EqSpearBatch.LANCE_EN} 点龟能。"
msgstr "Builds Momentum while moving. At max Momentum, the next attack consumes all of it, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.LANCE_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage, knocking the target up and stunning it for {C:EqSpearBatch.LANCE_STUN} seconds, and restoring {C:EqSpearBatch.LANCE_EN} Energy."

msgid "长戟"
msgstr "Halberd"

msgid "按攻击节奏横扫前方一片。"
msgstr "Sweeps the area in front in rhythm with attacks."

msgid "每隔一次攻击间隔朝最近的敌人横扫前方扇形，半径等于携带者攻击射程，近战时半径额外增加。对扇形内每名敌人造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.HALB_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Once per attack interval, sweeps a cone in front toward the nearest enemy. The radius equals Attack Range, with extra radius in melee. Deals {C:EqSpearBatch.HALB_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage to each enemy in the cone."

msgid "盾矛"
msgstr "Shield Spear"

msgid "定时举盾存伤害，放盾时化成护盾和冲击波。"
msgstr "Periodically raises a shield to store damage, then releases it as a shield and a shockwave."

msgid "每 {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_IV} 秒举盾 {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_SEC} 秒，期间受到的每段攻击和技能伤害降低 {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_FLAT} 点，并把这些伤害存起来。放下盾时获得存下伤害 {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_SHIELD_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并朝前方推出一道冲击波，路径上的敌人分摊存下伤害 {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_WAVE_PCT%}% 的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_IV} seconds, raises a shield for {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_SEC} seconds, reducing each instance of attack and skill damage taken by {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_FLAT} and storing that damage. When lowering the shield, gains a shield equal to {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_SHIELD_PCT%}% of the stored damage for {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and pushes a shockwave forward. Enemies in its path split {C:EqSpearBatch.SHSP_WAVE_PCT%}% of the stored damage as magic damage."

msgid "方天画戟"
msgstr "Sky Piercer"

msgid "受到伤害时积攒层数，跃起砸地，之后攻击附带横扫。"
msgstr "Builds stacks when taking damage, leaps and slams the ground, then attacks sweep all around."

msgid "受到伤害时积攒层数，层数达到上限后原地蓄力跃起，将戟砸入地面，对周围大范围的敌人造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_SLAM_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害并击飞。之后 {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_BUFF_SEC} 秒内每次攻击额外绕身横扫一圈，对周围的敌人造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害，并回复 {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_HEAL} 生命值。"
msgstr "Builds stacks when taking damage. At max stacks, charges up, leaps and drives the halberd into the ground, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_SLAM_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage to enemies in a large area and knocking them up. For the next {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_BUFF_SEC} seconds, each attack also sweeps all around, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage to nearby enemies and restoring {C:EqSpearBatch.FTJ_HEAL} health."

msgid "投矛器"
msgstr "Atlatl"

msgid "定时朝敌人扎堆处落一场矛雨。"
msgstr "Periodically rains spears where enemies cluster."

msgid "每 {C:EqSpearBatch.ATL_IV} 秒朝敌人最密集的位置投出 {C:EqSpearBatch.ATL_N} 根矛，矛雨陆续落在那一圈里，每根对落点附近的敌人造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.ATL_PCT%}% 攻击力的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqSpearBatch.ATL_IV} seconds, hurls {C:EqSpearBatch.ATL_N} spears at the densest group of enemies. The spears land one after another within that area, each dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.ATL_PCT%}% Attack as physical damage to enemies near where it lands."

msgid "永恒之枪"
msgstr "Eternal Spear"

msgid "积攒进度满后，永恒之枪从场外飞向生命值最高的敌人，将其击倒拖行，并获得临时生命值、点燃携带者周围的灼烧圈。"
msgstr "When its charge is full, the Eternal Spear flies in from off the field at the highest-health enemy, knocking it down and dragging it, while the holder gains temporary health and ignites a Burn ring around itself."

msgid "积攒进度：每秒 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PS} 点，每造成或受到 100 点伤害 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PER_DMG} 点，永恒之枪自身的伤害不计入。进度满 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_NEED} 时，永恒之枪从场外飞向生命值最高的敌人，造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_HIT_ATK%}% 攻击力 + 目标 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_HIT_HP%}% 最大生命值的物理伤害，将其击倒滑行并眩晕 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_STUN} 秒，滑行共造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_SLIDE_ATK%}% 攻击力 + 目标 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_SLIDE_HP%}% 最大生命值的物理伤害。滑行路径上的其他敌人受到 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PASS_ATK%}% 攻击力 + 其 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PASS_HP%}% 最大生命值的物理伤害。目标免疫控制时转而额外受到 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_IMM_ATK%}% 攻击力 + 目标 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_IMM_HP%}% 最大生命值的物理伤害。\n命中时携带者获得 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_TEMP%}% 最大生命值的临时生命值，持续 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_TEMP_SEC} 秒，周围燃起灼烧圈 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_BURN_SEC} 秒，每秒对圈内敌人造成其 {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_BURN_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。临时生命值与灼烧圈均可叠加。"
msgstr "Builds charge during combat: {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PS} per second and {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PER_DMG} per 100 damage dealt or taken. Damage from the Eternal Spear itself does not count. At {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_NEED} charge, an Eternal Spear flies in from off the field at the highest-health enemy, dealing {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_HIT_ATK%}% Attack + {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_HIT_HP%}% of the target's max health as physical damage, knocking it down and sliding it backward. The slide deals a total of {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_SLIDE_ATK%}% Attack + {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_SLIDE_HP%}% of the target's max health as physical damage and stuns for {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_STUN} seconds. Other enemies in the slide path take {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PASS_ATK%}% Attack + {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_PASS_HP%}% of their max health as physical damage. If the target is immune to crowd control, it instead takes an extra {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_IMM_ATK%}% Attack + {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_IMM_HP%}% of its max health as physical damage.\nOn hit, the holder gains temporary health equal to {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_TEMP%}% of max health for {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_TEMP_SEC} seconds, and a Burn ring ignites around the holder for {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_BURN_SEC} seconds, dealing magic damage equal to {C:EqSpearBatch.ETERNAL_BURN_PCT%}% of each enemy's max health per second to enemies inside. Temporary health and Burn rings both stack."

msgid "圣枪"
msgstr "Holy Spear"

msgid "首次半血时获得圣枪护盾与双抗。护盾存入储能，定期引导光球：强化友军或攻击敌人。"
msgstr "The first time it drops to half health, gains a Holy Spear shield, Armor and Magic Resist. Shields fill Stored Energy, which periodically channels light orbs that empower allies or strike enemies."

msgid "每个战场中生命值首次低于 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_GUARD_AT%}% 时，在 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_GUARD_SEC} 秒内每秒获得一层圣枪护盾，共计携带者 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_GUARD_PCT%}% 最大生命值，圣枪护盾不会衰减。同时获得 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_RESIST} 护甲和魔抗，持续到这个战场结束。\n获得任何护盾时，将护盾值存入储能，储能上限为携带者最大生命值。每 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_IV} 秒开始引导：每 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_IV} 秒消耗 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_COST} 点储能，向场上随机一个单位射出光球，储能不足时引导结束。光球命中友方统领或小将时，使其获得 1 点临时等级（持续到这个战场结束）并回复 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_HEAL} 生命值。命中敌方单位时，造成 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_DMG} 魔法伤害，并为携带者提供 {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_SHIELD} 护盾。"
msgstr "In each battlefield, the first time health drops below {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_GUARD_AT%}%, gains a layer of Holy Spear shield every second for {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_GUARD_SEC} seconds, totaling {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_GUARD_PCT%}% of max health. Holy Spear shields do not decay. Also gains {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_RESIST} Armor and Magic Resist until this battlefield ends.\nWhenever it gains any shield, the shield amount is added to Stored Energy, up to max health. Every {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_IV} seconds, starts channeling: every {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_IV} seconds, spends {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_COST} Stored Energy to fire a light orb at a random unit on the field. Channeling ends when Stored Energy runs out. An orb that hits an allied Leader or Minion grants it 1 temporary level (until this battlefield ends) and restores {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_HEAL} health. An orb that hits an enemy unit deals {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_DMG} magic damage and grants the holder {C:EqSpearBatch.HOLY_ORB_SHIELD} shield."

msgid "白色筹码"
msgstr "White Chip"

msgid "提供攻击力与攻击速度。"
msgstr "Grants Attack and Attack Speed."

msgid "消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "粉色筹码"
msgstr "Pink Chip"

msgid "提供生命值与护甲。"
msgstr "Grants health and Armor."

msgid "红色筹码"
msgstr "Red Chip"

msgid "提供攻击力与暴击率。"
msgstr "Grants Attack and Crit Chance."

msgid "绿色筹码"
msgstr "Green Chip"

msgid "提供生命值与魔抗，并持续回复生命值。"
msgstr "Grants health and Magic Resist, and continuously restores health."

msgid "每秒回复携带者 {C:EqChipBatch.GREEN_REGEN%}% 最大生命值。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "Restores {C:EqChipBatch.GREEN_REGEN%}% of max health per second. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "黑色筹码"
msgstr "Black Chip"

msgid "登场时为全队提供物理护盾。"
msgstr "On deployment, grants the whole team a physical shield."

msgid "登场时为所有友军提供相当于携带者 {C:EqChipBatch.SHIELD_PCT%}% 最大生命值的物理护盾，该护盾只吸收物理伤害，不会消散。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "On deployment, grants all allies a physical shield equal to {C:EqChipBatch.SHIELD_PCT%}% of the holder's max health. It only absorbs physical damage and does not decay. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "紫色筹码"
msgstr "Purple Chip"

msgid "登场时为全队提供魔法护盾。"
msgstr "On deployment, grants the whole team a magic shield."

msgid "登场时为所有友军提供相当于携带者 {C:EqChipBatch.SHIELD_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法护盾，该护盾只吸收魔法伤害，不会消散。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "On deployment, grants all allies a magic shield equal to {C:EqChipBatch.SHIELD_PCT%}% of the holder's max health. It only absorbs magic damage and does not decay. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "黄色筹码"
msgstr "Yellow Chip"

msgid "提供攻击属性，整个战场免疫控制。"
msgstr "Grants attack stats and immunity to crowd control for the whole battlefield."

msgid "整个战场免疫控制。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "Immune to crowd control for the whole battlefield. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "棕色筹码"
msgstr "Brown Chip"

msgid "提供护甲与魔抗，首次受到致命伤害时倒地不死。"
msgstr "Grants Armor and Magic Resist. The first time it takes lethal damage, falls down instead of dying."

msgid "首次受到致命伤害时倒地不死，{C:EqChipBatch.BROWN_SEC} 秒内回复至携带者 {C:EqChipBatch.BROWN_HEAL%}% 最大生命值后继续战斗。每个战场一次。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "The first time it takes lethal damage, falls down instead of dying, restores to {C:EqChipBatch.BROWN_HEAL%}% of max health over {C:EqChipBatch.BROWN_SEC} seconds, then keeps fighting. Once per battle. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "金色筹码"
msgstr "Gold Chip"

msgid "每个战场开始 {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_AT} 秒后为全队套上金色护罩并提升全队属性。"
msgstr "{C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_AT} seconds into combat, covers the whole team in a golden barrier and boosts team stats."

msgid "每个战场开始 {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_AT} 秒后，为所有友军套上金色护罩，持续 {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_SEC} 秒，期间免疫伤害与负面效果，并使所有友军在这个战场获得 {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_TEAM_ATK} 攻击力、{C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_TEAM_RES} 护甲和魔抗。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "{C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_AT} seconds into combat, covers all allies in a golden barrier for {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_SEC} seconds, making them immune to damage and negative effects, and grants all allies {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_TEAM_ATK} Attack and {C:EqChipBatch.GOLD_TEAM_RES} Armor and Magic Resist for this battlefield. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "灰色筹码"
msgstr "Grey Chip"

msgid "攻击或受到攻击时叠层，每层提升攻击力、护甲、魔抗与生命值。"
msgstr "Gains stacks when attacking or being attacked. Each stack grants Attack, Armor, Magic Resist and health."

msgid "每次攻击或受到攻击获得 1 层，至多 {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_CAP} 层。每层提供 {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_ATK} 攻击力、{C:EqChipBatch.GREY_RES} 护甲和魔抗、{C:EqChipBatch.GREY_HP} 最大生命值。层数达到上限后额外获得 {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_FULL_AMP%}% 增伤与 {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_FULL_DR%}% 减伤。消耗品：无法升星，一场积分赛、闯关赛或决赛日对局结束后消失。"
msgstr "Gains 1 stack each time it attacks or is attacked, up to {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_CAP} stacks. Each stack grants {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_ATK} Attack, {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_RES} Armor and Magic Resist, and {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_HP} max health. At max stacks, also gains {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_FULL_AMP%}% Damage Amp and {C:EqChipBatch.GREY_FULL_DR%}% Damage Reduction. Consumable: cannot be upgraded. Disappears after one Ranked, Gauntlet or Finals Day match."

msgid "魔法护盾"
msgstr "Magic Shield"

msgid "每件剑为携带者提供攻击力。"
msgstr "Each Sword grants its carrier attack damage."

msgid "【剑士】携带者每次攻击后追打目标，追打伤害按身上剑的件数计算。"
msgstr "[Swordsman] The carrier follows up on its target after each attack. Follow-up damage scales with the number of Swords it carries."

msgid "【血祭】全队单位损失生命值时，攻击力提高。"
msgstr "[Blood Rite] Your units gain attack damage as they lose health."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:atk} 攻击力，追打 {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[k]} 次，身上每件剑使追打造成 {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[k]%}% 攻击伤害，全队每损失 1% 生命值攻击力提高 {C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[k]}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:atk} attack damage, {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[k]} follow-up strike(s), each Sword carried makes follow-ups deal {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[k]%}% attack damage, your team gains {C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[k]}% attack damage per 1% health lost"

msgid "追打速度为攻击速度的 {C:SwordsmanSystem.ASPD_MULT%}%，每次追打都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时与命中时的装备效果。"
msgstr "Follow-ups strike at {C:SwordsmanSystem.ASPD_MULT%}% of attack speed. Each follow-up counts as an attack and triggers on-attack and on-hit item effects."

msgid "每件奇械为携带者提供魔抗。"
msgstr "Each Gadget grants its carrier magic resist."

msgid "【铸币】每 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒铸造深海币，本局结束时获得。"
msgstr "[Minting] Mint Abyss Coins every {C:GadgetSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, collected after the match."

msgid "【冰封】全队攻击有概率冰封目标 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "[Freeze] Your team's attacks have a chance to freeze the target for {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:mr} 魔抗，每次铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[0]} 枚深海币，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[0]} 枚"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:mr} magic resist, mint {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[0]} Abyss Coin each time, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[0]} per match"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:mr} 魔抗，每次铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[1]} 枚深海币，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[1]} 枚，冰封概率 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[1]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:mr} magic resist, mint {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[1]} Abyss Coins each time, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[1]} per match, {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[1]%}% freeze chance"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:mr} 魔抗，每次铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[2]} 枚深海币，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[2]} 枚，冰封概率 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[2]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:mr} magic resist, mint {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[2]} Abyss Coins each time, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[2]} per match, {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[2]%}% freeze chance"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:mr} 魔抗，每次铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[3]} 枚深海币，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[3]} 枚，冰封概率 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[3]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:mr} magic resist, mint {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[3]} Abyss Coins each time, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[3]} per match, {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[3]%}% freeze chance"

msgid "同一目标每 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CD} 秒至多被冰封 1 次，冰封结束后 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_IMMUNE} 秒内免疫冰封。"
msgstr "The same target can be frozen at most once every {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CD} seconds, and is immune to Freeze for {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_IMMUNE} seconds after it ends."

msgid "队伍里每件装备为携带者提供最大生命值，食物提供双倍。"
msgstr "Each item on your team grants its carrier max health. Food grants double."

msgid "【成长】每 {C:FoodSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒，每件食物使携带者永久获得最大生命值，持续到本局结束。"
msgstr "[Growth] Every {C:FoodSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, each Food permanently grants its carrier max health until the match ends."

msgid "【学院】全队获得最大生命值。"
msgstr "[Academy] Your team gains max health."

msgid "【盛宴】每 {C:SynergySystem.PULSE} 秒，全队回复已损失生命值。"
msgstr "[Feast] Every {C:SynergySystem.PULSE} seconds, your team restores missing health."

msgid "每件装备 +{STAT:_foodPerEquip}、每件食物 +{STATx2:_foodPerEquip} 最大生命值，每件食物每次成长 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[0]} 最大生命值"
msgstr "Each item +{STAT:_foodPerEquip}, each Food +{STATx2:_foodPerEquip} max health, each Food grows +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[0]} max health each time"

msgid "每件装备 +{STAT:_foodPerEquip}、每件食物 +{STATx2:_foodPerEquip} 最大生命值，每件食物每次成长 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[1]} 最大生命值，全队 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[1]} 最大生命值"
msgstr "Each item +{STAT:_foodPerEquip}, each Food +{STATx2:_foodPerEquip} max health, each Food grows +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[1]} max health each time, team +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[1]} max health"

msgid "每件装备 +{STAT:_foodPerEquip}、每件食物 +{STATx2:_foodPerEquip} 最大生命值，每件食物每次成长 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[2]} 最大生命值，全队 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[2]} 最大生命值，盛宴回复 {C:SynergySystem.FEAST_PCT[2]%}% 已损失生命值"
msgstr "Each item +{STAT:_foodPerEquip}, each Food +{STATx2:_foodPerEquip} max health, each Food grows +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[2]} max health each time, team +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[2]} max health, Feast restores {C:SynergySystem.FEAST_PCT[2]%}% of missing health"

msgid "每件盾为携带者提供护甲。"
msgstr "Each Shield grants its carrier armor."

msgid "【怒气】全队单位每受到 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RAGE_THRESHOLD} 点伤害，对最近的敌人释放冲击波，造成按自身最大生命值计算的真实伤害，并获得该伤害 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.SHIELD_FROM_DMG%}% 的护盾。"
msgstr "[Rage] For every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RAGE_THRESHOLD} damage a unit on your team takes, it releases a shockwave at the nearest enemy, dealing true damage based on its own max health and gaining a shield equal to {C:ShieldSynergySystem.SHIELD_FROM_DMG%}% of that damage."

msgid "【圣光护盾】获得圣光护盾装备，不占装备位，羁绊失效时收回。携带者 +250 最大生命值，每 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} 秒获得 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} 点圣光护盾值。有圣光护盾值时，每段受到的伤害对攻击者造成 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} 点真实伤害。"
msgstr "[Holy Light Shield] Gain Holy Light Shield items. They take no item slot and are removed if the synergy deactivates. The holder gets +250 max health and {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} Holy Shield every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} seconds. While it has Holy Shield, each instance of damage taken deals {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} true damage to the attacker."

msgid "【收殓】敌方单位阵亡时，最近的携带盾者获得相当于该单位 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.REAP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾。"
msgstr "[Reap] When an enemy unit dies, the nearest Shield carrier gains a shield equal to {C:ShieldSynergySystem.REAP_PCT%}% of that unit's max health."

msgid "【圣光·强化】盾类装备提供护盾或治疗时，额外提供其 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_CONVERT%}% 的圣光护盾值，圣光护盾装备生成的圣光护盾值提高 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_SHIELD_BONUS%}%。"
msgstr "[Holy Light Empowered] When Shield items grant shields or healing, they also grant {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_CONVERT%}% of it as Holy Shield. Holy Light Shield items generate {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_SHIELD_BONUS%}% more Holy Shield."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:def} 护甲，冲击波造成自身 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[0]%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害，获得 1 件圣光护盾"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:def} armor, shockwave deals {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[0]%}% of own max health as true damage, gain 1 Holy Light Shield"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:def} 护甲，冲击波造成自身 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[1]%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害，获得 2 件圣光护盾，收殓"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:def} armor, shockwave deals {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[1]%}% of own max health as true damage, gain 2 Holy Light Shields, Reap"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:def} 护甲，冲击波造成自身 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[2]%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害，获得 2 件圣光护盾，收殓，圣光·强化"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:def} armor, shockwave deals {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[2]%}% of own max health as true damage, gain 2 Holy Light Shields, Reap, Holy Light Empowered"

msgid "每件药水为携带者提供治疗强度、护盾强度与最大龟能。"
msgstr "Each Potion grants its carrier Heal Power, Shield Power and max Energy."

msgid "【猎物】将生命值最高的敌人标记为猎物，龟蛋除外。猎物阵亡后 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒内重新标记。全队对猎物造成的伤害提高。"
msgstr "[Prey] The highest-health enemy is marked as Prey (eggs excluded). A new Prey is marked within {C:PotionSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds after it dies. Your team deals more damage to Prey."

msgid "【战利品】每击杀 1 名猎物，全队永久获得攻击力，持续到本局结束。"
msgstr "[Spoils] Each Prey killed permanently grants your team attack damage until the match ends."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:healAmp}% 治疗强度、+{STAT:shieldAmp}% 护盾强度、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，对猎物的伤害提高 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[0]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:healAmp}% Heal Power, +{STAT:shieldAmp}% Shield Power, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[0]%}% more damage to Prey"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:healAmp}% 治疗强度、+{STAT:shieldAmp}% 护盾强度、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，对猎物的伤害提高 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[1]%}%，每击杀 1 名猎物全队 +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[1]} 攻击力"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:healAmp}% Heal Power, +{STAT:shieldAmp}% Shield Power, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[1]%}% more damage to Prey, team +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[1]} attack damage per Prey killed"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:healAmp}% 治疗强度、+{STAT:shieldAmp}% 护盾强度、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，对猎物的伤害提高 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[2]%}%，每击杀 1 名猎物全队 +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[2]} 攻击力"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:healAmp}% Heal Power, +{STAT:shieldAmp}% Shield Power, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[2]%}% more damage to Prey, team +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[2]} attack damage per Prey killed"

msgid "每件枪为携带者提供攻击速度。"
msgstr "Each Gun grants its carrier attack speed."

msgid "【金弹】每把枪定期额外射出 1 发金弹，金弹继承该枪子弹的全部效果，并额外造成真实伤害。"
msgstr "[Golden Bullet] Each gun periodically fires 1 extra Golden Bullet. It carries all of that gun's bullet effects and deals bonus true damage."

msgid "【炮台一】我方前方生成一座炮台，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.TICK} 秒对它与最近敌人连线上的所有敌人造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_DMG} 物理伤害，无视护甲，并为生命值最低的友军回复造成伤害 {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_HEAL_SHARE%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "[Turret I] A turret appears at your front. Every {C:GunSynergySystem.TICK} seconds, it deals {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_DMG} physical damage to all enemies on the line to the nearest enemy, ignoring armor, and heals your lowest-health ally for {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_HEAL_SHARE%}% of the damage dealt."

msgid "【炮台二】我方中心生成第二座炮台，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PERIOD} 秒产出 {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_BASE_ENERGY} 点能量，全队每件枪再 +{C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PER_GUN} 点。能量交替转化为全队均摊的护盾，或对敌方全体均摊的真实伤害。"
msgstr "[Turret II] A second turret appears at your center. Every {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PERIOD} seconds, it produces {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_BASE_ENERGY} energy, plus {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PER_GUN} per Gun on your team. The energy alternates between shields split across your team and true damage split across all enemies."

msgid "【炮台三·火控】我方后方生成第三座炮台，使携带枪者额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.T3_BASE%}% 真实伤害，身上每件枪再 +{C:GunSynergySystem.T3_PER_GUN%}%。"
msgstr "[Turret III: Fire Control] A third turret appears at your rear, making Gun carriers deal {C:GunSynergySystem.T3_BASE%}% bonus true damage, plus {C:GunSynergySystem.T3_PER_GUN%}% per Gun carried."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_aspdPct}% 攻击速度，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[0]} 发射出 1 发金弹，金弹额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% 真实伤害，炮台一"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_aspdPct}% attack speed, 1 Golden Bullet every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[0]} shots, Golden Bullets deal {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% bonus true damage, Turret I"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_aspdPct}% 攻击速度，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[1]} 发射出 1 发金弹，金弹额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% 真实伤害，炮台一、炮台二"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_aspdPct}% attack speed, 1 Golden Bullet every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[1]} shots, Golden Bullets deal {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% bonus true damage, Turrets I and II"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_aspdPct}% 攻击速度，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[2]} 发射出 1 发金弹，金弹额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% 真实伤害，炮台一、炮台二、炮台三"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_aspdPct}% attack speed, 1 Golden Bullet every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[2]} shots, Golden Bullets deal {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% bonus true damage, Turrets I, II and III"

msgid "每件弓箭为携带者提供暴击率。"
msgstr "Each Bow grants its carrier crit chance."

msgid "【处决】全队攻击生命值低于处决线的敌人时直接处决，攻击者的部分暴击率计入处决线。"
msgstr "[Execute] Your team's attacks execute enemies below the execute threshold. Part of the attacker's crit chance is added to the threshold."

msgid "【腐蚀】每 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PERIOD} 秒，敌方全体叠加 1 层腐蚀，至多 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX} 层。每层使其受到的伤害提高，满层时受到的部分伤害转化为真实伤害。"
msgstr "[Corrosion] Every {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PERIOD} seconds, all enemies gain 1 Corrosion stack, up to {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX}. Each stack increases damage taken. At max stacks, part of the damage taken becomes true damage."

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:crit}% 暴击率，处决线 {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[0]%}%，暴击率的 {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[0]%}% 计入处决线，每层腐蚀使受到的伤害提高 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[0]%}%，满层 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% 转化为真实伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:crit}% crit chance, {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[0]%}% execute threshold, {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[0]%}% of crit chance added to it, each Corrosion stack +{C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[0]%}% damage taken, {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% becomes true damage at max stacks"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:crit}% 暴击率，处决线 {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[1]%}%，暴击率的 {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[1]%}% 计入处决线，每层腐蚀使受到的伤害提高 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[1]%}%，满层 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% 转化为真实伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:crit}% crit chance, {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[1]%}% execute threshold, {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[1]%}% of crit chance added to it, each Corrosion stack +{C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[1]%}% damage taken, {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% becomes true damage at max stacks"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:crit}% 暴击率，处决线 {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[2]%}%，暴击率的 {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[2]%}% 计入处决线，每层腐蚀使受到的伤害提高 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[2]%}%，满层 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% 转化为真实伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:crit}% crit chance, {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[2]%}% execute threshold, {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[2]%}% of crit chance added to it, each Corrosion stack +{C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[2]%}% damage taken, {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% becomes true damage at max stacks"

msgid "每件法器为携带者提供魔法穿透与最大龟能。"
msgstr "Each Artifact grants its carrier Magic Pen and max Energy."

msgid "【法力】每件法器有独立的法力，充满时释放该法器的主动效果。每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒回复 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_PER_TICK} 点，携带者造成或受到伤害时也会回复。"
msgstr "[Mana] Each Artifact has its own mana and casts its active effect when full. It restores {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_PER_TICK} mana every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds, and also when the carrier deals or takes damage."

msgid "【余韵】友军受到治疗时，额外获得护盾。"
msgstr "[Echo] Allies gain a shield when healed."

msgid "【共鸣】每 {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_PERIOD} 秒，全队回复 {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_HEAL%}% 最大生命值，并依次净化眩晕、减速、灼烧、中毒、诅咒。"
msgstr "[Resonance] Every {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_PERIOD} seconds, your team restores {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_HEAL%}% max health and cleanses Stun, Slow, Burn, Poison and Curse in that order."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:magicPen} 魔法穿透、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，法力 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[1]} 点充满"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:magicPen} Magic Pen, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, mana full at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[1]}"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:magicPen} 魔法穿透、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，法力 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[2]} 点充满"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:magicPen} Magic Pen, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, mana full at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[2]}"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:magicPen} 魔法穿透、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，法力 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[3]} 点充满，余韵护盾为治疗量的 {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[2]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:magicPen} Magic Pen, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, mana full at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[3]}, Echo shield equals {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[2]%}% of the healing"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:magicPen} 魔法穿透、+{STAT:_maxEnergy} 最大龟能，法力 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[4]} 点充满，余韵护盾为治疗量的 {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[3]%}%，共鸣净化 {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_DISPEL[3]} 种减益"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:magicPen} Magic Pen, +{STAT:_maxEnergy} max Energy, mana full at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[4]}, Echo shield equals {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[3]%}% of the healing, Resonance cleanses {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_DISPEL[3]} debuffs"

msgid "未激活羁绊时，法力 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[0]} 点充满。"
msgstr "Without the synergy active, mana is full at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[0]}."

msgid "每件灵物为携带者提供闪避。"
msgstr "Each Spirit grants its carrier dodge."

msgid "【触手】召唤无法被击杀的触手。触手每 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.SLAP_PERIOD} 秒获得 1 层拍击，无上限。射程内有敌人时消耗 1 层，朝最近的敌人拍下，对沿途敌人造成 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_FLAT} 外加 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_HP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。"
msgstr "[Tentacles] Summon unkillable tentacles. Each tentacle gains 1 Slam stack every {C:SpiritSynergySystem.SLAP_PERIOD} seconds, with no cap. When an enemy is in range, it spends 1 stack to slam toward the nearest enemy, dealing {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_FLAT} + {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_HP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage to enemies in the path."

msgid "【闪避蓄能】我方任一单位闪避成功时，每根触手获得 1 层拍击。"
msgstr "[Dodge Charge] Whenever a unit on your team dodges, each tentacle gains 1 Slam stack."

msgid "【亡灵】友方单位阵亡时原地召唤 1 只【亡魂】，继承其部分攻击力与生命值，自动攻击最近的敌人。"
msgstr "[Undeath] When an allied unit dies, 1 [Wraith] rises in its place, inheriting part of its Attack and health, and attacks the nearest enemy."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:dodgePct}% 闪避，{C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[0]} 根触手，召唤亡魂"
msgstr "+{STAT:dodgePct}% Dodge each, {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[0]} tentacle(s), summons Wraiths"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:dodgePct}% 闪避，{C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[1]} 根触手，闪避蓄能，亡魂继承更多属性，阵亡后可再化为亡魂"
msgstr "+{STAT:dodgePct}% Dodge each, {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[1]} tentacles, Dodge Charge, Wraiths inherit more and can rise again after dying"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:dodgePct}% 闪避，{C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[2]} 根触手，拍击伤害变为原来的 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[2]%}%，亡魂继承更多属性，可多次再化为亡魂"
msgstr "+{STAT:dodgePct}% Dodge each, {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[2]} tentacles, slam damage becomes {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[2]%}%, Wraiths inherit more and can rise again several times"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:dodgePct}% 闪避，{C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[3]} 根触手，拍击伤害变为原来的 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[3]%}%，亡魂继承阵亡单位全部的生命值与攻击力"
msgstr "+{STAT:dodgePct}% Dodge each, {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[3]} tentacles, slam damage becomes {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[3]%}%, Wraiths inherit all of the fallen unit's health and Attack"

msgid "每件炸弹为携带者提供护甲穿透。"
msgstr "Each Bomb grants its carrier Armor Pen."

msgid "【导弹轰炸】每个战场开始 {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} 秒后，导弹落到战场中心，对所有敌方单位造成物理伤害并击飞 {C:BombSynergySystem.AIR_SEC} 秒，龟蛋除外。"
msgstr "[Missile Strike] {C:BombSynergySystem.FIRE_AT} seconds into each battlefield, a missile strikes the center of the field, dealing physical damage to every enemy unit and knocking them up for {C:BombSynergySystem.AIR_SEC} second (eggs excluded)."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:armorPen} 护甲穿透，导弹造成 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + 目标最大生命值 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% 的物理伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:armorPen} Armor Pen, the missile deals {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% of the target's max health as physical damage"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:armorPen} 护甲穿透，导弹造成 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + 目标最大生命值 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% 的物理伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:armorPen} Armor Pen, the missile deals {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% of the target's max health as physical damage"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:armorPen} 护甲穿透，导弹造成 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + 目标最大生命值 {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% 的物理伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:armorPen} Armor Pen, the missile deals {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + {C:BombSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% of the target's max health as physical damage"

msgid "每件匕首为携带者提供暴击伤害。"
msgstr "Each Dagger grants its carrier Crit Damage."

msgid "【刺杀】每个战场开始时，我方所有单位的下一次攻击必定暴击，暴击伤害额外提高，并获得 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "[Assassinate] When each battlefield begins, the next attack of every allied unit is a guaranteed critical strike with bonus Crit Damage and {C:DaggerSynergySystem.LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:critDmg}% 暴击伤害，刺杀额外暴击伤害 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[0]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:critDmg}% Crit Damage, Assassinate bonus Crit Damage {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[0]%}%"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:critDmg}% 暴击伤害，刺杀额外暴击伤害 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[1]%}%，每个战场开始 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} 秒后再触发一次"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:critDmg}% Crit Damage, Assassinate bonus Crit Damage {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[1]%}%, triggers again {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} seconds into combat"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:critDmg}% 暴击伤害，刺杀额外暴击伤害 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[2]%}%，每个战场开始 {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} 秒与 20 秒后各再触发一次"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:critDmg}% Crit Damage, Assassinate bonus Crit Damage {C:DaggerSynergySystem.EXTRA_CRIT_DMG[2]%}%, triggers again {C:DaggerSynergySystem.TRIGGER_GAP} and 20 seconds into combat"

msgid "每件魔法书为携带者提供增伤。"
msgstr "Each Magic Book grants its carrier Damage Amp."

msgid "【飞弹】我方单位（包括召唤物）每释放一次技能，按这次消耗的龟能召唤魔法飞弹，至少 1 枚。每枚飞向一名随机敌人，造成魔法伤害。"
msgstr "[Missiles] Whenever an allied unit (including summons) casts a skill, it summons Magic Missiles based on the Energy spent, at least 1. Each flies at a random enemy and deals magic damage."

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:dmgAmp}% 增伤，每消耗 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[0]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚飞弹，每枚造成 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + 目标 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:dmgAmp}% Damage Amp, 1 missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[0]} Energy spent, each dealing {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[0]} + {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[0]%}% of the target's max health as magic damage"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:dmgAmp}% 增伤，每消耗 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[1]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚飞弹，每枚造成 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + 目标 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:dmgAmp}% Damage Amp, 1 missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[1]} Energy spent, each dealing {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[1]} + {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[1]%}% of the target's max health as magic damage"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:dmgAmp}% 增伤，每消耗 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[2]} 点龟能召唤 1 枚飞弹，每枚造成 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + 目标 {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:dmgAmp}% Damage Amp, 1 missile per {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.PER_ENERGY[2]} Energy spent, each dealing {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_FLAT[2]} + {C:MagicbookSynergySystem.DMG_MAXHP[2]%}% of the target's max health as magic damage"

msgid "每件长矛为携带者提供龟能回复速率。"
msgstr "Each Spear grants its carrier Energy Regen."

msgid "【百夫长】每个战场开始 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} 秒后或我方生命值低于 {C:SpearSynergySystem.TEAM_HP_LINE%}% 时召唤百夫长，登场时击飞全场敌人 {C:SpearSynergySystem.KNOCK_SEC} 秒，造成 {C:SpearSynergySystem.ENTRY_COEF%}% 攻击力的魔法伤害。我方每有一件不同的长矛，按其星级每星使百夫长生命值与攻击力提高 {C:SpearSynergySystem.STAR_PCT%}%。"
msgstr "[Centurion] {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} seconds into combat, or when your team drops below {C:SpearSynergySystem.TEAM_HP_LINE%}% health, the Centurion is summoned. On landing it knocks up every enemy for {C:SpearSynergySystem.KNOCK_SEC} seconds and deals {C:SpearSynergySystem.ENTRY_COEF%}% attack damage as magic damage. For each different Spear on your team, each of its stars gives the Centurion {C:SpearSynergySystem.STAR_PCT%}% more health and attack damage."

msgid "【龟甲阵】百夫长龟能满时举盾 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒，受到的伤害降低 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SHIELD_DR%}%。"
msgstr "[Shell Formation] When the Centurion's Energy is full, it raises its shield for {C:SpearSynergySystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds, taking {C:SpearSynergySystem.SHIELD_DR%}% less damage."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长 {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[0]} 生命值、{C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[0]} 攻击力、{C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[0]} 护甲和魔抗"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy Regen, Centurion has {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[0]} health, {C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[0]} attack damage, {C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[0]} armor and magic resist"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长 {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[1]} 生命值、{C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[1]} 攻击力、{C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[1]} 护甲和魔抗。攻击贯穿直线，身后的敌人受到 {C:SpearSynergySystem.PIERCE_BEHIND%}% 伤害。放下盾时横扫周围敌人，造成 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SWEEP_COEF%}% 攻击力的魔法伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy Regen, Centurion has {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[1]} health, {C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[1]} attack damage, {C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[1]} armor and magic resist. Attacks pierce in a line, dealing {C:SpearSynergySystem.PIERCE_BEHIND%}% damage to enemies behind. Lowering the shield sweeps nearby enemies for {C:SpearSynergySystem.SWEEP_COEF%}% attack damage as magic damage"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长 {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[2]} 生命值、{C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[2]} 攻击力、{C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[2]} 护甲和魔抗。每次攻击使直线上每个敌人失去 1 点护甲和魔抗，至多 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SHRED_CAP} 点。举盾期间每 {C:SpearSynergySystem.POKE_IV} 秒对周围敌人造成 {C:SpearSynergySystem.POKE_COEF%}% 攻击力的魔法伤害"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy Regen, Centurion has {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[2]} health, {C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[2]} attack damage, {C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[2]} armor and magic resist. Each attack removes 1 armor and magic resist from each enemy in the line, up to {C:SpearSynergySystem.SHRED_CAP}. While the shield is raised, deals {C:SpearSynergySystem.POKE_COEF%}% attack damage as magic damage to nearby enemies every {C:SpearSynergySystem.POKE_IV} seconds"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长 {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[3]} 生命值、{C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[3]} 攻击力、{C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[3]} 护甲和魔抗。每第 {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_EVERY} 次攻击掷出长矛，贯穿沿途敌人，造成 {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_COEF%}% 攻击力的物理伤害。横扫后冲出 {C:SpearSynergySystem.CAV_N} 名持矛骑兵，造成百夫长 {C:SpearSynergySystem.CAV_COEF%}% 攻击力的物理伤害并击飞"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy Regen, Centurion has {C:SpearSynergySystem.HP[3]} health, {C:SpearSynergySystem.ATK[3]} attack damage, {C:SpearSynergySystem.RES[3]} armor and magic resist. Every {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_EVERY}th attack throws the spear, piercing enemies in the path for {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_COEF%}% attack damage as physical damage. After the sweep, {C:SpearSynergySystem.CAV_N} spear cavalry charge out, dealing {C:SpearSynergySystem.CAV_COEF%}% of the Centurion's attack damage as physical damage and knocking enemies up"

msgid "每件面具为携带者提供减伤。"
msgstr "Each Mask grants its carrier Damage Reduction."

msgid "【偷脸】每个战场开始时，从这个战场存活的敌方龟中随机挑选几只，在我方阵地召唤它们的复制体：最大生命值与攻击力为原版的 {C:MaskSynergySystem.COPY_HP%}%，其余属性与原版相同，照原版释放技能，带原版的装备且每件星级降一。"
msgstr "[Face Steal] When each battlefield begins, a few random living enemy turtles on this battlefield are chosen, and copies of them are summoned on your side: max health and attack damage are {C:MaskSynergySystem.COPY_HP%}% of the original, other stats match, they cast the original's skills, and carry its items with each item 1 star lower."

msgid "复制体阵亡时，把自身部分最大生命值、攻击力、护甲和魔抗永久给予最近的一名友军。"
msgstr "When a copy dies, it permanently gives part of its max health, attack damage, armor and magic resist to the nearest ally."

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:dmgRed}% 减伤，偷脸 {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[0]} 只，复制体阵亡时给予 {C:MaskSynergySystem.GIVE_PCT[0]%}% 属性"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:dmgRed}% Damage Reduction, steal {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[0]} face(s), copies give {C:MaskSynergySystem.GIVE_PCT[0]%}% of their stats on death"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:dmgRed}% 减伤，偷脸 {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[1]} 只，复制体阵亡时给予 {C:MaskSynergySystem.GIVE_PCT[1]%}% 属性"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:dmgRed}% Damage Reduction, steal {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[1]} faces, copies give {C:MaskSynergySystem.GIVE_PCT[1]%}% of their stats on death"

msgid "每件 +{STATpct:dmgRed}% 减伤，偷脸 {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[2]} 只，复制体阵亡时给予 {C:MaskSynergySystem.GIVE_PCT[2]%}% 属性"
msgstr "Each +{STATpct:dmgRed}% Damage Reduction, steal {C:MaskSynergySystem.STEAL_N[2]} faces, copies give {C:MaskSynergySystem.GIVE_PCT[2]%}% of their stats on death"

msgid "复制体不带原版的一星装备，带的装备不计入羁绊件数。"
msgstr "Copies don't carry the original's 1-star items, and their items don't count toward synergies."

msgid "每件遗物为携带者提供生命偷取。"
msgstr "Each Relic grants its carrier Lifesteal."

msgid "【生死界】我方单位生命值高于 {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% 时攻击力提高，低于时获得生命偷取。"
msgstr "[Life and Death] Your units gain attack damage above {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% health and Lifesteal below it."

msgid "【远古之力】每 {C:RelicSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒，全队永久获得增伤，持续到本局结束。"
msgstr "[Ancient Power] Every {C:RelicSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, your team permanently gains Damage Amp until the match ends."

msgid "【龟蛋加固】我方龟蛋获得最大生命值，并还击射程 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_RANGE} 内的敌人。"
msgstr "[Fortified Egg] Your Turtle Egg gains max health and strikes back at enemies within {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_RANGE} range."

msgid "【觉醒】每个战场开始 {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_SEC} 秒后，已累积的远古之力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_BOOST%}%。"
msgstr "[Awakening] {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_SEC} seconds after each battlefield begins, accumulated Ancient Power increases by {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_BOOST%}%."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% 生命偷取，生死界攻击力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[0]%}%、生命偷取 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[0]%}%"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% Lifesteal, Life and Death grants {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[0]%}% attack damage and {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[0]%}% Lifesteal"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% 生命偷取，生死界攻击力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[1]%}%、生命偷取 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[1]%}%，远古之力每次 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[1]%}%、至多 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[1]%}%，龟蛋 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[1]} 最大生命值、还击攻击力 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[1]}"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% Lifesteal, Life and Death grants {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[1]%}% attack damage and {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[1]%}% Lifesteal, Ancient Power +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[1]%}% each time up to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[1]%}%, egg +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[1]} max health with {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[1]} strike-back damage"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% 生命偷取，生死界攻击力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[2]%}%、生命偷取 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[2]%}%，远古之力每次 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[2]%}%、至多 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[2]%}%，龟蛋 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[2]} 最大生命值、还击攻击力 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[2]}"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% Lifesteal, Life and Death grants {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[2]%}% attack damage and {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[2]%}% Lifesteal, Ancient Power +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[2]%}% each time up to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[2]%}%, egg +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[2]} max health with {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[2]} strike-back damage"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% 生命偷取，生死界攻击力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[3]%}%、生命偷取 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[3]%}%，远古之力每次 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[3]%}%、至多 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[3]%}%，龟蛋 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[3]} 最大生命值、还击攻击力 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[3]}，觉醒"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_lifestealPct}% Lifesteal, Life and Death grants {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[3]%}% attack damage and {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[3]%}% Lifesteal, Ancient Power +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[3]%}% each time up to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[3]%}%, egg +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[3]} max health with {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[3]} strike-back damage, Awakening"

msgid "【血契】携带者每击杀一名敌人，刻下 1 道血契，至多 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_CAP} 道，整个大轮累计，大轮重置。多件仪式匕首共用同一份血契。"
msgstr "[Blood Pact] Each enemy the carrier kills carves 1 Blood Pact, up to {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_CAP}. Pacts accumulate over the whole Season and reset with it. Multiple Ritual Daggers share the same Pacts."

msgid "每道血契使全队攻击力提高 {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_TEAM_ATK%}%"
msgstr "Each Blood Pact increases your team's attack damage by {C:EqDaggerBatch.RITUAL_TEAM_ATK%}%"

msgid "【刻痕】携带者每造成 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.PER_MARK} 点伤害，刻下 1 道刻痕，至多 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.MARK_CAP} 道，跨对局保留，赛季重置。多件香火石共用同一份刻痕。"
msgstr "[Carving] Every {C:IncenseStoneSystem.PER_MARK} damage the carrier deals carves 1 mark, up to {C:IncenseStoneSystem.MARK_CAP}. Marks carry across matches and reset each Season. Multiple Incense Stones share the same marks."

msgid "每道刻痕使携带者获得 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_AMP%}% 增伤与 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_DR%}% 减伤，全队获得 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_AMP%}% 增伤与 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_DR%}% 减伤"
msgstr "Each mark gives the carrier {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_AMP%}% Damage Amp and {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_DR%}% Damage Reduction, and your team {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_AMP%}% Damage Amp and {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_DR%}% Damage Reduction"

msgid "装备小木斧即激活。重复买到的小木斧转化为砍伐经验。"
msgstr "Equipping a Little Wooden Axe activates it. Duplicate Little Wooden Axes become chopping experience."

msgid "商店每次刷新至少出现一把小木斧的概率为 {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_BASE%}%，本大轮每多打一局提高 {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_PER_MATCH%}%，至多 {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_CAP%}%"
msgstr "Each shop refresh has a {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_BASE%}% chance to include at least one Little Wooden Axe, +{C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_PER_MATCH%}% per match played this Season, up to {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_CAP%}%"

msgid "登场时召唤一座不可移动的【炮台】。\n携带者位于炮台附近时，获得 {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_BUFF_ASPD%}% 攻击速度。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an immobile [Turret].\nWhile the wearer is near the Turret, the wearer gains {C:EquipSystem.TURRET_BUFF_ASPD%}% attack speed."

msgid "登场时召唤一座不可移动的【炮台】，携带者在炮台附近时获得攻击速度。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an immobile [Turret]. The wearer gains attack speed while near it."

msgid "【百夫长】每个战场开始 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} 秒后或我方生命值低于 {C:SpearSynergySystem.TEAM_HP_LINE%}% 时召唤百夫长，每个战场一次。我方每有一件不同的长矛，按其星级每星使百夫长生命值与攻击力提高 {C:SpearSynergySystem.STAR_PCT%}%。"
msgstr "[Centurion] {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} seconds into each battlefield, or when your team drops below {C:SpearSynergySystem.TEAM_HP_LINE%}% health, summons the Centurion, once per battlefield. For each different Spear on your team, each of its stars gives the Centurion {C:SpearSynergySystem.STAR_PCT%}% more health and attack damage."

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，召唤百夫长"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy regen, summon the Centurion"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长的突刺贯穿直线，放下盾时横扫周围敌人"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy regen, the Centurion's thrust pierces in a line and it sweeps nearby enemies when lowering its shield"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长每次刺中削弱敌人的护甲和魔抗，举盾时持续刺击周围敌人"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy regen, the Centurion's hits shred armor and magic resist, and it keeps stabbing nearby enemies while shielded"

msgid "每件 +{STAT:_echargePct}% 龟能回复速率，百夫长每第 {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_EVERY} 次攻击掷出长矛，横扫后召来持矛骑兵冲锋"
msgstr "Each +{STAT:_echargePct}% Energy regen, every {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_EVERY}th Centurion attack throws a spear, and its sweep calls in charging lancers"

msgid "每件长矛为携带者提供 +5% 龟能回复速率 · 【百夫长】每个战场开始 {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} 秒后或我方生命值低于 {C:SpearSynergySystem.TEAM_HP_LINE%}% 时召唤百夫长，每个战场一次。我方每有一件不同的长矛，按其星级每星使百夫长生命值与攻击力提高 {C:SpearSynergySystem.STAR_PCT%}%"
msgstr "Each Spear gives its holder +5% Energy Regen · [Centurion] summoned {C:SpearSynergySystem.SUMMON_AT} seconds into each battle or when your team drops below {C:SpearSynergySystem.TEAM_HP_LINE%}% health, once per battle. For each different Spear you have, the Centurion gains {C:SpearSynergySystem.STAR_PCT%}% health and Attack per star"

msgid "每件长矛为携带者提供 +10% 龟能回复速率 · 百夫长的突刺贯穿直线，放下盾时横扫周围敌人"
msgstr "Each Spear gives its holder +10% Energy Regen · the Centurion's thrust pierces in a line and it sweeps nearby enemies when lowering its shield"

msgid "每件长矛为携带者提供 +16% 龟能回复速率 · 百夫长每次刺中削弱敌人的护甲和魔抗，举盾时持续刺击周围敌人"
msgstr "Each Spear gives its holder +16% Energy Regen · each Centurion hit shreds enemy Armor and Magic Resist, and it keeps stabbing nearby enemies while its shield is up"

msgid "每件长矛为携带者提供 +24% 龟能回复速率 · 百夫长每第 {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_EVERY} 次攻击掷出长矛，横扫后召来持矛骑兵冲锋"
msgstr "Each Spear gives its holder +24% Energy Regen · every {C:SpearSynergySystem.THROW_EVERY}th Centurion attack throws its spear, and its sweep calls in charging spear cavalry"

